msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryFeedbackExtensionalityLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain the selected graph, identities and source evidence; apply the canonical obligations in this module."
msgstr "保留选定图、身份及来源证据；应用本模块的规范义务。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryFeedbackExtensionalityLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A selected feedback body is an extensional set transformer: equal candidate input sets yield equal candidate output sets. Example declaration: gmeow:QueryFeedbackExtensionalityLaw rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/query-program> ."
msgstr "选定反馈体是外延集合变换：相等候选输入集产生相等候选输出集。 声明示例：gmeow:QueryFeedbackExtensionalityLaw rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/query-program> ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RankedEntryOwnerConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Ranked entry owner constraint"
msgstr "有序条目所属列表约束"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RankedEntryOwnerConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Every ranked entry belongs to exactly one ranked-list occurrence; reusing a candidate in another list requires another entry."
msgstr "每个有序条目恰好属于一个有序列表出现；在另一列表复用候选项需要另一条目。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RankedEntryOwnerConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use for ranked entry owner constraint with explicit source bindings."
msgstr "用于以明确来源绑定描述有序条目所属列表约束。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RankedEntryOwnerConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring execution, authorization or completeness from a declaration alone."
msgstr "避免仅从声明推断执行、授权或完整性。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RankedEntryOwnerConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain the selected graph, identities and source evidence; apply the canonical obligations in this module."
msgstr "保留选定图、身份及来源证据；应用本模块的规范义务。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RankedEntryOwnerConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Every ranked entry belongs to exactly one ranked-list occurrence; reusing a candidate in another list requires another entry. Example declaration: gmeow:RankedEntryOwnerConstraint rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/query-program> ."
msgstr "每个有序条目恰好属于一个有序列表出现；在另一列表复用候选项需要另一条目。 声明示例：gmeow:RankedEntryOwnerConstraint rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/query-program> ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryIterationDistinctPassConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Query iteration distinct-pass constraint"
msgstr "查询迭代不同轮次约束"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryIterationDistinctPassConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "One body execution cannot witness two positive state indices within the same measured iteration run."
msgstr "同一实测迭代运行内，一次循环体执行不能证明两个正状态索引。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryIterationDistinctPassConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use for query iteration distinct-pass constraint with explicit source bindings."
msgstr "用于以明确来源绑定描述查询迭代不同轮次约束。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryIterationDistinctPassConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring execution, authorization or completeness from a declaration alone."
msgstr "避免仅从声明推断执行、授权或完整性。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryIterationDistinctPassConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain the selected graph, identities and source evidence; apply the canonical obligations in this module."
msgstr "保留选定图、身份及来源证据；应用本模块的规范义务。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryIterationDistinctPassConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "One body execution cannot witness two positive state indices within the same measured iteration run. Example declaration: gmeow:QueryIterationDistinctPassConstraint rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/query-program> ."
msgstr "同一实测迭代运行内，一次循环体执行不能证明两个正状态索引。 声明示例：gmeow:QueryIterationDistinctPassConstraint rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/query-program> ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/query-program|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "query program"
msgstr "查询程序"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/query-program|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Canonical descriptions and evidence records for consumer-owned query graphs, fusion, loss-preserving merge, verdict choice and stratified feedback."
msgstr "消费者自有查询图、融合、保留损失的合并、判定选择及分层反馈的规范描述与证据记录。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/query-program|http://purl.org/dc/terms/title"
msgid "GMEOW Query Program Module"
msgstr "GMEOW查询程序模块"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/query-program|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/sliceConsumer"
msgid "Governed query stores and memory retrieval adapters describing their program graphs and source-reported outcomes."
msgstr "描述其程序图及来源报告结果的受治理查询存储和记忆检索适配器。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryFusionWeightFit|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Query Fusion Weight Fit"
msgstr "查询融合权重拟合"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryFusionWeightFit|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A source-reported evidence record of fitted retrieval-class weights against one exact judged-content resource. It retains a nonempty collection of supplied class-weight quantities without claiming that fitting was executed or verified here."
msgstr "来源报告的证据记录，记录针对一个确切的已评判内容资源拟合的检索类别权重。它保留由所提供的表示类别权重的量构成的非空集合，不声称此处执行或验证了拟合。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryFusionWeightFit|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain the judged evidence and measured class weights supplied with a query-program description."
msgstr "用于保留随查询程序描述提供的已评判证据及测得的类别权重。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryFusionWeightFit|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid treating a declared fit as held-out validation, a fitted-model artifact, an Observation or permission to change an existing fusion operator."
msgstr "避免将声明的拟合视为留出数据验证、已拟合模型制品、Observation 或更改现有融合算子的许可。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryFusionWeightFit|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain weightFitJudgedSet and every supplied fittedClassWeight quantity; keep fit identity and any source attribution separate from equal numeric values."
msgstr "保留 weightFitJudgedSet 及每个所提供的 fittedClassWeight 量；将拟合身份及任何来源归属与相等数值分开。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryFusionWeightFit|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Each fit has one judged-set identity. Distinct fits remain distinct even when they reference the same class-weight quantity or report equal values."
msgstr "每个拟合具有一个已评判集身份。不同拟合即使引用同一个表示类别权重的量或报告相等数值，仍保持不同。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryFusionWeightFit|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A supplied fit record: ex:fit a gmeow:QueryFusionWeightFit ; gmeow:weightFitJudgedSet ex:judgedContent ."
msgstr "所提供的拟合记录：ex:fit a gmeow:QueryFusionWeightFit ; gmeow:weightFitJudgedSet ex:judgedContent ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryFusionClassWeight|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Query Fusion Class Weight"
msgstr "查询融合类别权重"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryFusionClassWeight|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A supplied positive dimensionless quantitative value for one identified retrieval class in fusion-fit evidence. Its magnitude is carried by exact decimal math:quantityValue, not by a parallel weight-value property."
msgstr "融合拟合证据中，为一个已标识检索类别提供的为正且无量纲的定量值。其量值由精确十进制的 math:quantityValue 承载，而不是由并行的权重值属性承载。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryFusionClassWeight|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use for a measured class coefficient whose value, dimension and class identity must remain explicit."
msgstr "用于其值、量纲及类别身份必须保持明确的实测类别系数。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryFusionClassWeight|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid treating the weight as a probability, confidence, an InformationObject or evidence that a query operator applied weighted arithmetic."
msgstr "避免将权重视为概率、置信度、InformationObject 或查询算子应用了加权算术的证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryFusionClassWeight|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain one weightForClass resource, one positive xsd:decimal math:quantityValue and math:hasDimension math:dimensionless."
msgstr "保留一个 weightForClass 资源、一个取正 xsd:decimal 值的 math:quantityValue，以及 math:hasDimension math:dimensionless。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryFusionClassWeight|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The quantity has no unique fit owner. Sharing a supplied carrier across evidence records does not equate those fits or identify their judged sets."
msgstr "该量没有唯一的所属拟合。跨证据记录共享所提供载体，不会使这些拟合相等，也不会将其已评判集视为同一身份。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryFusionClassWeight|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A supplied quantitative carrier: ex:weight a gmeow:QueryFusionClassWeight ; math:hasDimension math:dimensionless ; math:quantityValue \"2.25\"^^xsd:decimal ."
msgstr "所提供的定量载体：ex:weight a gmeow:QueryFusionClassWeight ; math:hasDimension math:dimensionless ; math:quantityValue \"2.25\"^^xsd:decimal ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fusionWeightFit|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "fusion weight fit evidence"
msgstr "融合权重拟合证据"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fusionWeightFit|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Associates a query-program node description with supplied fusion class-weight fit evidence. The association alone does not state that the node used those weights or alter its arithmetic."
msgstr "将查询程序节点描述与所提供的融合类别权重拟合证据关联。仅有此关联并不声明节点使用了这些权重，也不改变其算术。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fusionWeightFit|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain one or more source-reported fit records alongside a node description."
msgstr "用于在节点描述旁保留一个或多个来源报告的拟合记录。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fusionWeightFit|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid interpreting this edge as weighted execution, a default fit or a single-fit restriction on a multi-source operation."
msgstr "避免将此边理解为加权执行、默认拟合或对多来源操作施加的单拟合限制。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fusionWeightFit|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Reference each original fit resource when supplied; preserve its judged-set and class-weight evidence independently of the node’s operator contract."
msgstr "在提供原始拟合资源时逐一引用；独立于节点的算子契约保留其已评判集及类别权重证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fusionWeightFit|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Optional and nonfunctional: multiple fits may coexist, including evidence from different source vaults. No missing fit, observation time or authorization is inferred."
msgstr "可选且非函数性：多个拟合可以共存，包括来自不同来源库的证据。不推断任何缺失拟合、观察时间或授权。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fusionWeightFit|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Two supplied fit records: ex:node gmeow:fusionWeightFit ex:fitA, ex:fitB ."
msgstr "两个所提供的拟合记录：ex:node gmeow:fusionWeightFit ex:fitA, ex:fitB ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fittedClassWeight|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "fitted class weight"
msgstr "拟合类别权重"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fittedClassWeight|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "One supplied class-weight quantity retained by a QueryFusionWeightFit. The fit preserves a nonempty collection and selects at most one quantity identity for each class."
msgstr "QueryFusionWeightFit 保留的、所提供的一个表示类别权重的量。拟合保留非空集合，并为每个类别至多选择一个量身份。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fittedClassWeight|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to expose the quantitative results of a source-reported class-weight fit."
msgstr "用于公开来源报告的类别权重拟合的定量结果。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fittedClassWeight|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid replacing unmeasured or unavailable fitting with fabricated unit weights or omitting a supplied class result."
msgstr "避免用虚构的单位权重替代未经测量或不可用的拟合，或遗漏所提供的类别结果。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fittedClassWeight|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Link each supplied QueryFusionClassWeight and retain its original class identity, decimal magnitude and dimensionless dimension."
msgstr "关联每个所提供的 QueryFusionClassWeight，并保留其原始类别身份、十进制量值及无量纲这一量纲。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fittedClassWeight|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "No inverse ownership restriction is imposed; a shared quantity reference neither merges fit records nor proves equal fitting evidence."
msgstr "不施加逆向归属限制；共享量引用既不合并拟合记录，也不证明拟合证据相等。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fittedClassWeight|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Two retained class quantities: ex:fit gmeow:fittedClassWeight ex:lexicalWeight, ex:spaceWeight ."
msgstr "两个保留的类别量：ex:fit gmeow:fittedClassWeight ex:lexicalWeight, ex:spaceWeight ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightForClass|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "weight for retrieval class"
msgstr "检索类别权重"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightForClass|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The exact supplied retrieval-class resource to which a class-weight quantity applies. It identifies a retrieval family or space without asserting that the resource is an RDF class."
msgstr "表示类别权重的量所适用的确切来源检索类别资源。它标识一个检索族或检索空间，不断言该资源是 RDF 类。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightForClass|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to keep the class identity of a measured coefficient separate from its numeric value."
msgstr "用于将实测系数的类别身份与其数值分开保留。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightForClass|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid deriving a class identity from a display label or coercing a retrieval class into an ontology Class."
msgstr "避免从显示标签推导类别身份，或将检索类别强制转换为本体 Class。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightForClass|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Reference one source-identified class resource on the quantity; retain distinct family or space identities even when their weights are equal."
msgstr "在该量上引用一个来源标识的类别资源；即使权重相等，也保留不同检索族或空间的身份。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightForClass|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The class coordinate is required and single-valued on this quantity carrier. It is not a global preference between classes or standpoints."
msgstr "此量载体上的类别坐标必需且为单值。它不是类别或立场之间的全局偏好。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightForClass|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A supplied class coordinate: ex:weight gmeow:weightForClass ex:retrievalClass ."
msgstr "所提供的类别坐标：ex:weight gmeow:weightForClass ex:retrievalClass ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightFitJudgedSet|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "weight fit judged set"
msgstr "权重拟合已评判集"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightFitJudgedSet|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The exact supplied judged-content information object against which a QueryFusionWeightFit was fitted. The relation retains the source evidence identity rather than its label or storage path."
msgstr "用于拟合 QueryFusionWeightFit 的确切来源已评判内容信息对象。该关系保留来源证据身份，而不是其标签或存储路径。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightFitJudgedSet|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to identify the judged evidence from which the retained class weights were measured."
msgstr "用于标识已评判证据，所保留类别权重是依据该证据测得的。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightFitJudgedSet|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inventing a judged-set identity, substituting a file path or treating in-sample fitting as held-out generalization."
msgstr "避免虚构已评判集身份、用文件路径替代该身份，或将样本内拟合视为留出数据上的泛化。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightFitJudgedSet|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Link the original judged-content resource and retain its own source attribution when supplied; keep it independent of the fit and quantity identities."
msgstr "关联原始已评判内容资源，并在提供其自身来源归属时加以保留；使该资源独立于拟合及量身份。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightFitJudgedSet|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "One judged-set resource is required per fit. This edge authenticates neither its contents nor the fitting method and supplies no missing measurement."
msgstr "每个拟合都要求一个已评判集资源。此边既不认证其内容或拟合方法，也不提供缺失测量。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightFitJudgedSet|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A supplied evidence identity: ex:fit gmeow:weightFitJudgedSet ex:judgedContent ."
msgstr "所提供的证据身份：ex:fit gmeow:weightFitJudgedSet ex:judgedContent ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionClassWeightPositiveLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "fusion class weight positive law"
msgstr "融合类别权重正值定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionClassWeightPositiveLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Every retained QueryFusionClassWeight magnitude is greater than exact decimal zero. The quantity’s required decimal datatype and dimension remain separate canonical obligations."
msgstr "每个保留的 QueryFusionClassWeight 量值都大于精确十进制零。该量所要求的十进制数据类型及量纲仍是独立的规范义务。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionClassWeightPositiveLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to reject zero or negative supplied class-weight magnitudes."
msgstr "用于拒绝所提供类别权重中为零或为负的量值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionClassWeightPositiveLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid accepting a missing magnitude as zero, treating positivity as probability normalization or interpreting a value as applied fusion arithmetic."
msgstr "避免将缺失量值作为零接受、将正值视为概率归一化，或将某个值理解为已应用的融合算术。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionClassWeightPositiveLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Bind the quantity’s supplied math:quantityValue and compare it with exact decimal zero through logic:termGreater."
msgstr "绑定该量所提供的 math:quantityValue，并通过 logic:termGreater 将其与精确十进制零比较。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionClassWeightPositiveLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "This law checks the declared numeric value; it neither fits a weight nor certifies its evidence or usefulness."
msgstr "此定律检查声明数值；它既不拟合权重，也不认证其证据或实用性。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionClassWeightPositiveLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A magnitude obligation: gmeow:FusionClassWeightPositiveLaw logic:formalizes gmeow:QueryFusionClassWeight ."
msgstr "量值义务：gmeow:FusionClassWeightPositiveLaw logic:formalizes gmeow:QueryFusionClassWeight ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionFitClassWeightUniquenessLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "fusion fit class weight uniqueness law"
msgstr "融合拟合类别权重唯一性定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionFitClassWeightUniquenessLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Within one QueryFusionWeightFit, two retained quantities naming the same retrieval class must be the same selected quantity resource. Different classes may retain equal magnitudes."
msgstr "在同一个 QueryFusionWeightFit 中，两个命名同一检索类别的保留量必须是同一个选定量资源。不同类别可以保留相等量值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionFitClassWeightUniquenessLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to prevent competing quantity identities for one class inside a fit record."
msgstr "用于防止拟合记录内同一类别具有相互竞争的量身份。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionFitClassWeightUniquenessLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid equating distinct fits from equal class values or imposing a unique fit owner on a quantity."
msgstr "避免因类别值相等而将不同拟合视为相同，或为量施加唯一所属拟合限制。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionFitClassWeightUniquenessLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Compare each pair of retained class-weight quantities sharing the same weightForClass resource through logic:termEqual."
msgstr "通过 logic:termEqual 比较共享同一 weightForClass 资源的每一对表示类别权重的保留量。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionFitClassWeightUniquenessLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The law preserves one quantity identity per class within a fit without choosing a preferred class, merging judged sets or manufacturing a measurement."
msgstr "此定律在一个拟合内为每个类别保留唯一的量身份，不选择偏好类别、不合并已评判集，也不制造测量。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionFitClassWeightUniquenessLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A fit-identity obligation: gmeow:FusionFitClassWeightUniquenessLaw logic:formalizes gmeow:fittedClassWeight ."
msgstr "拟合身份义务：gmeow:FusionFitClassWeightUniquenessLaw logic:formalizes gmeow:fittedClassWeight ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryCandidateUnion|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Query Candidate Union"
msgstr "查询候选并集"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryCandidateUnion|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A query-node description taking the exact candidate and original loss identity unions of selected class-ranked answers while retaining their original ranked-list resources. It supplies no aggregate fusion score or global merit order."
msgstr "一种查询节点描述，对所选类别内有序答案的候选项及原始损失身份分别取精确并集，同时保留其原始有序列表资源。它不提供聚合融合分数或全局优劣顺序。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryCandidateUnion|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use for a union stage that preserves class-local ranks and source evidence before later ordering or scoring."
msgstr "用于在后续排序或评分之前保留类别内名次及来源证据的并集阶段。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryCandidateUnion|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid treating per-class ranks as a global order, fabricating successful empty family answers or identifying this operation with reciprocal rank fusion."
msgstr "避免将各类别名次视为全局顺序、为检索族虚构成功的空答案，或将此操作等同于倒数名次融合。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryCandidateUnion|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Use mergeAnswerInput for original RankedQueryList resources and mergeAnswerOutput for one QueryUnionAnswer; retain each selected list’s supplied class binding."
msgstr "使用 mergeAnswerInput 关联原始 RankedQueryList 资源，使用 mergeAnswerOutput 关联一个 QueryUnionAnswer；保留每个所选列表提供的类别绑定。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryCandidateUnion|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The inherited merge contract requires at least one input and exactly one output. Explicitly empty evaluated lists and ledgers remain valid; no zero-input operation is defined."
msgstr "继承的合并契约要求至少一个输入且恰好一个输出。显式为空的已求值列表和空账本仍有效；不定义零输入操作。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryCandidateUnion|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A supplied union description: ex:union a gmeow:QueryCandidateUnion ; gmeow:mergeAnswerInput ex:list ; gmeow:mergeAnswerOutput ex:answer ."
msgstr "所提供的并集描述：ex:union a gmeow:QueryCandidateUnion ; gmeow:mergeAnswerInput ex:list ; gmeow:mergeAnswerOutput ex:answer ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryUnionAnswer|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Query Union Answer"
msgstr "查询并集答案"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryUnionAnswer|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "An attributed unranked union answer retaining the selected original class-ranked lists, their exact candidate union and their original loss identities. Listed candidates have no union-wide merit order or aggregate score from this stage."
msgstr "带有归属且不作排名的并集答案，保留所选原始类别内有序列表、其精确候选并集及其原始损失身份。所列候选项不从此阶段获得覆盖整个并集的优劣顺序或聚合分数。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryUnionAnswer|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain a union result without replacing the evidence of its contributing class answers."
msgstr "用于保留并集结果，同时不替换各贡献类别答案的证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryUnionAnswer|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid assigning a global input rank from serialization order or turning an absent aggregate score into zero."
msgstr "避免从序列化顺序赋予全局输入名次，或将缺失的聚合分数变成零。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryUnionAnswer|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Keep queryAnswerFor and queryLossLedger, retain queryCandidate membership and link the original class lists through unionClassList."
msgstr "保留 queryAnswerFor 及 queryLossLedger，保留 queryCandidate 成员关系，并通过 unionClassList 关联原始类别列表。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryUnionAnswer|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Standalone records acquire no required class-list path. When linked as a QueryCandidateUnion output, the directional list laws require exactly its selected input lists."
msgstr "独立记录不增加必需的类别列表路径。关联为 QueryCandidateUnion 输出时，列表的双向定律要求恰好保留该节点所选的输入列表。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryUnionAnswer|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A supplied union answer: ex:answer a gmeow:QueryUnionAnswer ; gmeow:unionClassList ex:list ."
msgstr "所提供的并集答案：ex:answer a gmeow:QueryUnionAnswer ; gmeow:unionClassList ex:list ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/unionClassList|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "union class list"
msgstr "并集类别列表"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/unionClassList|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "An original RankedQueryList resource retained by a QueryUnionAnswer. It preserves that list’s own entry occurrences, source ranks, tie keys and associated evidence without copying entries into a global ranking."
msgstr "QueryUnionAnswer 保留的原始 RankedQueryList 资源。它保留该列表自身的条目出现、来源名次、并列键及关联证据，不将条目复制到全局排名中。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/unionClassList|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to expose the original class-local evidence alongside an unranked union answer."
msgstr "用于在不作排名的并集答案旁公开原始类别内证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/unionClassList|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid minting replacement list or entry identities, merging lists by class label or discarding per-class evidence because the union has no aggregate score."
msgstr "避免创建替代列表或条目身份、按类别标签合并列表，或因并集没有聚合分数而丢弃各类别证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/unionClassList|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Reference each original list; for an answer linked to a union node, retain every selected input list and no unrelated list."
msgstr "引用每个原始列表；对于关联到并集节点的答案，保留每个所选输入列表，且不保留无关列表。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/unionClassList|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Nonfunctional membership permits several lists, including lists naming the same source class. Retention changes no class-local scores into a union-wide score."
msgstr "非函数性成员关系允许多个列表，包括命名同一来源类别的列表。保留操作不将任何类别内分数变成覆盖整个并集的分数。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/unionClassList|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Two retained original lists: ex:answer gmeow:unionClassList ex:listA, ex:listB ."
msgstr "两个保留的原始列表：ex:answer gmeow:unionClassList ex:listA, ex:listB ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rankedListClass|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "ranked list retrieval class"
msgstr "有序列表检索类别"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rankedListClass|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The supplied retrieval-class resource identified by a RankedQueryList, such as a family or space identity. The relation does not type the resource as an RDF class or derive its identity from a display label."
msgstr "RankedQueryList 所标识的来源检索类别资源，例如检索族或空间身份。该关系不将资源标为 RDF 类，也不从显示标签推导其身份。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rankedListClass|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain the source class of a ranked list selected by a candidate union."
msgstr "用于保留候选并集所选有序列表的来源类别。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rankedListClass|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inventing a class binding for an old list, inferring a preferred class or requiring different lists to have different classes."
msgstr "避免为旧列表虚构类别绑定、推断偏好类别，或要求不同列表具有不同类别。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rankedListClass|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Reference at most one supplied class resource on a list. A QueryCandidateUnion requires this binding only on its selected inputs."
msgstr "在一个列表上至多引用一个所提供类别资源。QueryCandidateUnion 仅要求其所选输入具有此绑定。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rankedListClass|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Optional on ordinary RankedQueryList records, with a class-local at-most-one bound and no required-path closure. Multiple lists may share the same class resource."
msgstr "在普通 RankedQueryList 记录上可选，至多单值约束限定在 RankedQueryList 类内，且没有必需路径闭包。多个列表可以共享同一类别资源。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rankedListClass|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A supplied class identity: ex:list gmeow:rankedListClass ex:retrievalClass ."
msgstr "所提供的类别身份：ex:list gmeow:rankedListClass ex:retrievalClass ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/UnionInputListRetentionLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "union input list retention law"
msgstr "并集输入列表保留定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/UnionInputListRetentionLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Every selected input list of a QueryCandidateUnion is retained by its output answer through unionClassList using the same list resource."
msgstr "QueryCandidateUnion 的每个所选输入列表，都由其输出答案通过 unionClassList 使用同一列表资源保留。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/UnionInputListRetentionLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use for the input-to-output direction of exact class-list retention."
msgstr "用于精确类别列表保留的输入到输出方向。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/UnionInputListRetentionLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid satisfying retention with a copied list, copied ranked entries or only the input’s candidate labels."
msgstr "避免用复制的列表、复制的有序条目或仅用输入候选项标签来满足保留要求。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/UnionInputListRetentionLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "For each selected mergeAnswerInput and the union’s mergeAnswerOutput, require unionClassList to reference that original input resource."
msgstr "针对每个所选 mergeAnswerInput 及并集的 mergeAnswerOutput，要求 unionClassList 引用该原始输入资源。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/UnionInputListRetentionLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "This preserves list-local evidence and works with the inherited candidate and loss identity unions; it does not synthesize a global rank."
msgstr "此要求保留列表内证据，并与继承的候选并集及损失身份并集配合；它不合成全局名次。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/UnionInputListRetentionLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A retention obligation: gmeow:UnionInputListRetentionLaw logic:formalizes gmeow:unionClassList ."
msgstr "保留义务：gmeow:UnionInputListRetentionLaw logic:formalizes gmeow:unionClassList ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/UnionRetainedListSourceLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "union retained list source law"
msgstr "并集保留列表来源定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/UnionRetainedListSourceLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Every class list retained by the linked output of a QueryCandidateUnion is one of that node’s selected original input lists."
msgstr "QueryCandidateUnion 所关联输出保留的每个类别列表，都是该节点所选原始输入列表之一。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/UnionRetainedListSourceLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use for the output-to-input direction that excludes unrelated retained lists."
msgstr "用于排除无关保留列表的输出到输入方向。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/UnionRetainedListSourceLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid accepting an extra list merely because it has the same class, ranks or candidate membership as a selected input."
msgstr "避免仅因额外列表与所选输入具有相同类别、名次或候选成员关系就接受该列表。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/UnionRetainedListSourceLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Join the union to its output and each retained list, then require the same list resource as mergeAnswerInput."
msgstr "将并集与其输出及每个保留列表连接，然后要求同一列表资源作为 mergeAnswerInput。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/UnionRetainedListSourceLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The law constrains linked union outputs; it does not impose list membership or an owner on an otherwise standalone answer."
msgstr "此定律约束关联的并集输出；它不对原本独立的答案施加列表成员关系或所属者。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/UnionRetainedListSourceLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A source-list obligation: gmeow:UnionRetainedListSourceLaw logic:formalizes gmeow:unionClassList ."
msgstr "来源列表义务：gmeow:UnionRetainedListSourceLaw logic:formalizes gmeow:unionClassList ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/UnionSelectedListClassLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "union selected list class law"
msgstr "并集所选列表类别定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/UnionSelectedListClassLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Each RankedQueryList selected as a QueryCandidateUnion input retains a supplied retrieval-class resource through rankedListClass."
msgstr "选作 QueryCandidateUnion 输入的每个 RankedQueryList 都通过 rankedListClass 保留所提供的检索类别资源。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/UnionSelectedListClassLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to require class identity for selected union inputs without changing the required fields of ordinary ranked lists."
msgstr "用于要求所选并集输入具有类别身份，同时不改变普通有序列表的必需字段。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/UnionSelectedListClassLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid manufacturing a class identity, selecting it from a human label or adding a global required-path closure."
msgstr "避免制造类别身份、从人类可读标签中选择该身份，或添加全局必需路径闭包。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/UnionSelectedListClassLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "For every selected input, retain an explicit rankedListClass resource; the existing optional at-most-one bound keeps that list’s coordinate single-valued."
msgstr "为每个所选输入保留显式 rankedListClass 资源；此可选绑定现有的至多单值约束使该列表坐标保持单值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/UnionSelectedListClassLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The class witness is supplied source evidence, not an instruction to create one or a requirement of one list per class."
msgstr "类别见证是来源提供的证据，不是创建见证的指令，也不是每个类别只能有一个列表的要求。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/UnionSelectedListClassLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A selected-class obligation: gmeow:UnionSelectedListClassLaw logic:formalizes gmeow:rankedListClass ."
msgstr "所选类别义务：gmeow:UnionSelectedListClassLaw logic:formalizes gmeow:rankedListClass ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankAuthority|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Query Rerank Authority"
msgstr "查询重排权威记录"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankAuthority|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A supplied information record identifying a reranker’s score context through opaque source identity bytes, provider score-kind wording, declared mathematical dimension and actual reference frame. It retains the source declaration without authenticating it or identifying a provider agent or model."
msgstr "所提供的信息记录，通过不透明来源身份字节、提供方的分数种类措辞、声明的数学量纲及实际参照系，标识重排器的评分上下文。它保留来源声明，不认证该声明，也不标识提供方代理或模型。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankAuthority|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain the identity and context supplied for reported rerank scores."
msgstr "用于保留为已报告重排分数提供的身份及上下文。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankAuthority|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid treating the record as a model, execution occurrence, probability calibration or proof that a provider served a request."
msgstr "避免将此记录视为模型、一次执行、概率校准，或提供方已处理请求的证明。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankAuthority|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Supply one rerankAuthorityIdentity, rerankScoreKind, rerankScoreDimension and hasReferenceFrame; keep the record separate from its frame and quantitative scores."
msgstr "为 rerankAuthorityIdentity、rerankScoreKind、rerankScoreDimension 及 hasReferenceFrame 各提供一个值；将该记录与其参照系及定量分数分开。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankAuthority|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Distinct authority records may retain the same opaque identity bytes. Equal identity, kind, dimension or frame does not merge those records or certify their source."
msgstr "不同权威记录可以保留相同的不透明身份字节。相等的身份、种类、量纲或参照系不会合并这些记录，也不认证其来源。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankAuthority|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A supplied authority record: ex:authority a gmeow:QueryRerankAuthority ; gmeow:rerankAuthorityIdentity \"00a1\"^^xsd:hexBinary ; gmeow:rerankScoreKind \"relevance-logit\" ; gmeow:rerankScoreDimension math:dimensionless ; gmeow:hasReferenceFrame ex:scoreFrame ."
msgstr "所提供的权威记录：ex:authority a gmeow:QueryRerankAuthority ; gmeow:rerankAuthorityIdentity \"00a1\"^^xsd:hexBinary ; gmeow:rerankScoreKind \"relevance-logit\" ; gmeow:rerankScoreDimension math:dimensionless ; gmeow:hasReferenceFrame ex:scoreFrame ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankScore|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Query Rerank Score"
msgstr "查询重排分数"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankScore|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A supplied finite IEEE 754 single precision rerank score carried as a math:Quantity. Its one xsd:float magnitude, declared dimension and actual reference frame accompany one source authority, without claiming an exact real target or an approximation error."
msgstr "以 math:Quantity 承载的所提供有限 IEEE 754 单精度重排分数。其单个 xsd:float 量值、声明量纲及实际参照系随同一个来源权威记录保留，不声称存在精确实数目标或近似误差。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankScore|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain a reported finite single precision score with its source authority and quantitative context."
msgstr "用于保留已报告的有限单精度分数及其来源权威记录和定量上下文。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankScore|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid treating the score as a probability, confidence, exact decimal, model artifact or approximation of an identified exact number merely because its datatype is floating point."
msgstr "避免仅因数据类型为浮点，就将此分数视为概率、置信度、精确十进制数、模型制品或某个已标识精确数的近似。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankScore|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Supply one math:quantityValue typed xsd:float, one math:hasDimension, one hasReferenceFrame and one rerankScoreAuthority; match dimension and frame to the authority."
msgstr "提供一个 xsd:float 类型的 math:quantityValue、一个 math:hasDimension、一个 hasReferenceFrame 及一个 rerankScoreAuthority；使量纲和参照系与权威记录一致。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankScore|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Finite negative values and zero are allowed. This explicit carrier profile rejects missing context, nonfinite values and other numeric datatypes without replacing or reclassifying the source score."
msgstr "允许有限负值及零。此显式载体配置拒绝上下文缺失、非有限值及其他数值数据类型，不替换来源分数，也不重新对其分类。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankScore|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A supplied negative score: ex:score a gmeow:QueryRerankScore ; math:quantityValue \"-1.25\"^^xsd:float ; math:hasDimension math:dimensionless ; gmeow:hasReferenceFrame ex:scoreFrame ; gmeow:rerankScoreAuthority ex:authority ."
msgstr "所提供的负分数：ex:score a gmeow:QueryRerankScore ; math:quantityValue \"-1.25\"^^xsd:float ; math:hasDimension math:dimensionless ; gmeow:hasReferenceFrame ex:scoreFrame ; gmeow:rerankScoreAuthority ex:authority ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankScoreAuthority|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "rerank score authority"
msgstr "重排分数权威记录"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankScoreAuthority|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The supplied QueryRerankAuthority declaring the identity and context of one reported rerank score. The score retains its own quantitative dimension and frame, which agree with that declaration."
msgstr "所提供的 QueryRerankAuthority，声明一个已报告重排分数的身份及上下文。分数保留其自身的定量量纲及参照系，两者与该声明一致。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankScoreAuthority|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to make a retained quantitative score’s source context explicit."
msgstr "用于明确保留的定量分数的来源上下文。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankScoreAuthority|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring a provider agent, model identity, execution or unique inverse owner from this association."
msgstr "避免从此关联推断提供方代理、模型身份、执行或唯一逆向所属者。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankScoreAuthority|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Link the score to one supplied authority record and retain the original opaque identity bytes and provider wording on that record."
msgstr "将分数关联至一个所提供权威记录，并在该记录上保留原始不透明身份字节及提供方措辞。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankScoreAuthority|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Exactly one authority is required per score in this profile. Several scores may reference one authority, and shared values do not identify distinct authority records."
msgstr "此配置要求每个分数恰好有一个权威记录。多个分数可以引用同一权威记录，共享值不会使不同权威记录具有同一身份。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankScoreAuthority|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A supplied context association: ex:score gmeow:rerankScoreAuthority ex:authority ."
msgstr "所提供的上下文关联：ex:score gmeow:rerankScoreAuthority ex:authority ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankAuthorityIdentity|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "rerank authority identity"
msgstr "重排权威记录身份"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankAuthorityIdentity|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The opaque identity bytes supplied by the source for a rerank authority, preserved as an xsd:hexBinary literal through lang:literalValue. The bytes retain the source identity rather than a fabricated semantic IRI."
msgstr "来源为重排权威记录提供的不透明身份字节，通过 lang:literalValue 以 xsd:hexBinary 字面量保留。这些字节保留来源身份，而不是虚构的语义 IRI。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankAuthorityIdentity|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when the source reports a native byte identity for the scoring authority."
msgstr "用于来源为评分权威记录报告原生字节身份的情形。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankAuthorityIdentity|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inventing a hash algorithm, fixed byte length, model identity, source authentication or IRI from the bytes."
msgstr "避免根据这些字节虚构哈希算法、固定字节长度、模型身份、来源认证或 IRI。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankAuthorityIdentity|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain the actual byte sequence in one xsd:hexBinary literal on the authority record; preserve its meaning under the source’s identity contract."
msgstr "在权威记录上用一个 xsd:hexBinary 字面量保留实际字节序列；按来源身份契约保留其含义。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankAuthorityIdentity|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "This required single coordinate imposes no global identity key or inverse uniqueness. Different records may carry the same bytes, and lexical hex spelling is not an additional identity claim."
msgstr "此必需单坐标不施加全局身份键或逆向唯一性。不同记录可以携带相同字节，十六进制的词法拼写也不是额外的身份断言。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankAuthorityIdentity|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Opaque source bytes: ex:authority gmeow:rerankAuthorityIdentity \"00a1\"^^xsd:hexBinary ."
msgstr "不透明来源字节：ex:authority gmeow:rerankAuthorityIdentity \"00a1\"^^xsd:hexBinary ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankScoreKind|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "rerank score kind"
msgstr "重排分数种类"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankScoreKind|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The provider’s supplied wording for what a rerank score represents, retained unchanged as an xsd:string literal on its authority record. The wording is context evidence rather than a calibrated mathematical interpretation."
msgstr "提供方对于重排分数所表示内容的原始措辞，在其权威记录上原样保留为 xsd:string 字面量。该措辞是上下文证据，而不是经过校准的数学解释。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankScoreKind|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to preserve provider score-kind wording beside the quantitative score context."
msgstr "用于在定量分数上下文旁保留提供方的分数种类措辞。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankScoreKind|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring probability, log-odds, confidence, calibration, dimension or rescaling rules from a word or the observed numeric range alone."
msgstr "避免仅从某个词或观察到的数值范围推断概率、对数赔率、置信度、校准、量纲或重缩放规则。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankScoreKind|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Copy the supplied wording into one xsd:string literal and retain the authority’s separately declared dimension and reference frame."
msgstr "将所提供措辞复制到一个 xsd:string 字面量中，并保留权威记录单独声明的量纲及参照系。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankScoreKind|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The value is open provider wording, not an enumerated ontology class or a natural-language grammar. No automatic default or normalization is defined."
msgstr "该值是提供方的开放措辞，不是枚举的本体类或自然语言语法。不定义自动默认值或规范化。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankScoreKind|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Supplied provider wording: ex:authority gmeow:rerankScoreKind \"relevance-logit\" ."
msgstr "所提供的提供方措辞：ex:authority gmeow:rerankScoreKind \"relevance-logit\" ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankScoreDimension|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "rerank score dimension"
msgstr "重排分数量纲"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankScoreDimension|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The mathematical Dimension explicitly declared by a source authority for its reported rerank scores. It describes the expected dimension of those quantities without making the information record itself a Quantity."
msgstr "来源权威记录为其报告的重排分数显式声明的数学 Dimension。它描述这些量的预期量纲，不使该信息记录本身成为 Quantity。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankScoreDimension|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain the source-declared dimension against which a score’s own math:hasDimension is checked."
msgstr "用于保留来源声明量纲，以据此检查分数自身的 math:hasDimension。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankScoreDimension|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid assuming every score is dimensionless, inferring dimension from score-kind wording or confusing mathematical dimension with tensor shape or reference-frame axis count."
msgstr "避免假定每个分数都无量纲、从分数种类措辞推断量纲，或将数学量纲与张量形状或参照系轴数混淆。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankScoreDimension|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Link the authority to one supplied math:Dimension resource and retain that same dimension on each associated score through math:hasDimension."
msgstr "将权威记录关联至一个所提供的 math:Dimension 资源，并通过 math:hasDimension 在每个关联分数上保留同一量纲。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankScoreDimension|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Equal dimensions do not establish score comparability across authorities or replace their actual reference frames. Missing dimension is an invalid selected profile, not permission to insert a default."
msgstr "相等量纲不确立不同权威记录之间的分数可比性，也不替代其实际参照系。量纲缺失使所选配置无效，而非允许插入默认值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankScoreDimension|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "An explicitly supplied dimension: ex:authority gmeow:rerankScoreDimension math:dimensionless ."
msgstr "显式提供的量纲：ex:authority gmeow:rerankScoreDimension math:dimensionless ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankFiniteScoreLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "query rerank finite score law"
msgstr "查询重排有限分数定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankFiniteScoreLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Every retained QueryRerankScore magnitude is a well-formed finite numeric literal. Required xsd:float datatype, magnitude presence and single value are separate canonical restrictions on the selected carrier."
msgstr "每个保留的 QueryRerankScore 量值都是格式正确的有限数值字面量。必需的 xsd:float 数据类型、量值存在及单值性是所选载体上的独立规范限制。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankFiniteScoreLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to reject NaN, floating infinities and malformed numeric magnitudes in this finite reported score profile."
msgstr "用于在此有限已报告分数配置中拒绝 NaN、浮点无穷及格式错误的数值量值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankFiniteScoreLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid replacing a rejected value, dropping its candidate, reclassifying it as unscored or treating a missing magnitude as zero."
msgstr "避免替换被拒绝的值、删除其候选项、将其重新分类为无分数，或将缺失量值视为零。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankFiniteScoreLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Bind each score’s math:quantityValue and require the unary intrinsic logic:termIsFiniteNumeric for that value."
msgstr "绑定每个分数的 math:quantityValue，并要求该值满足一元内建项 logic:termIsFiniteNumeric。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankFiniteScoreLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "This law validates declared magnitude admission only. It neither invokes a provider nor certifies arbitrary provider interfaces, score rendering, calibration or usefulness."
msgstr "此定律仅验证声明量值的接纳。它不调用提供方，也不认证任意提供方接口、分数呈现、校准或实用性。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankFiniteScoreLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A finite-value obligation: gmeow:QueryRerankFiniteScoreLaw logic:formalizes gmeow:QueryRerankScore ."
msgstr "有限值义务：gmeow:QueryRerankFiniteScoreLaw logic:formalizes gmeow:QueryRerankScore ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankScoreContextLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "query rerank score context law"
msgstr "查询重排分数上下文定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankScoreContextLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Each QueryRerankScore has the same mathematical dimension and actual reference frame as its linked source authority declares. The score, authority and frame retain distinct identities."
msgstr "每个 QueryRerankScore 都具有与其关联来源权威记录所声明的相同数学量纲及实际参照系。分数、权威记录和参照系保留不同身份。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankScoreContextLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to reject a score whose dimension or frame disagrees with its authority record."
msgstr "用于拒绝量纲或参照系与其权威记录不一致的分数。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankScoreContextLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid treating matching context as authentication, calibration, cross-provider comparability or a reason to merge authority records."
msgstr "避免将上下文一致视为认证、校准、跨提供方可比性或合并权威记录的理由。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankScoreContextLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Bind the score, authority, both dimension resources and both frame resources; compare each corresponding pair through logic:termEqual."
msgstr "绑定分数、权威记录、两个量纲资源及两个参照系资源；通过 logic:termEqual 比较每一对对应资源。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankScoreContextLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Required coordinate restrictions handle missing values separately. Agreement is over actual dimension and ReferenceFrame resources, never replacement text or a hidden frame default."
msgstr "必需坐标限制单独处理缺失值。一致性针对实际量纲和 ReferenceFrame 资源，绝不针对替代文本或隐含参照系默认值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankScoreContextLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A context-agreement obligation: gmeow:QueryRerankScoreContextLaw logic:formalizes gmeow:QueryRerankScore ."
msgstr "上下文一致义务：gmeow:QueryRerankScoreContextLaw logic:formalizes gmeow:QueryRerankScore ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerank|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Query Rerank"
msgstr "查询重排"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerank|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A query-operation description retaining an original candidate union and an attributed rerank answer under an explicitly selected finite reported score profile. It describes the operation without asserting that an execution occurred."
msgstr "一种查询操作描述，在显式选择的有限已报告分数配置下，保留原始候选并集及带有归属的重排答案。它描述操作，不断言执行已经发生。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerank|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to describe a rerank stage that accounts for every original candidate and preserves its original union evidence."
msgstr "用于描述交代每个原始候选项并保留其原始并集证据的重排阶段。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerank|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid treating the description as a provider invocation, filtering operation or replacement for the original class-ranked lists."
msgstr "避免将此描述视为提供方调用、过滤操作或原始类别内有序列表的替代。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerank|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Supply one rerankInput, one rerankOutput and rerankScoreProfile rerankFiniteFloatProfile, together with the inherited node effect and stratum declarations."
msgstr "提供一个 rerankInput、一个 rerankOutput 及 rerankScoreProfile rerankFiniteFloatProfile，连同继承的节点效应及层级声明。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerank|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The selected contract retains supplied outcomes and positions. It checks scored-before-unscored grouping and unscored-tail order, without certifying the source’s floating-point sort algorithm."
msgstr "所选契约保留所提供的结果及位置。它检查有分数条目先于无分数条目的分组及无分数尾部顺序，不认证来源的浮点排序算法。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerank|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A declared stage: ex:stage a gmeow:QueryRerank ; gmeow:rerankInput ex:union ; gmeow:rerankOutput ex:answer ; gmeow:rerankScoreProfile gmeow:rerankFiniteFloatProfile ."
msgstr "声明的阶段：ex:stage a gmeow:QueryRerank ; gmeow:rerankInput ex:union ; gmeow:rerankOutput ex:answer ; gmeow:rerankScoreProfile gmeow:rerankFiniteFloatProfile ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankAnswer|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Query Rerank Answer"
msgstr "查询重排答案"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankAnswer|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "An attributed supplied rerank result retaining its original QueryUnionAnswer, exactly one outcome occurrence per original candidate, reported source and output positions, and all original losses with any additional stage losses."
msgstr "带有归属的所提供重排结果，保留其原始 QueryUnionAnswer、每个原始候选项恰好一个结果出现项、报告的来源位置及输出位置，以及全部原始损失和任何额外阶段损失。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankAnswer|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain a complete account of the scored and unscored candidates reported by a selected rerank stage."
msgstr "用于完整记录所选重排阶段报告的有分数及无分数候选项。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankAnswer|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid discarding unscored candidates, replacing original class ranks with a global rank or inferring completeness from an empty ledger."
msgstr "避免丢弃无分数候选项、用全局名次替代原始类别名次，或从空账本推断完整性。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankAnswer|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain rerankedUnion, the explicit rerankScoreProfile, every rerankEntry and queryCandidate, and the inherited query and loss-ledger coordinates."
msgstr "保留 rerankedUnion、显式 rerankScoreProfile、每个 rerankEntry 和 queryCandidate，以及继承的查询及损失账本坐标。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankAnswer|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "A scored entry requires an answer authority matching the score’s own authority record. An all-unscored answer may omit authority, and an empty input admits an empty result collection."
msgstr "有分数条目要求答案权威记录与分数自身权威记录相同。全无分数答案可省略权威记录，空输入允许空结果集合。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankAnswer|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A supplied result: ex:answer a gmeow:QueryRerankAnswer ; gmeow:rerankedUnion ex:union ; gmeow:rerankScoreProfile gmeow:rerankFiniteFloatProfile ; gmeow:rerankEntry ex:entry ."
msgstr "所提供的结果：ex:answer a gmeow:QueryRerankAnswer ; gmeow:rerankedUnion ex:union ; gmeow:rerankScoreProfile gmeow:rerankFiniteFloatProfile ; gmeow:rerankEntry ex:entry ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankEntry|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Query Rerank Entry"
msgstr "查询重排条目"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankEntry|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "One candidate outcome occurrence belonging to exactly one rerank answer. It retains that candidate’s original union position and reported output position, with either a finite score and winning passage or an explicit structured unscored cause."
msgstr "恰好属于一个重排答案的单个候选结果出现项。它保留该候选项的原始并集位置及报告的输出位置，并具有有限分数和胜出片段，或显式结构化无分数原因。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankEntry|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use for an answer-local occurrence that keeps one candidate’s outcome and positions together."
msgstr "用于在单个答案内，将一个候选项的结果及位置共同保留的出现项。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankEntry|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid sharing the occurrence between answers or attaching both a score and an unscored cause to it."
msgstr "避免跨答案共享该出现项，或同时为其附加分数及无分数原因。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankEntry|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Supply rerankEntryCandidate, rerankInputPosition and entryOrdinal; link it from its answer and choose exactly one scored or unscored branch."
msgstr "提供 rerankEntryCandidate、rerankInputPosition 及 entryOrdinal；从其答案关联该条目，并在有分数与无分数分支中恰好选择一个。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankEntry|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Positions are nonnegative source-supplied sequence coordinates, not class ranks or global identity. Other answers use separate occurrences even when candidate or score resources are shared."
msgstr "位置是来源提供的非负序列坐标，不是类别名次或全局身份。即使共享候选或分数资源，其他答案也使用独立出现项。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankEntry|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A scored occurrence: ex:entry a gmeow:QueryRerankEntry ; gmeow:rerankEntryCandidate ex:candidate ; gmeow:rerankInputPosition \"3\"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ; gmeow:entryOrdinal \"0\"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ; gmeow:rerankScore ex:score ; gmeow:rerankWinningPassage \"retained passage\" ."
msgstr "有分数出现项：ex:entry a gmeow:QueryRerankEntry ; gmeow:rerankEntryCandidate ex:candidate ; gmeow:rerankInputPosition \"3\"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ; gmeow:entryOrdinal \"0\"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ; gmeow:rerankScore ex:score ; gmeow:rerankWinningPassage \"retained passage\" ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankFiniteFloatProfile|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "finite reported float rerank profile"
msgstr "有限已报告浮点重排配置"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankFiniteFloatProfile|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The explicit profile value selecting a rerank account whose scored outcomes use the finite reported IEEE 754 single precision QueryRerankScore contract, while preserving every original candidate and explicit unscored outcome."
msgstr "显式配置值，选择一种重排记录：其有分数结果使用针对已报告有限 IEEE 754 单精度分数的 QueryRerankScore 契约，同时保留每个原始候选项及显式无分数结果。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankFiniteFloatProfile|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use as the selected rerankScoreProfile value on a rerank operation and its reported answer."
msgstr "用于作为重排操作及其报告答案上选定的 rerankScoreProfile 值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankFiniteFloatProfile|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring profile selection from a node name, score presence or provider wording, or silently admitting nonfinite source scores."
msgstr "避免从节点名称、分数存在或提供方措辞推断配置选择，或静默接纳非有限来源分数。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankFiniteFloatProfile|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Assert this value explicitly on both QueryRerank and QueryRerankAnswer through rerankScoreProfile."
msgstr "通过 rerankScoreProfile，在 QueryRerank 和 QueryRerankAnswer 两者上显式断言此值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankFiniteFloatProfile|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The profile requires finite score context and full outcome accounting. It supplies no automatic default, provider execution, float-comparator proof or completeness value."
msgstr "此配置要求有限分数上下文及完整结果核算。它不提供自动默认值、提供方执行、浮点比较器证明或完整性值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankFiniteFloatProfile|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "An explicit selection: ex:answer gmeow:rerankScoreProfile gmeow:rerankFiniteFloatProfile ."
msgstr "显式选择：ex:answer gmeow:rerankScoreProfile gmeow:rerankFiniteFloatProfile ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankInput|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "rerank input union"
msgstr "重排输入并集"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankInput|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The original QueryUnionAnswer selected as the declared input of a QueryRerank operation. Its candidate identities, retained class lists and loss records remain source evidence beside the reranked outcomes."
msgstr "选作 QueryRerank 操作声明输入的原始 QueryUnionAnswer。其候选身份、保留的类别列表及损失记录在重排结果旁继续作为来源证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankInput|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to bind the original union consumed by a declared rerank stage."
msgstr "用于绑定声明重排阶段所消费的原始并集。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankInput|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid substituting a filtered candidate subset or replacing original class-list occurrences with a newly ranked list."
msgstr "避免替换为过滤后的候选子集，或用新排名列表替代原始类别列表出现项。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankInput|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Link one original QueryUnionAnswer; require the operation’s output answer to retain that same resource through rerankedUnion."
msgstr "关联一个原始 QueryUnionAnswer；要求操作的输出答案通过 rerankedUnion 保留同一资源。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankInput|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "This operation-input declaration is distinct from the answer’s retained original-input evidence and does not itself assert an execution occurrence."
msgstr "此操作输入声明区别于答案所保留的原始输入证据，本身不断言执行出现项。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankInput|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A declared original input: ex:stage gmeow:rerankInput ex:union ."
msgstr "声明的原始输入：ex:stage gmeow:rerankInput ex:union ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankOutput|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "rerank output answer"
msgstr "重排输出答案"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankOutput|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The attributed QueryRerankAnswer reported as the output of a QueryRerank operation description. The answer retains the operation’s original input union and its complete candidate outcome account."
msgstr "作为 QueryRerank 操作描述的输出而报告的带有归属的 QueryRerankAnswer。该答案保留操作的原始输入并集及完整候选结果记录。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankOutput|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to associate a declared rerank stage with its supplied result record."
msgstr "用于将声明的重排阶段与其所提供结果记录关联。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankOutput|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid linking a ranked input list, bare score or filtered candidate set as the full rerank answer."
msgstr "避免将有序输入列表、单独分数或过滤后的候选集作为完整重排答案关联。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankOutput|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Link one QueryRerankAnswer and retain its original union, explicit profile, candidate entries and loss ledger."
msgstr "关联一个 QueryRerankAnswer，并保留其原始并集、显式配置、候选条目及损失账本。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankOutput|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The edge supplies no provider invocation, execution time, score authenticity or inferred result status."
msgstr "此边不提供提供方调用、执行时间、分数真实性或推断的结果状态。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankOutput|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A supplied output association: ex:stage gmeow:rerankOutput ex:answer ."
msgstr "所提供的输出关联：ex:stage gmeow:rerankOutput ex:answer ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankedUnion|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "reranked original union"
msgstr "被重排的原始并集"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankedUnion|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The same original QueryUnionAnswer retained by a supplied rerank answer, preserving access to its class-list resources, original class entry occurrences, candidate identities and losses."
msgstr "所提供重排答案保留的同一个原始 QueryUnionAnswer，保留对其类别列表资源、原始类别条目出现项、候选身份及损失的访问。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankedUnion|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain original union evidence directly on a rerank result, including a standalone supplied answer."
msgstr "用于在重排结果上直接保留原始并集证据，包括独立提供的答案。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankedUnion|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid copying original entries into a global ranking or treating source union sequence order as merit."
msgstr "避免将原始条目复制到全局排名中，或将来源并集的序列顺序视为优劣。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankedUnion|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Link the original union resource and preserve all of its candidates and loss identities in the result account."
msgstr "关联原始并集资源，并在结果记录中保留其全部候选项及损失身份。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankedUnion|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "When the answer is a QueryRerank output, this resource must equal the operation’s rerankInput. Original ranks and tie keys remain on their original class-list entries."
msgstr "当答案是 QueryRerank 输出时，此资源必须等于操作的 rerankInput。原始名次及并列键留在其原始类别列表条目上。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankedUnion|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A retained original resource: ex:answer gmeow:rerankedUnion ex:union ."
msgstr "保留的原始资源：ex:answer gmeow:rerankedUnion ex:union ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankEntry|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "rerank result entry"
msgstr "重排结果条目"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankEntry|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "One answer-local candidate outcome occurrence retained by a QueryRerankAnswer. The collection contains exactly one entry per original union candidate, including candidates that were not scored."
msgstr "QueryRerankAnswer 保留的、仅属于一个答案的候选结果出现项。该集合对每个原始并集候选项恰好包含一个条目，包括未获分数的候选项。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankEntry|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to expose all reported candidate outcomes and their source and output positions."
msgstr "用于公开全部报告的候选结果及其来源位置和输出位置。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankEntry|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid omitting failed or unscored rows, repeating a candidate within one answer or sharing one occurrence between answer sequences."
msgstr "避免遗漏失败或无分数行、在同一答案内重复候选项，或跨答案序列共享同一出现项。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankEntry|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Link each QueryRerankEntry from its single owning answer and retain its candidate, positions and selected outcome branch."
msgstr "从其唯一所属答案关联每个 QueryRerankEntry，并保留其候选项、位置及所选结果分支。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankEntry|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "An empty input union permits no entries. Entry collection membership itself imposes no contiguous indices or floating-point score sort."
msgstr "空输入并集不允许任何条目。条目集合成员关系本身不施加连续索引或浮点分数排序。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankEntry|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Two retained outcomes: ex:answer gmeow:rerankEntry ex:scoredEntry, ex:unscoredEntry ."
msgstr "两个保留的结果：ex:answer gmeow:rerankEntry ex:scoredEntry, ex:unscoredEntry ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankEntryCandidate|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "rerank entry candidate"
msgstr "重排条目候选项"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankEntryCandidate|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The exact original union candidate identity named by one rerank entry. Every input candidate has one such occurrence, and no entry names a candidate outside the retained original union."
msgstr "一个重排条目所命名的确切原始并集候选身份。每个输入候选项具有一个这样的出现项，且任何条目都不命名保留的原始并集之外的候选项。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankEntryCandidate|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to join a reported outcome to the original candidate without deriving identity from its passage or numeric score."
msgstr "用于将报告结果连接至原始候选项，不从其片段或数值分数推导身份。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankEntryCandidate|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid minting replacement candidates, identifying candidates by output position or interpreting membership as truth or confidence."
msgstr "避免创建替代候选项、按输出位置标识候选项，或将成员关系理解为真值或置信度。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankEntryCandidate|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Reference one original candidate resource on the entry and preserve the same identity in input and output queryCandidate membership."
msgstr "在条目上引用一个原始候选资源，并在输入及输出的 queryCandidate 成员关系中保留同一身份。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankEntryCandidate|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The candidate may occur in several original class lists or separate rerank answers; only the outcome occurrence is local to one answer."
msgstr "候选项可以出现在多个原始类别列表或独立重排答案中；只有结果出现项局限于一个答案。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankEntryCandidate|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A retained candidate identity: ex:entry gmeow:rerankEntryCandidate ex:candidate ."
msgstr "保留的候选身份：ex:entry gmeow:rerankEntryCandidate ex:candidate ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankInputPosition|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "rerank original union position"
msgstr "重排原始并集位置"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankInputPosition|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The supplied zero-based position of an entry’s candidate in the original union sequence. It preserves source sequence evidence independently of the entry’s reported output entryOrdinal."
msgstr "所提供的、条目候选项在原始并集序列中从零起算的位置。它保留来源序列证据，独立于条目所报告的输出 entryOrdinal。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankInputPosition|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain the original union order needed to account for the unscored tail."
msgstr "用于保留交代无分数尾部所需的原始并集顺序。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankInputPosition|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid treating this coordinate as class rank, merit, global candidate identity or a reason to renumber retained rows."
msgstr "避免将此坐标视为类别名次、优劣、全局候选身份或重编号保留行的理由。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankInputPosition|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain one xsd:nonNegativeInteger on each entry and keep input positions unique within its owning answer."
msgstr "在每个条目上保留一个 xsd:nonNegativeInteger，并使输入位置在其所属答案内唯一。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankInputPosition|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "No contiguous sequence or declared source count is inferred. Canonical order checks preserve this relative order among unscored entries only."
msgstr "不推断连续序列或声明的来源数量。规范顺序检查仅在无分数条目之间保留此相对顺序。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankInputPosition|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A supplied original position: ex:entry gmeow:rerankInputPosition \"7\"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ."
msgstr "所提供的原始位置：ex:entry gmeow:rerankInputPosition \"7\"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankScore|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "rerank entry score"
msgstr "重排条目分数"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankScore|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The supplied finite QueryRerankScore of a scored candidate occurrence. This branch requires a retained winning passage and excludes a simultaneous structured unscored cause."
msgstr "有分数候选出现项所提供的有限 QueryRerankScore。此分支要求保留胜出片段，并排除同时存在结构化无分数原因。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankScore|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain the reported quantitative outcome without moving its magnitude into an entry-local numeric property."
msgstr "用于保留报告的定量结果，不将其量值移入条目专有数值属性。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankScore|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid replacing a nonfinite source score, treating the score as probability or using score presence to infer a successful provider execution."
msgstr "避免替换非有限来源分数、将分数视为概率，或从分数存在推断提供方成功执行。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankScore|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Link one existing QueryRerankScore, retain rerankWinningPassage, and match that score’s rerankScoreAuthority to the answer’s actual authority record."
msgstr "关联一个已有 QueryRerankScore，保留 rerankWinningPassage，并使该分数的 rerankScoreAuthority 与答案的实际权威记录相同。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankScore|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The existing score contract owns magnitude, dimension, frame and authority context. The stage adds no duplicate finite-value law or floating-point sorting mechanism."
msgstr "现有分数契约负责量值、量纲、参照系及权威上下文。此阶段不添加重复有限值定律或浮点排序机制。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankScore|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A scored branch: ex:entry gmeow:rerankScore ex:score ; gmeow:rerankWinningPassage \"retained passage\" ."
msgstr "有分数分支：ex:entry gmeow:rerankScore ex:score ; gmeow:rerankWinningPassage \"retained passage\" ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankWinningPassage|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "rerank winning passage"
msgstr "重排胜出片段"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankWinningPassage|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The source-supplied best-scoring passage text retained beside a candidate’s reported rerank score. It is an xsd:string literal and is present exactly on the scored outcome branch."
msgstr "来源提供的最高分片段文本，在候选项报告的重排分数旁保留。它是 xsd:string 字面量，恰好在有分数结果分支上存在。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankWinningPassage|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to preserve which supplied passage accompanied a candidate’s reported score."
msgstr "用于保留哪一个所提供片段伴随候选项报告的分数。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankWinningPassage|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inventing a passage for an unscored candidate, declaring a language from plain text or treating retention as display authorization."
msgstr "避免为无分数候选项虚构片段、从纯文本声明语言，或将保留视为显示授权。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankWinningPassage|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Copy the supplied passage into one xsd:string literal on the scored entry and retain its score separately through rerankScore."
msgstr "将所提供片段复制到有分数条目的一个 xsd:string 字面量中，并通过 rerankScore 单独保留其分数。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankWinningPassage|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The carrier preserves text without re-running passage selection or proving that the provider evaluated every possible passage."
msgstr "此载体保留文本，不重新运行片段选择，也不证明提供方评估了每个可能片段。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankWinningPassage|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A supplied winning passage: ex:entry gmeow:rerankWinningPassage \"A retained source passage.\" ."
msgstr "所提供的胜出片段：ex:entry gmeow:rerankWinningPassage \"A retained source passage.\" ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankUnscoredDetail|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "rerank unscored detail"
msgstr "重排无分数详情"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankUnscoredDetail|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The explicit source-reported structured cause of a candidate’s unscored outcome. It retains native structured values and record fields, excluding a simultaneous score or winning passage."
msgstr "来源显式报告的候选无分数结果的结构化原因。它保留原生结构化值及记录字段，排除同时存在分数或胜出片段。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankUnscoredDetail|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to account for a retained candidate that the source did not score."
msgstr "用于交代来源未评分的保留候选项。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankUnscoredDetail|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid converting a supplied numeric score into this branch after profile rejection, stringifying structured causes or identifying every detail with an aggregate QueryLoss."
msgstr "避免在配置拒绝后将所提供数值分数转换至此分支、将结构化原因字符串化，或将每个详情等同于聚合 QueryLoss。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankUnscoredDetail|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Link one actual StructuredValue and retain its source record tag, labelled fields and nested native values through the existing structured-value vocabulary."
msgstr "关联一个实际 StructuredValue，并通过现有结构化值词汇保留其来源记录标签、带标签字段及嵌套原生值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankUnscoredDetail|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Actual loss records remain in the answer’s loss ledger. A typed unscored cause does not prove the candidate false, and its answer cannot report CompleteForFragment."
msgstr "实际损失记录仍留在答案的损失账本中。类型化无分数原因不证明候选项为假，其答案也不能报告 CompleteForFragment。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankUnscoredDetail|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "An explicit unscored branch: ex:entry gmeow:rerankUnscoredDetail ex:detail ."
msgstr "显式无分数分支：ex:entry gmeow:rerankUnscoredDetail ex:detail ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankAuthority|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "rerank answer authority"
msgstr "重排答案权威记录"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankAuthority|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The supplied source scoring authority retained by a rerank answer. It is required whenever any entry is scored and must be the same authority record referenced by each retained score."
msgstr "重排答案保留的所提供来源评分权威记录。只要任一条目有分数就必须提供该记录，且其必须是每个保留分数引用的同一权威记录。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankAuthority|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain answer-level source scoring identity and context alongside every candidate outcome."
msgstr "用于在每个候选结果旁保留答案级来源评分身份及上下文。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankAuthority|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring authority from score-kind wording, merging records from equal opaque bytes or requiring an invented authority for an all-unscored result."
msgstr "避免从分数种类措辞推断权威记录、因不透明字节相等而合并记录，或要求为全无分数结果虚构权威记录。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankAuthority|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain at most one supplied QueryRerankAuthority on the answer and bind every scored quantity to that actual record through rerankScoreAuthority."
msgstr "在答案上至多保留一个所提供的 QueryRerankAuthority，并通过 rerankScoreAuthority 将每个分数的量载体绑定至该实际记录。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankAuthority|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "A supplied authority is legal even when all candidates are unscored. Its presence alone proves neither scoring success nor provider invocation."
msgstr "即使全部候选项都无分数，所提供权威记录仍合法。仅有其存在既不证明评分成功，也不证明提供方调用。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankAuthority|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A supplied answer authority: ex:answer gmeow:rerankAuthority ex:authority ."
msgstr "所提供的答案权威记录：ex:answer gmeow:rerankAuthority ex:authority ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankScoreProfile|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "rerank score profile"
msgstr "重排分数配置"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankScoreProfile|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The explicit selected profile of a rerank operation description or attributed result. This stage contract requires the sole admitted value rerankFiniteFloatProfile on each."
msgstr "重排操作描述或带有归属结果的显式所选配置。此阶段契约要求两者各自具有唯一可接纳值 rerankFiniteFloatProfile。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankScoreProfile|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to make finite reported score and full outcome-accounting obligations explicit on both operation and answer."
msgstr "用于在操作及答案两者上明确有限已报告分数及完整结果核算义务。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankScoreProfile|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid silently defaulting the profile, selecting it from provider wording or treating a missing selection as a weaker supported result."
msgstr "避免静默赋予默认配置、从提供方措辞选择配置，或将缺失选择视为受支持的较弱结果。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankScoreProfile|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Assert exactly one rerankScoreProfile value on the QueryRerank node and its QueryRerankAnswer, choosing rerankFiniteFloatProfile."
msgstr "在 QueryRerank 节点及其 QueryRerankAnswer 上恰好断言一个 rerankScoreProfile 值，选择 rerankFiniteFloatProfile。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankScoreProfile|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The selected value fixes mandatory evidence obligations without asserting native execution, score comparator equivalence or completeness."
msgstr "所选值确定强制证据义务，不断言原生执行、分数比较器等价或完整性。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rerankScoreProfile|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Explicit operation and result selection: ex:stage gmeow:rerankScoreProfile gmeow:rerankFiniteFloatProfile . ex:answer gmeow:rerankScoreProfile gmeow:rerankFiniteFloatProfile ."
msgstr "操作及结果的显式选择：ex:stage gmeow:rerankScoreProfile gmeow:rerankFiniteFloatProfile . ex:answer gmeow:rerankScoreProfile gmeow:rerankFiniteFloatProfile ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankInputAgreementLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "query rerank input agreement law"
msgstr "查询重排输入一致定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankInputAgreementLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The answer named as a QueryRerank output retains the same original union resource that the operation declares through rerankInput. Reported original evidence cannot silently substitute another input."
msgstr "命名为 QueryRerank 输出的答案，保留操作通过 rerankInput 声明的同一原始并集资源。报告的原始证据不能静默替换成另一输入。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankInputAgreementLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to check agreement between a declared operation input and its result’s retained original union."
msgstr "用于检查声明操作输入与其结果保留的原始并集之间的一致性。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankInputAgreementLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid matching inputs by candidate count, display label or equal scores rather than the actual union resource."
msgstr "避免按候选数量、显示标签或相等分数匹配输入，而不匹配实际并集资源。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankInputAgreementLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Bind the typed operation, rerankInput and rerankOutput, then require rerankedUnion from that answer to the bound input."
msgstr "绑定类型化操作、rerankInput 及 rerankOutput，然后要求从该答案通过 rerankedUnion 关联至已绑定输入。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankInputAgreementLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Required single-valued input and original-union paths make conflicting source associations invalid without creating execution evidence."
msgstr "必需单值输入及原始并集路径使冲突来源关联无效，不创建执行证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankInputAgreementLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Matching original evidence: ex:stage gmeow:rerankInput ex:union ; gmeow:rerankOutput ex:answer . ex:answer gmeow:rerankedUnion ex:union ."
msgstr "一致的原始证据：ex:stage gmeow:rerankInput ex:union ; gmeow:rerankOutput ex:answer . ex:answer gmeow:rerankedUnion ex:union ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankCandidateAccountingLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "query rerank candidate accounting law"
msgstr "查询重排候选核算定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankCandidateAccountingLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A rerank answer retains exactly its original union’s candidate identities and an outcome occurrence for each. Every entry names an original candidate; no original candidate is omitted and no foreign candidate is added."
msgstr "重排答案恰好保留其原始并集的候选身份，并为每个候选项保留一个结果出现项。每个条目命名一个原始候选项；不遗漏任何原始候选项，也不添加外来候选项。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankCandidateAccountingLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to check complete candidate accounting across original membership, output membership and entry occurrences."
msgstr "用于跨原始成员关系、输出成员关系及条目出现项检查完整候选核算。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankCandidateAccountingLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid interpreting an unscored outcome as permission to remove the candidate or replacing identity accounting with a matching total count."
msgstr "避免将无分数结果理解为删除候选项的许可，或用相同总数量替代身份核算。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankCandidateAccountingLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Check input-to-entry coverage, entry-to-input membership, input-to-output membership and output-to-input membership as four guarded implications."
msgstr "将输入到条目覆盖、条目到输入成员关系、输入到输出成员关系及输出到输入成员关系检查为四个带守卫的蕴含。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankCandidateAccountingLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "This law permits an empty input with empty output collections. Candidate uniqueness remains a separate occurrence obligation."
msgstr "此定律允许空输入及空输出集合。候选唯一性仍是独立的出现项义务。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankCandidateAccountingLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "One retained candidate: ex:union gmeow:queryCandidate ex:c . ex:answer gmeow:queryCandidate ex:c ; gmeow:rerankEntry ex:e . ex:e gmeow:rerankEntryCandidate ex:c ."
msgstr "一个保留的候选项：ex:union gmeow:queryCandidate ex:c . ex:answer gmeow:queryCandidate ex:c ; gmeow:rerankEntry ex:e . ex:e gmeow:rerankEntryCandidate ex:c ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankEntryUniquenessLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "query rerank entry uniqueness law"
msgstr "查询重排条目唯一性定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankEntryUniquenessLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Two entries of one rerank answer naming the same original candidate must be the same occurrence resource. Together with complete candidate accounting, this gives one outcome occurrence per input candidate."
msgstr "同一重排答案中命名同一原始候选项的两个条目，必须是同一出现项资源。结合完整候选核算，这使每个输入候选项恰有一个结果出现项。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankEntryUniquenessLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to reject duplicate outcome occurrences for one candidate within a result."
msgstr "用于拒绝同一结果中一个候选项具有重复结果出现项。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankEntryUniquenessLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid applying this within-answer identity rule to candidates retained by different answers or to shared quantitative score resources."
msgstr "避免将此答案内身份规则应用于不同答案保留的候选项，或共享的定量分数资源。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankEntryUniquenessLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Bind two entries of the same answer and their common rerankEntryCandidate, then compare entry identities through logic:termEqual."
msgstr "绑定同一答案的两个条目及其共同 rerankEntryCandidate，然后通过 logic:termEqual 比较条目身份。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankEntryUniquenessLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Equal score values or passages do not identify different candidates, and the same candidate may have another occurrence in another result."
msgstr "相等分数值或片段不使不同候选项具有同一身份，同一候选项可以在另一结果中具有另一个出现项。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankEntryUniquenessLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "One occurrence for one candidate: ex:answer gmeow:rerankEntry ex:e . ex:e gmeow:rerankEntryCandidate ex:c ."
msgstr "一个候选项对应一个出现项：ex:answer gmeow:rerankEntry ex:e . ex:e gmeow:rerankEntryCandidate ex:c ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankEntryOwnerLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "query rerank entry owner law"
msgstr "查询重排条目归属定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankEntryOwnerLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Every rerank entry belongs to exactly one rerank answer. Its source and output positions are local to that answer’s sequences, so another answer requires a separate occurrence."
msgstr "每个重排条目恰好属于一个重排答案。其来源位置及输出位置局限于该答案的序列，因此另一答案要求独立出现项。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankEntryOwnerLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to prevent one outcome occurrence from borrowing two result or original-input contexts."
msgstr "用于防止单个结果出现项借用两个结果或原始输入上下文。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankEntryOwnerLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid imposing unique inverse ownership on candidate identities, score quantities, authority records or retained losses."
msgstr "避免对候选身份、分数量、权威记录或保留损失施加逆向唯一归属。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankEntryOwnerLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Require a fresh existing typed answer owner and compare any pair of answer links to the entry through logic:termEqual."
msgstr "要求以新绑定见证一个已有且已类型化的所属答案，并通过 logic:termEqual 比较任何一对关联至该条目的答案链接。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankEntryOwnerLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The Formula uses one outer universal, a joined owner existential and a guarded owner-pair implication. It introduces no positive nested universal and no global ownership rule beyond entries."
msgstr "此 Formula 使用一个外层全称量化、连接的所属者存在量化及带守卫的所属者对蕴含。它不引入正极性的嵌套全称量化，也不引入条目之外的全局归属规则。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankEntryOwnerLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A single owning sequence: ex:answer gmeow:rerankEntry ex:e . ex:e a gmeow:QueryRerankEntry ."
msgstr "单个所属序列：ex:answer gmeow:rerankEntry ex:e . ex:e a gmeow:QueryRerankEntry ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankPositionUniquenessLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "query rerank position uniqueness law"
msgstr "查询重排位置唯一性定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankPositionUniquenessLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Within one rerank answer, equal reported output positions identify the same entry, and equal original union positions separately identify the same entry. Source positions remain unique without renumbering."
msgstr "在同一重排答案内，相等的报告输出位置标识同一条目；相等的原始并集位置也单独标识同一条目。来源位置保持唯一，不重新编号。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankPositionUniquenessLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to reject competing occurrences at one supplied input or output position."
msgstr "用于拒绝同一所提供输入或输出位置上相互竞争的出现项。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankPositionUniquenessLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid requiring contiguous indices, inventing a source count or treating positions from different answers as a global coordinate system."
msgstr "避免要求连续索引、虚构来源数量，或将不同答案的位置视为全局坐标系。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankPositionUniquenessLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Compare bound integer entryOrdinal values and, separately, bound rerankInputPosition values with logic:termEqual; each equality requires equal entry identities."
msgstr "通过 logic:termEqual 比较已绑定整数 entryOrdinal 值，并单独比较已绑定 rerankInputPosition 值；每个相等关系都要求条目身份相等。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankPositionUniquenessLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The admitted nonnegative integer coordinates are compared through the canonical term relation. No reflected numeric relation or floating-point comparison is used."
msgstr "通过规范项关系比较可接纳的非负整数坐标。不使用反射数值关系或浮点比较。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankPositionUniquenessLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Distinct source coordinates: ex:left gmeow:entryOrdinal \"0\"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ; gmeow:rerankInputPosition \"3\"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger . ex:right gmeow:entryOrdinal \"1\"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ; gmeow:rerankInputPosition \"7\"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ."
msgstr "不同的来源坐标：ex:left gmeow:entryOrdinal \"0\"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ; gmeow:rerankInputPosition \"3\"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger . ex:right gmeow:entryOrdinal \"1\"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ; gmeow:rerankInputPosition \"7\"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankOutcomeLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "query rerank outcome law"
msgstr "查询重排结果定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankOutcomeLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Every rerank entry selects exactly one scored or structured unscored branch. A winning passage is present exactly when a score is retained, while the unscored branch has neither score nor winning passage."
msgstr "每个重排条目恰好选择有分数或结构化无分数分支之一。当且仅当保留分数时存在胜出片段，而无分数分支既无分数也无胜出片段。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankOutcomeLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to reject missing, contradictory or partly declared candidate outcome branches."
msgstr "用于拒绝缺失、矛盾或部分声明的候选结果分支。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankOutcomeLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid filling a missing branch with zero, empty passage text or a fabricated cause, or converting profile-rejected source scores into unscored outcomes."
msgstr "避免用零、空片段文本或虚构原因填补缺失分支，或将配置拒绝的来源分数转换为无分数结果。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankOutcomeLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Require a score or structured detail, forbid their conjunction, and enforce both score-to-passage and passage-to-score existence implications."
msgstr "要求分数或结构化详情，禁止两者合取，并同时实施分数到片段及片段到分数的存在蕴含。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankOutcomeLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Branch datatype and single-value checks come from the local restrictions. StructuredValue retains its own payload-branch contract."
msgstr "分支数据类型及单值检查来自局部限制。StructuredValue 保留其自身的载荷分支契约。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankOutcomeLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "An explicit unscored outcome: ex:e gmeow:rerankUnscoredDetail ex:detail . ex:detail a gmeow:StructuredMap ."
msgstr "显式无分数结果：ex:e gmeow:rerankUnscoredDetail ex:detail . ex:detail a gmeow:StructuredMap ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankAuthorityRequiredLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "query rerank authority required law"
msgstr "查询重排权威记录必需定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankAuthorityRequiredLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A rerank answer retaining any scored entry must retain a supplied source authority record. No authority is manufactured for an all-unscored answer."
msgstr "保留任一有分数条目的重排答案必须保留所提供来源权威记录。不为全无分数答案制造权威记录。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankAuthorityRequiredLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to reject scored results whose answer-level source scoring context is absent."
msgstr "用于拒绝缺失答案级来源评分上下文的有分数结果。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankAuthorityRequiredLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid interpreting a present authority as proof that any candidate was scored or forbidding a supplied authority on an all-unscored result."
msgstr "避免将权威记录存在理解为任何候选项已获评分的证明，或禁止全无分数结果保留所提供权威记录。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankAuthorityRequiredLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Bind the answer, its entry and that entry’s score; require an existing QueryRerankAuthority linked through rerankAuthority."
msgstr "绑定答案、其条目及该条目的分数；要求通过 rerankAuthority 关联一个已有 QueryRerankAuthority。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankAuthorityRequiredLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The answer permits at most one authority. Its agreement with each score’s own authority is a separate law, and the score retains its existing quantitative context requirements."
msgstr "答案至多允许一个权威记录。其与每个分数自身权威记录的一致性由另一条定律约束，分数仍保留其现有定量上下文要求。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankAuthorityRequiredLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Scored answer context: ex:answer gmeow:rerankEntry ex:e ; gmeow:rerankAuthority ex:authority . ex:e gmeow:rerankScore ex:score ."
msgstr "有分数答案上下文：ex:answer gmeow:rerankEntry ex:e ; gmeow:rerankAuthority ex:authority . ex:e gmeow:rerankScore ex:score ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankAuthorityAgreementLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "query rerank authority agreement law"
msgstr "查询重排权威记录一致定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankAuthorityAgreementLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Every score retained by a rerank answer references the same actual source authority record as the answer. Equal opaque identity bytes on different records do not satisfy this record-identity obligation."
msgstr "重排答案保留的每个分数都引用与答案相同的实际来源权威记录。不同记录上的不透明身份字节相等，不满足此记录身份义务。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankAuthorityAgreementLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to reject an answer that mixes scores from another retained authority context."
msgstr "用于拒绝混入另一保留权威上下文分数的答案。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankAuthorityAgreementLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid comparing authority labels, byte values or frames in place of the authority resource, or repeating the score’s existing finite and quantitative context laws."
msgstr "避免比较权威标签、字节值或参照系来替代权威资源，或重复分数现有的有限性及定量上下文定律。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankAuthorityAgreementLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Bind the answer, entry, score, score authority and answer authority, then require logic:termEqual between the two authority resources."
msgstr "绑定答案、条目、分数、分数权威记录及答案权威记录，然后要求两个权威资源之间满足 logic:termEqual。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankAuthorityAgreementLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The existing QueryRerankScoreContextLaw handles dimension and frame agreement through the score’s direct authority link. This law adds only answer-to-score authority identity agreement."
msgstr "现有 QueryRerankScoreContextLaw 通过分数的直接权威链接处理量纲及参照系一致性。此定律仅添加答案与分数间的权威身份一致性。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankAuthorityAgreementLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Matching authority record: ex:answer gmeow:rerankAuthority ex:authority . ex:score gmeow:rerankScoreAuthority ex:authority ."
msgstr "一致的权威记录：ex:answer gmeow:rerankAuthority ex:authority . ex:score gmeow:rerankScoreAuthority ex:authority ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankReportedOrderLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "query rerank reported order law"
msgstr "查询重排报告顺序定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankReportedOrderLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Within a rerank answer, every scored occurrence precedes every unscored occurrence, and unscored occurrences retain their relative original union order. Both obligations compare integer sequence positions only."
msgstr "在一个重排答案内，每个有分数出现项都先于每个无分数出现项，且无分数出现项保留其原始并集相对顺序。两项义务仅比较整数序列位置。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankReportedOrderLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to check scored-group placement and original order within the unscored tail."
msgstr "用于检查有分数组的位置及无分数尾部内的原始顺序。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankReportedOrderLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid claiming this law validates scored numeric-descending order, equal-score tie order, signed-zero behavior or a provider’s floating-point comparator."
msgstr "避免声称此定律验证了分数数值降序、同分并列顺序、有符号零行为或提供方的浮点比较器。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankReportedOrderLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Use logic:termLess on bound entryOrdinal values for scored versus unscored entries; for two unscored entries, require output order whenever their input positions are ordered."
msgstr "对有分数与无分数条目的已绑定 entryOrdinal 值使用 logic:termLess；对两个无分数条目，输入位置较小者的输出位置也必须较小。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankReportedOrderLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "These are exactly two guarded integer implications. No score magnitude, contiguous-index requirement or comparator implementation is added."
msgstr "这些恰好是两个带守卫的整数蕴含。不添加分数量值、连续索引要求或比较器实现。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankReportedOrderLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Group placement: ex:scored gmeow:entryOrdinal \"0\"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger . ex:unscored gmeow:entryOrdinal \"1\"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ."
msgstr "分组位置：ex:scored gmeow:entryOrdinal \"0\"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger . ex:unscored gmeow:entryOrdinal \"1\"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankLossRetentionLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "query rerank loss retention law"
msgstr "查询重排损失保留定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankLossRetentionLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Every loss resource retained by an original union ledger survives by identity in an output answer ledger. Additional supplied rerank-stage losses may coexist with those original records."
msgstr "原始并集账本保留的每个损失资源，均以同一身份保留在输出答案账本中。额外提供的重排阶段损失可以与这些原始记录共存。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankLossRetentionLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to reject a rerank result that omits or replaces an inherited loss record."
msgstr "用于拒绝遗漏或替换继承损失记录的重排结果。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankLossRetentionLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid requiring input and output ledgers to be identical, erasing acknowledged losses or treating a new stage loss as a replacement for an original one."
msgstr "避免要求输入与输出账本完全相同、抹除已确认损失，或将新阶段损失视为原始损失的替代。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankLossRetentionLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Bind each input ledger and loss, then require an existing output ledger containing the same loss resource through ledgerLoss."
msgstr "绑定每个输入账本及损失，然后要求存在通过 ledgerLoss 包含同一损失资源的输出账本。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankLossRetentionLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The law forwards source loss identities without repairing, waiving or authenticating them. It imposes no inverse owner on a shared loss or ledger."
msgstr "此定律传递来源损失身份，不修复、豁免或认证这些损失。它不对共享损失或账本施加逆向所属者。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankLossRetentionLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Original plus stage loss: ex:inputLedger gmeow:ledgerLoss ex:originalLoss . ex:outputLedger gmeow:ledgerLoss ex:originalLoss, ex:stageLoss ."
msgstr "原始损失及阶段损失：ex:inputLedger gmeow:ledgerLoss ex:originalLoss . ex:outputLedger gmeow:ledgerLoss ex:originalLoss, ex:stageLoss ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankUnscoredCompletenessLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "query rerank unscored completeness law"
msgstr "查询重排无分数完整性定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankUnscoredCompletenessLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A rerank answer with any explicit unscored candidate cannot report CompleteForFragment. The source’s other status evidence and any missing status remain independently represented."
msgstr "具有任一显式无分数候选项的重排答案不能报告 CompleteForFragment。来源的其他状态证据及任何缺失状态仍被独立表示。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankUnscoredCompletenessLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to reject a complete-result claim that coexists with a retained unscored outcome."
msgstr "用于拒绝与保留的无分数结果共存的完整结果声明。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankUnscoredCompletenessLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid fabricating an incomplete status from absence, deleting the unscored row or treating an empty loss ledger as proof of complete scoring."
msgstr "避免因缺失而虚构不完整状态、删除无分数行，或将空损失账本视为完整评分的证明。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankUnscoredCompletenessLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Bind an answer entry and its structured unscored detail, then forbid the answer’s queryCompletenessStatus value logic:CompleteForFragment."
msgstr "绑定答案条目及其结构化无分数详情，然后禁止答案的 queryCompletenessStatus 取值为 logic:CompleteForFragment。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankUnscoredCompletenessLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "This law is a negative compatibility check, not a status default or inference of provider success. Empty input and all-scored results still carry only statuses actually supplied."
msgstr "此定律是负向相容性检查，不是状态默认值，也不推断提供方成功。空输入及全有分数结果仍仅携带实际提供的状态。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRerankUnscoredCompletenessLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "An explicitly incomplete source report: ex:answer gmeow:queryCompletenessStatus logic:Incomplete ; gmeow:rerankEntry ex:e . ex:e gmeow:rerankUnscoredDetail ex:detail ."
msgstr "来源显式报告的不完整状态：ex:answer gmeow:queryCompletenessStatus logic:Incomplete ; gmeow:rerankEntry ex:e . ex:e gmeow:rerankUnscoredDetail ex:detail ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryOrderPolicy|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Query Order Policy"
msgstr "查询排序策略"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryOrderPolicy|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "An explicit complete query-order definition selecting unique predicate-to-tier mappings and source-standard key directions. It contains ordered criterion occurrences with required fused-score and terminal source-subject-tie criteria, plus explicitly included content-tier or activation criteria."
msgstr "显式完整的查询排序定义，选择谓词不重复的层级映射及来源标准键方向。它包含有序准则出现项，要求融合分数准则及末尾来源主体并列准则，并包含显式纳入的内容层级或激活准则。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryOrderPolicy|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to describe criterion precedence without changing the selected fusion arithmetic or asserting an executed order."
msgstr "用于描述准则优先顺序，不改变所选融合算术，也不断言已经执行的顺序。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryOrderPolicy|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid treating the definition as an applied result, a native policy digest, a provider capability claim or a permission to filter candidates."
msgstr "避免将此定义视为已应用结果、原生策略摘要、提供方能力声明或过滤候选项的许可。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryOrderPolicy|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain every orderCriterion occurrence with its own position, kind and explicit direction; include a fused-score criterion and a final source-subject-tie criterion."
msgstr "保留每个 orderCriterion 出现项及其自身位置、种类和显式方向；纳入融合分数准则及最终来源主体并列准则。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryOrderPolicy|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "This selected contract admits both score-before-activation and activation-before-score definitions. Actual key values, snapshot evidence, result positions and source adoption require separate evidence."
msgstr "此所选契约同时接纳分数先于激活及激活先于分数的定义。实际键值、快照证据、结果位置及来源采纳需要独立证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryOrderPolicy|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A complete minimal definition: ex:policy a gmeow:QueryOrderPolicy ; gmeow:orderCriterion ex:scoreCriterion, ex:tieCriterion ."
msgstr "完整最小定义：ex:policy a gmeow:QueryOrderPolicy ; gmeow:orderCriterion ex:scoreCriterion, ex:tieCriterion ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryOrderCriterion|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Query Order Criterion"
msgstr "查询排序准则"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryOrderCriterion|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "One criterion occurrence in exactly one query-order policy sequence, retaining one nonnegative entryOrdinal, one selected key kind and one explicit boolean direction. Its precedence is local to the owning policy."
msgstr "恰好属于一个查询排序策略序列的准则出现项，保留一个非负 entryOrdinal、一个所选键种类及一个显式布尔方向。其优先顺序局限于所属策略。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryOrderCriterion|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use for a mechanical comparison key whose position and direction must remain explicit in a policy definition."
msgstr "用于在策略定义中必须明确保留位置及方向的机械比较键。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryOrderCriterion|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid coercing the occurrence into a rubric Criterion, sharing it between policy sequences or treating its ordinal as a measured magnitude."
msgstr "避免将该出现项强制转换为量规 Criterion、跨策略序列共享它，或将其序号视为测得量值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryOrderCriterion|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Link the occurrence from its policy through orderCriterion and supply entryOrdinal, orderCriterionKind and a typed boolean orderDescending."
msgstr "从其策略通过 orderCriterion 关联该出现项，并提供 entryOrdinal、orderCriterionKind 及类型化布尔值 orderDescending。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryOrderCriterion|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Another policy uses another occurrence even when the key kind and direction agree. Predicate-tier binding declarations may still be shared across occurrences."
msgstr "即使键种类和方向相同，另一策略也使用另一出现项。谓词层级绑定声明仍可以跨出现项共享。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryOrderCriterion|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "An explicit score occurrence: ex:scoreCriterion a gmeow:QueryOrderCriterion ; gmeow:entryOrdinal \"1\"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ; gmeow:orderCriterionKind gmeow:orderFusedScore ; gmeow:orderDescending true ."
msgstr "显式分数出现项：ex:scoreCriterion a gmeow:QueryOrderCriterion ; gmeow:entryOrdinal \"1\"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ; gmeow:orderCriterionKind gmeow:orderFusedScore ; gmeow:orderDescending true ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryPredicateTierBinding|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Query Predicate Tier Binding"
msgstr "查询谓词层级绑定"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryPredicateTierBinding|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A supplied declaration mapping one actual content-predicate IRI to one unsigned integer control-tier label. A content-tier criterion selects at most one binding resource for each predicate."
msgstr "所提供的声明，将一个实际内容谓词 IRI 映射到一个无符号整数控制层级标签。内容层级准则为每个谓词至多选择一个绑定资源。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryPredicateTierBinding|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to define the predicate-to-tier mapping consulted by a declared content-tier criterion."
msgstr "用于定义声明的内容层级准则所查阅的谓词到层级映射。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryPredicateTierBinding|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid treating the tier label as a mathematical magnitude, bibliographic source tier, audience tier or class rank."
msgstr "避免将层级标签视为数学量值、文献来源层级、受众层级或类别名次。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryPredicateTierBinding|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Supply one tierBindingPredicate IRI and one xsd:unsignedInt tierBindingOrdinal, then retain the declaration through contentTierBinding."
msgstr "提供一个 tierBindingPredicate IRI 及一个 xsd:unsignedInt 类型的 tierBindingOrdinal，然后通过 contentTierBinding 保留该声明。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryPredicateTierBinding|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The binding is reusable across policies and has no unique inverse owner. The selected unique-predicate profile does not model a native last-wins duplicate mapping vector."
msgstr "此绑定可跨策略复用，没有逆向唯一所属者。所选唯一谓词配置不建模重复映射中最后项生效的原生向量。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryPredicateTierBinding|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A reusable declaration: ex:labelTier a gmeow:QueryPredicateTierBinding ; gmeow:tierBindingPredicate ex:label ; gmeow:tierBindingOrdinal \"0\"^^xsd:unsignedInt ."
msgstr "可复用声明：ex:labelTier a gmeow:QueryPredicateTierBinding ; gmeow:tierBindingPredicate ex:label ; gmeow:tierBindingOrdinal \"0\"^^xsd:unsignedInt ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/queryOrderPolicy|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "query order policy description"
msgstr "查询排序策略描述"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/queryOrderPolicy|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Associates a query-program node description with a supplied query-order policy definition. The association retains descriptive evidence without changing the node’s existing operator contract or selecting an executed policy."
msgstr "将查询程序节点描述与所提供查询排序策略定义关联。该关联保留描述性证据，不改变节点现有算子契约，也不选择已执行策略。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/queryOrderPolicy|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to keep one or more supplied order definitions beside a query-program description."
msgstr "用于在查询程序描述旁保留一个或多个所提供排序定义。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/queryOrderPolicy|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid interpreting the edge as proof that an operator applied the policy, a default selection or an alteration of existing reciprocal-fusion semantics."
msgstr "避免将此边理解为算子已应用策略的证明、默认选择或对现有倒数融合语义的更改。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/queryOrderPolicy|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Reference each supplied QueryOrderPolicy and preserve its criterion sequence independently of execution and result evidence."
msgstr "引用每个所提供的 QueryOrderPolicy，并独立于执行及结果证据保留其准则序列。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/queryOrderPolicy|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The association is optional and nonfunctional. Coexisting definitions do not imply that a result applied all of them or choose a preferred policy."
msgstr "此关联可选且非函数性。多个定义共存不意味着结果应用了全部定义，也不选择偏好策略。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/queryOrderPolicy|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Two supplied definitions: ex:node gmeow:queryOrderPolicy ex:scoreFirst, ex:activationFirst ."
msgstr "两个所提供定义：ex:node gmeow:queryOrderPolicy ex:scoreFirst, ex:activationFirst ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/orderCriterion|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "query order criterion occurrence"
msgstr "查询排序准则出现项"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/orderCriterion|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "One criterion occurrence retained in a QueryOrderPolicy’s complete comparison prescription. Ascending entryOrdinal determines precedence among its distinct key kinds."
msgstr "QueryOrderPolicy 完整比较规约中保留的一个准则出现项。entryOrdinal 升序确定其不同键种类之间的优先顺序。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/orderCriterion|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to expose the full ordered set of comparison keys in a policy definition."
msgstr "用于公开策略定义中完整有序的比较键集合。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/orderCriterion|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid treating RDF edge serialization order as criterion precedence or omitting the required fused-score or terminal tie criterion."
msgstr "避免将 RDF 边的序列化顺序视为准则优先顺序，或遗漏必需融合分数准则或末尾并列准则。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/orderCriterion|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Link each answer-independent QueryOrderCriterion and retain its own ordinal, key kind and explicit direction."
msgstr "关联每个独立于答案的 QueryOrderCriterion，并保留其自身序号、键种类及显式方向。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/orderCriterion|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Criterion positions and kinds are unique within the policy. Noncontiguous source positions are permitted, and collection membership does not assert an applied candidate order."
msgstr "准则位置及种类在策略内唯一。允许不连续来源位置，集合成员关系不断言已应用的候选顺序。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/orderCriterion|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Two precedence occurrences: ex:policy gmeow:orderCriterion ex:firstKey, ex:lastKey ."
msgstr "两个优先顺序出现项：ex:policy gmeow:orderCriterion ex:firstKey, ex:lastKey ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/orderCriterionKind|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "query order criterion kind"
msgstr "查询排序准则种类"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/orderCriterionKind|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The explicitly selected comparison-key kind of a criterion occurrence: content tier, fused score, snapshot activation or source subject tie. The selected policy profile admits exactly those four value kinds."
msgstr "准则出现项显式选择的比较键种类：内容层级、融合分数、快照激活或来源主体并列。所选策略配置恰好接纳这四种值种类。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/orderCriterionKind|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to distinguish what a criterion compares from its sequence position and direction."
msgstr "用于将准则比较的内容与其序列位置及方向区分开来。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/orderCriterionKind|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid substituting a measured score, rubric axis, predicate IRI or source identity bytes for the key-kind value."
msgstr "避免用测得分数、量规维度、谓词 IRI 或来源身份字节替代键种类值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/orderCriterionKind|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Select one of orderContentTier, orderFusedScore, orderActivation or orderSubjectTie on each occurrence."
msgstr "在每个出现项上选择 orderContentTier、orderFusedScore、orderActivation 或 orderSubjectTie 之一。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/orderCriterionKind|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Key-kind selection supplies no candidate key value or execution evidence. Content-tier and activation criteria are included explicitly rather than inferred from data availability."
msgstr "键种类选择不提供候选键值或执行证据。内容层级及激活准则通过显式方式纳入，而不是从数据可用性推断。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/orderCriterionKind|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "An explicit activation key: ex:activationCriterion gmeow:orderCriterionKind gmeow:orderActivation ."
msgstr "显式激活键：ex:activationCriterion gmeow:orderCriterionKind gmeow:orderActivation ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/orderDescending|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "query order descending"
msgstr "查询排序降序"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/orderDescending|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The explicit boolean direction coordinate of one criterion occurrence. This selected profile requires false for content tier and subject tie, and true for fused score and activation."
msgstr "单个准则出现项的显式布尔方向坐标。此所选配置要求内容层级及主体并列取 false，融合分数及激活取 true。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/orderDescending|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain a declared ascending or descending comparison direction as actual typed boolean data."
msgstr "用于将声明的升序或降序比较方向保留为实际类型化布尔数据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/orderDescending|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid string-valued true or false, a missing direction default or a claim that a described reverse direction is supported by this selected profile."
msgstr "避免使用字符串值 true 或 false、为缺失方向赋默认值，或声称此所选配置支持描述的反向方向。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/orderDescending|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Write one xsd:boolean value on each occurrence and check it against the selected key kind’s required direction."
msgstr "在每个出现项上写入一个 xsd:boolean 值，并对照所选键种类要求的方向检查。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/orderDescending|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The direction remains explicitly supplied even though the profile validates its value. No missing declaration is generated from the criterion kind."
msgstr "即使配置验证方向值，方向仍须显式提供。不根据准则种类生成缺失声明。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/orderDescending|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "An explicit descending key: ex:scoreCriterion gmeow:orderDescending \"true\"^^xsd:boolean ."
msgstr "显式降序键：ex:scoreCriterion gmeow:orderDescending \"true\"^^xsd:boolean ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/contentTierBinding|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "content tier binding"
msgstr "内容层级绑定"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/contentTierBinding|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A predicate-to-tier declaration retained by a content-tier criterion occurrence. The candidate tier is the minimum declared label among its matched-literal predicates; a candidate with no matching declaration follows every declared tier."
msgstr "内容层级准则出现项保留的谓词到层级声明。候选层级是其匹配字面量语句中的谓词所对应的最小声明标签；没有匹配声明的候选项排在所有声明层级之后。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/contentTierBinding|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain all predicate mappings of an explicitly selected content-tier comparison key."
msgstr "用于保留显式所选内容层级比较键的全部谓词映射。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/contentTierBinding|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid attaching mappings to score, activation or subject-tie criteria, matching every predicate a subject has or filtering candidates with undeclared predicates."
msgstr "避免将映射附加至分数、激活或主体并列准则、匹配主体具有的每个谓词，或过滤具有未声明谓词的候选项。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/contentTierBinding|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Link each QueryPredicateTierBinding from an orderContentTier occurrence, preserving one binding per predicate within that occurrence."
msgstr "从 orderContentTier 出现项关联每个 QueryPredicateTierBinding，在该出现项内为每个谓词保留一个绑定。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/contentTierBinding|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "A criterion may explicitly contain no mappings, making every candidate undeclared for that key. Shared binding resources do not merge policy occurrences or assert matched-literal evidence."
msgstr "准则可显式不含任何映射，使每个候选项对该键均为未声明。共享绑定资源不合并策略出现项，也不断言匹配字面量证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/contentTierBinding|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Two supplied mappings: ex:tierCriterion gmeow:contentTierBinding ex:labelTier, ex:bodyTier ."
msgstr "两个所提供映射：ex:tierCriterion gmeow:contentTierBinding ex:labelTier, ex:bodyTier ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/tierBindingPredicate|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "content tier binding predicate"
msgstr "内容层级绑定谓词"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/tierBindingPredicate|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The actual source content-predicate IRI mapped by one tier binding. It identifies the predicate on a matched literal statement, without interpreting an arbitrary text label as a predicate or asserting a new predicate schema."
msgstr "一个层级绑定所映射的实际来源内容谓词 IRI。它标识匹配字面量语句上的谓词，不将任意文本标签解释为谓词，也不断言新谓词模式。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/tierBindingPredicate|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to preserve the source predicate identity of a content-tier declaration."
msgstr "用于保留内容层级声明中的来源谓词身份。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/tierBindingPredicate|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid replacing the IRI with a string, blank node, ontology class or an invented semantic identity derived from a source hash."
msgstr "避免用字符串、空白节点、本体类或从来源哈希推导的虚构语义身份替代 IRI。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/tierBindingPredicate|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Link one predicate IRI on the binding and retain the unsigned control-tier label separately through tierBindingOrdinal."
msgstr "在绑定上关联一个谓词 IRI，并通过 tierBindingOrdinal 单独保留无符号控制层级标签。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/tierBindingPredicate|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The bound term-kind check requires an IRI but does not authenticate it, resolve it or prove that any candidate matched a statement using it."
msgstr "对已绑定项的种类检查要求 IRI，但不认证或解析它，也不证明任何候选项匹配过使用该谓词的语句。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/tierBindingPredicate|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "An actual predicate resource: ex:labelTier gmeow:tierBindingPredicate ex:label ."
msgstr "实际谓词资源：ex:labelTier gmeow:tierBindingPredicate ex:label ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/tierBindingOrdinal|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "content tier binding ordinal"
msgstr "内容层级绑定序号"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/tierBindingOrdinal|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The supplied unsigned integer control-tier label assigned to one content predicate. Smaller declared labels precede larger ones, while undeclared candidates remain after every declared label."
msgstr "赋予一个内容谓词的所提供无符号整数控制层级标签。较小声明标签先于较大标签，而未声明候选项保持在每个声明标签之后。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/tierBindingOrdinal|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to preserve a source predicate’s tier label without turning it into a score or measured quantity."
msgstr "用于保留来源谓词的层级标签，不将其变为分数或测得的量。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/tierBindingOrdinal|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid treating the ordinal as a probability, class rank, linear-map rank, physical dimension or a globally preferred classification."
msgstr "避免将序号视为概率、类别名次、线性映射秩、物理量纲或全局偏好分类。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/tierBindingOrdinal|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain one xsd:unsignedInt value on the binding; let the selected content-tier criterion define comparison and undeclared behavior."
msgstr "在绑定上保留一个 xsd:unsignedInt 值；由所选内容层级准则定义比较及未声明情形的行为。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/tierBindingOrdinal|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Equal labels on different predicates are legal and preserve a shared tier. The label’s integer range does not impose contiguous tiers or construct a mathematical Quantity."
msgstr "不同谓词上的相等标签合法，保留共享层级。标签整数范围不施加连续层级，也不构造数学 Quantity。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/tierBindingOrdinal|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A supplied control label: ex:bodyTier gmeow:tierBindingOrdinal \"2\"^^xsd:unsignedInt ."
msgstr "所提供的控制标签：ex:bodyTier gmeow:tierBindingOrdinal \"2\"^^xsd:unsignedInt ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/orderContentTier|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "content tier order key"
msgstr "内容层级排序键"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/orderContentTier|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The content-tier comparison-key kind: a candidate uses the smallest declared control-tier label among the predicates on its matched literal statements, with no declared match ordered after every declared tier."
msgstr "内容层级比较键种类：候选项使用其匹配字面量语句上谓词的最小声明控制层级标签，没有声明匹配的候选项排在所有声明层级之后。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/orderContentTier|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to include matched-content predicate tiers as an explicit policy criterion."
msgstr "用于将匹配内容谓词层级纳入为显式策略准则。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/orderContentTier|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid reading the tier as evidence quality, truth, audience classification or an authorization to filter an undeclared candidate."
msgstr "避免将层级理解为证据质量、真值、受众分类或过滤未声明候选项的授权。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/orderContentTier|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Select this kind on a criterion, declare orderDescending false and retain its contentTierBinding collection."
msgstr "在准则上选择此种类，声明 orderDescending false，并保留其 contentTierBinding 集合。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/orderContentTier|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "An empty binding collection yields a constant undeclared key. Applied matching evidence and assigned candidate tiers are separate from this policy definition."
msgstr "空绑定集合产生恒定未声明键。已应用匹配证据及赋予候选项的层级独立于此策略定义。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/orderContentTier|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A selected tier key: ex:tierCriterion gmeow:orderCriterionKind gmeow:orderContentTier ; gmeow:orderDescending false ."
msgstr "所选层级键：ex:tierCriterion gmeow:orderCriterionKind gmeow:orderContentTier ; gmeow:orderDescending false ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/orderFusedScore|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "fused score order key"
msgstr "融合分数排序键"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/orderFusedScore|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The fused-score comparison-key kind, ordering greater source fused scores first without defining or changing the fusion arithmetic that produced them."
msgstr "融合分数比较键种类，将较大来源融合分数排在前面，不定义或更改生成这些分数的融合算术。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/orderFusedScore|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to place the source fused-score criterion explicitly within a comparison prescription."
msgstr "用于在比较规约中显式放置来源融合分数准则。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/orderFusedScore|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid substituting a reranker’s floating-point score, epistemic confidence or a new arithmetic rule for the source fused-score context."
msgstr "避免用重排器浮点分数、认识置信度或新算术规则替代来源融合分数上下文。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/orderFusedScore|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Select this kind on one criterion with orderDescending true and retain its explicit sequence position."
msgstr "在一个准则上选择此种类，并取 orderDescending true，保留其显式序列位置。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/orderFusedScore|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Every selected policy includes exactly one fused-score occurrence. Actual magnitudes, datatype, dimension, frame and fusion-profile evidence belong to an applied account."
msgstr "每个所选策略恰好包含一个融合分数出现项。实际量值、数据类型、量纲、参照系及融合配置证据属于已应用记录。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/orderFusedScore|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A selected score key: ex:scoreCriterion gmeow:orderCriterionKind gmeow:orderFusedScore ; gmeow:orderDescending true ."
msgstr "所选分数键：ex:scoreCriterion gmeow:orderCriterionKind gmeow:orderFusedScore ; gmeow:orderDescending true ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/orderActivation|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "snapshot activation order key"
msgstr "快照激活排序键"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/orderActivation|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The snapshot-activation comparison-key kind, ordering greater source activation estimates first in the explicitly chosen precedence position. It names a retrieval-history key rather than deployment activation authority."
msgstr "快照激活比较键种类，在显式选定的优先位置将较大来源激活估计排在前面。它命名检索历史键，而不是部署激活权限。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/orderActivation|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to include source snapshot activation estimates as an explicit comparison criterion."
msgstr "用于将来源快照激活估计纳入为显式比较准则。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/orderActivation|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid treating activation magnitude as confidence, truth, permission or a value read from unspecified live counters."
msgstr "避免将激活量值视为置信度、真值、许可或从未指定实时计数器读取的值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/orderActivation|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Select this kind on a criterion with orderDescending true; preserve the chosen position independently of the fused-score criterion."
msgstr "在准则上选择此种类并取 orderDescending true；独立于融合分数准则保留所选位置。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/orderActivation|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The policy definition supplies no measured estimate or snapshot. A later applied account must retain actual source snapshots, vault scope, aggregation conventions and quantitative context."
msgstr "策略定义不提供测得估计或快照。后续已应用记录必须保留实际来源快照、库作用域、聚合约定及定量上下文。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/orderActivation|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A selected snapshot key: ex:activationCriterion gmeow:orderCriterionKind gmeow:orderActivation ; gmeow:orderDescending true ."
msgstr "所选快照键：ex:activationCriterion gmeow:orderCriterionKind gmeow:orderActivation ; gmeow:orderDescending true ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/orderSubjectTie|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "source subject tie order key"
msgstr "来源主体并列排序键"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/orderSubjectTie|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The terminal source-subject-tie comparison-key kind, ordering the source’s subject tie keys ascending after all other declared criteria. It does not replace those keys with canonical RDF tuple order."
msgstr "末尾来源主体并列比较键种类，在所有其他声明准则之后，按来源的主体并列键升序排序。它不使用规范 RDF 元组顺序替代这些键。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/orderSubjectTie|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use as the required final comparison criterion of a complete selected policy definition."
msgstr "用于作为完整所选策略定义的必需最终比较准则。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/orderSubjectTie|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid synthesizing subject digest bytes, assuming an arbitrary IRI lexical order or claiming a non-IRI subject is admitted by a particular source profile."
msgstr "避免合成主体摘要字节、假定任意 IRI 词法顺序，或声称某个来源配置接纳非 IRI 主体。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/orderSubjectTie|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Select this kind on one criterion with orderDescending false and an entryOrdinal greater than every other criterion’s position."
msgstr "在一个准则上选择此种类，取 orderDescending false，并使 entryOrdinal 大于每个其他准则的位置。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/orderSubjectTie|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Actual subject identity, tie bytes and source refusal behavior belong to applied evidence. The declaration authenticates no hash recipe and supplies no missing tie value."
msgstr "实际主体身份、并列字节及来源拒绝行为属于已应用证据。此声明不认证任何哈希方案，也不提供缺失并列值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/orderSubjectTie|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A terminal tie key: ex:tieCriterion gmeow:orderCriterionKind gmeow:orderSubjectTie ; gmeow:orderDescending false ."
msgstr "末尾并列键：ex:tieCriterion gmeow:orderCriterionKind gmeow:orderSubjectTie ; gmeow:orderDescending false ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryOrderCriterionOwnerLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "query order criterion owner law"
msgstr "查询排序准则归属定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryOrderCriterionOwnerLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Every query-order criterion occurrence belongs to exactly one policy sequence. Another policy requires a separate occurrence so its position, kind and direction remain local to that prescription."
msgstr "每个查询排序准则出现项恰好属于一个策略序列。另一策略要求独立出现项，使其位置、种类及方向局限于该规约。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryOrderCriterionOwnerLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to prevent a criterion occurrence from borrowing two policy contexts."
msgstr "用于防止一个准则出现项借用两个策略上下文。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryOrderCriterionOwnerLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid imposing inverse ownership on reusable predicate-tier bindings or equating policies because their criteria have equal coordinates."
msgstr "避免对可复用谓词层级绑定施加逆向归属，或因准则坐标相等而将策略视为同一身份。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryOrderCriterionOwnerLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Require a fresh existing typed policy owner and compare any two policy links to the occurrence through logic:termEqual."
msgstr "要求以新绑定见证一个已有且已类型化的所属策略，并通过 logic:termEqual 比较任意两个关联至该出现项的策略链接。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryOrderCriterionOwnerLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The realized Formula uses one outer universal, a joined owner existential and a guarded owner-pair implication, without a positive nested universal."
msgstr "实现的 Formula 使用一个外层全称量化、连接的所属者存在量化及带守卫的所属者对蕴含，不包含正极性的嵌套全称量化。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryOrderCriterionOwnerLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "One owning policy: ex:policy gmeow:orderCriterion ex:key . ex:key a gmeow:QueryOrderCriterion ."
msgstr "一个所属策略：ex:policy gmeow:orderCriterion ex:key . ex:key a gmeow:QueryOrderCriterion ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryOrderCriterionPositionLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "query order criterion position law"
msgstr "查询排序准则位置定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryOrderCriterionPositionLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Within one query-order policy, equal criterion positions require the same criterion occurrence resource. Different policies retain independent sequence positions."
msgstr "在同一查询排序策略内，相等准则位置要求相同准则出现项资源。不同策略保留独立序列位置。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryOrderCriterionPositionLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to reject competing key occurrences at one supplied precedence position."
msgstr "用于拒绝同一所提供优先位置上相互竞争的键出现项。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryOrderCriterionPositionLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid renumbering source positions, requiring contiguous indices or identifying occurrences across policy boundaries."
msgstr "避免重编号来源位置、要求连续索引或跨策略边界将出现项视为相同。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryOrderCriterionPositionLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Bind two criteria of one policy and their entryOrdinal values; use logic:termEqual on positions and require equality of the occurrence resources."
msgstr "绑定同一策略的两个准则及其 entryOrdinal 值；对位置使用 logic:termEqual，并要求出现项资源相等。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryOrderCriterionPositionLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The admitted integer coordinates express control precedence, not mathematical magnitudes, measured ranks or a source count."
msgstr "可接纳整数坐标表达控制优先顺序，不是数学量值、测得名次或来源数量。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryOrderCriterionPositionLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Distinct precedence positions: ex:first gmeow:entryOrdinal \"0\"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger . ex:last gmeow:entryOrdinal \"3\"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ."
msgstr "不同优先位置：ex:first gmeow:entryOrdinal \"0\"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger . ex:last gmeow:entryOrdinal \"3\"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryOrderCriterionKindLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "query order criterion kind law"
msgstr "查询排序准则种类定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryOrderCriterionKindLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Two criterion occurrences of one policy selecting the same comparison-key kind must be the same occurrence. A policy cannot give one key kind competing precedence positions."
msgstr "同一策略中选择相同比较键种类的两个准则出现项必须是同一出现项。策略不能为一种键种类赋予相互竞争的优先位置。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryOrderCriterionKindLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to reject duplicate content-tier, score, activation or subject-tie occurrences within a definition."
msgstr "用于拒绝定义内重复的内容层级、分数、激活或主体并列出现项。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryOrderCriterionKindLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid treating equal key kinds in different policies as occurrence identity or interpreting duplicate rejection as permission to discard a source declaration."
msgstr "避免将不同策略中的相等键种类视为出现项身份相同，或将重复拒绝理解为丢弃来源声明的许可。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryOrderCriterionKindLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Bind two policy criteria sharing the same orderCriterionKind resource and compare their occurrence identities through logic:termEqual."
msgstr "绑定共享同一 orderCriterionKind 资源的两个策略准则，并通过 logic:termEqual 比较其出现项身份。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryOrderCriterionKindLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The law is scoped to one policy; it imposes no global identity key or cross-policy preference."
msgstr "此定律局限于一个策略；不施加全局身份键或跨策略偏好。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryOrderCriterionKindLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "One selected score occurrence: ex:policy gmeow:orderCriterion ex:scoreKey . ex:scoreKey gmeow:orderCriterionKind gmeow:orderFusedScore ."
msgstr "一个所选分数出现项：ex:policy gmeow:orderCriterion ex:scoreKey . ex:scoreKey gmeow:orderCriterionKind gmeow:orderFusedScore ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryOrderRequiredKeysLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "query order required keys law"
msgstr "查询排序必需键定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryOrderRequiredKeysLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Every selected query-order policy contains a typed fused-score criterion and a typed source-subject-tie criterion. Optional leading keys never replace those required comparison coordinates."
msgstr "每个所选查询排序策略都包含类型化融合分数准则及类型化来源主体并列准则。可选前置键绝不替代这些必需比较坐标。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryOrderRequiredKeysLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to reject a partial prescription presented as a complete selected order definition."
msgstr "用于拒绝被当作完整所选排序定义呈现的部分规约。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryOrderRequiredKeysLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid manufacturing absent keys, treating empty criterion membership as a default policy or equating criterion existence with measured candidate values."
msgstr "避免制造缺失键、将空准则成员关系视为默认策略，或将准则存在等同于测得候选值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryOrderRequiredKeysLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Require distinct fresh typed-and-linked existential witnesses for orderFusedScore and orderSubjectTie; kind uniqueness supplies one occurrence of each."
msgstr "为 orderFusedScore 及 orderSubjectTie 要求独立新绑定的类型化且已关联存在见证；种类唯一性保证两者各有一个出现项。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryOrderRequiredKeysLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Each witness must belong to the policy rather than merely exist elsewhere. Local coordinate restrictions independently require position, kind and explicit direction."
msgstr "每个见证必须属于该策略，而不只是存在于别处。局部坐标限制独立要求位置、种类及显式方向。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryOrderRequiredKeysLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A minimal complete collection: ex:policy gmeow:orderCriterion ex:scoreKey, ex:tieKey . ex:scoreKey gmeow:orderCriterionKind gmeow:orderFusedScore . ex:tieKey gmeow:orderCriterionKind gmeow:orderSubjectTie ."
msgstr "最小完整集合：ex:policy gmeow:orderCriterion ex:scoreKey, ex:tieKey . ex:scoreKey gmeow:orderCriterionKind gmeow:orderFusedScore . ex:tieKey gmeow:orderCriterionKind gmeow:orderSubjectTie ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryOrderTerminalTieLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "query order terminal tie law"
msgstr "查询排序末尾并列定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryOrderTerminalTieLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The source-subject-tie criterion has a greater precedence ordinal than every other criterion in its policy. It is the final key without requiring contiguous positions."
msgstr "来源主体并列准则的优先序号大于其策略中每个其他准则的序号。它是最终键，不要求连续位置。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryOrderTerminalTieLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to reject a policy that places another criterion after its terminal tie key."
msgstr "用于拒绝在末尾并列键之后放置另一准则的策略。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryOrderTerminalTieLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid replacing source tie semantics with canonical RDF tuple order or claiming that terminal placement constructs actual tie bytes."
msgstr "避免用规范 RDF 元组顺序替代来源并列语义，或声称末尾位置构造实际并列字节。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryOrderTerminalTieLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Bind the policy’s tie occurrence, another distinct criterion and both stored positions; require logic:termLess from the other position to the tie position."
msgstr "绑定策略的并列出现项、另一不同准则及两个存储位置；要求从另一位置到并列位置满足 logic:termLess。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryOrderTerminalTieLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Occurrence distinction and positions are positively bound before intrinsic comparison. Actual candidate ties and source admission remain outside this definition check."
msgstr "在内建比较之前，出现项区别及位置已被正向绑定。实际候选并列及来源接纳仍在此定义检查之外。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryOrderTerminalTieLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A later terminal coordinate: ex:scoreKey gmeow:entryOrdinal \"1\"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger . ex:tieKey gmeow:entryOrdinal \"5\"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ."
msgstr "较后的末尾坐标：ex:scoreKey gmeow:entryOrdinal \"1\"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger . ex:tieKey gmeow:entryOrdinal \"5\"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryOrderDirectionLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "query order direction law"
msgstr "查询排序方向定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryOrderDirectionLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The selected policy profile validates ascending content-tier and subject-tie directions, and descending fused-score and activation directions. Every direction remains explicitly declared as typed boolean data."
msgstr "所选策略配置验证内容层级及主体并列的升序方向，以及融合分数及激活的降序方向。每个方向仍被显式声明为类型化布尔数据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryOrderDirectionLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to reject a supplied direction that disagrees with its selected key kind’s admitted source-standard direction."
msgstr "用于拒绝与所选键种类接纳的来源标准方向不一致的所提供方向。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryOrderDirectionLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid deriving a missing direction, comparing string booleans or claiming that a reverse ordering is supported by this profile."
msgstr "避免推导缺失方向、比较字符串布尔值或声称此配置支持反向排序。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryOrderDirectionLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Bind the stored kind and boolean direction, then require logic:termEqual to typed false for tier or tie and typed true for score or activation."
msgstr "绑定存储种类及布尔方向，然后要求与类型化值满足 logic:termEqual：层级或并列对应 false，分数或激活对应 true。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryOrderDirectionLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The law checks declaration agreement only. It neither compares candidate magnitudes nor certifies that a consumer implemented the policy sequence."
msgstr "此定律仅检查声明一致性。它既不比较候选量值，也不认证消费者已实现策略序列。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryOrderDirectionLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Explicit admitted directions: ex:tierKey gmeow:orderDescending \"false\"^^xsd:boolean . ex:scoreKey gmeow:orderDescending \"true\"^^xsd:boolean ."
msgstr "显式可接纳方向：ex:tierKey gmeow:orderDescending \"false\"^^xsd:boolean . ex:scoreKey gmeow:orderDescending \"true\"^^xsd:boolean ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryOrderTierBindingScopeLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "query order tier binding scope law"
msgstr "查询排序层级绑定作用域定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryOrderTierBindingScopeLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Predicate-tier bindings occur only on a content-tier criterion. Score, activation and subject-tie occurrences cannot acquire mappings that would silently introduce another comparison key."
msgstr "谓词层级绑定仅出现在内容层级准则上。分数、激活及主体并列出现项不能获取会静默引入另一比较键的映射。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryOrderTierBindingScopeLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to reject bindings attached to the wrong criterion kind."
msgstr "用于拒绝附加到错误准则种类的绑定。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryOrderTierBindingScopeLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid requiring a nonempty mapping collection, treating no mappings as missing candidate data or filtering every undeclared candidate."
msgstr "避免要求非空映射集合、将无映射视为候选数据缺失或过滤每个未声明候选项。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryOrderTierBindingScopeLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Bind a criterion with contentTierBinding and require its selected orderCriterionKind to be orderContentTier."
msgstr "绑定具有 contentTierBinding 的准则，并要求其所选 orderCriterionKind 为 orderContentTier。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryOrderTierBindingScopeLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "A content-tier criterion with no mappings yields a constant undeclared key. Mapping completeness and actual matched statements are separate source evidence."
msgstr "无映射的内容层级准则产生恒定未声明键。映射完整性及实际匹配语句是独立来源证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryOrderTierBindingScopeLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A correctly scoped mapping: ex:tierKey gmeow:orderCriterionKind gmeow:orderContentTier ; gmeow:contentTierBinding ex:labelTier ."
msgstr "作用域正确的映射：ex:tierKey gmeow:orderCriterionKind gmeow:orderContentTier ; gmeow:contentTierBinding ex:labelTier ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryOrderTierPredicateLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "query order tier predicate law"
msgstr "查询排序层级谓词定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryOrderTierPredicateLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Every predicate coordinate retained by a query tier binding is an actual IRI term. A string or blank node does not stand in for the source predicate."
msgstr "查询层级绑定保留的每个谓词坐标都是实际 IRI 项。字符串或空白节点不替代来源谓词。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryOrderTierPredicateLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to reject malformed term kinds in predicate-to-tier declarations."
msgstr "用于拒绝谓词到层级声明中格式错误的项种类。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryOrderTierPredicateLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid interpreting IRI admission as dereferencing, schema validation, source authentication or evidence that a candidate matched the predicate."
msgstr "避免将 IRI 接纳理解为解引用、模式验证、来源认证或候选项匹配了该谓词的证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryOrderTierPredicateLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Bind the typed binding’s tierBindingPredicate value through its stored edge and apply unary logic:termIsIri."
msgstr "通过类型化绑定的存储边绑定其 tierBindingPredicate 值，并应用一元 logic:termIsIri。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryOrderTierPredicateLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The required coordinate restriction handles presence separately. This term-kind check introduces no generic parser or inferred predicate class."
msgstr "必需坐标限制单独处理存在性。此项种类检查不引入通用解析器或推断的谓词类。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryOrderTierPredicateLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A valid term kind: ex:labelTier gmeow:tierBindingPredicate ex:label ."
msgstr "有效项种类：ex:labelTier gmeow:tierBindingPredicate ex:label ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryOrderTierUniquenessLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "query order tier uniqueness law"
msgstr "查询排序层级唯一性定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryOrderTierUniquenessLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Within one content-tier criterion, two binding records naming the same predicate must be the same selected binding. The binding’s own single ordinal prevents competing mappings for that predicate."
msgstr "在一个内容层级准则内，命名相同谓词的两个绑定记录必须是同一所选绑定。绑定自身的单个序号防止该谓词具有相互竞争的映射。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryOrderTierUniquenessLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to validate the selected unique-predicate mapping profile."
msgstr "用于验证所选唯一谓词映射配置。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryOrderTierUniquenessLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid silently applying native last-wins duplicate resolution, merging equal mappings globally or imposing one policy owner on a reusable binding."
msgstr "避免静默应用原生的重复项最后生效消解规则、全局合并相等映射或为可复用绑定施加单个所属策略。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryOrderTierUniquenessLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Bind two retained mappings and their common predicate IRI within one content-tier criterion, then require logic:termEqual on binding identities."
msgstr "在一个内容层级准则内绑定两个保留映射及其共同谓词 IRI，然后要求绑定身份满足 logic:termEqual。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryOrderTierUniquenessLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Equal tier labels on different predicates remain legal. Other policies may reuse the same binding or retain their own declaration without an identity inference."
msgstr "不同谓词上的相等层级标签仍合法。其他策略可以复用同一绑定或保留自身声明，不推断身份相同。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryOrderTierUniquenessLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A shared tier for different predicates: ex:tierKey gmeow:contentTierBinding ex:labelTier, ex:bodyTier . ex:labelTier gmeow:tierBindingPredicate ex:label . ex:bodyTier gmeow:tierBindingPredicate ex:body ."
msgstr "不同谓词共享的层级：ex:tierKey gmeow:contentTierBinding ex:labelTier, ex:bodyTier . ex:labelTier gmeow:tierBindingPredicate ex:label . ex:bodyTier gmeow:tierBindingPredicate ex:body ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAcceptedReasonFold|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Query Accepted Reason Fold"
msgstr "查询已接受理由折叠"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAcceptedReasonFold|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A query-operation description declaring complete original established and undecided row partitions, an accepted reason selection and the known-reason inventory of a named original evidence workspace. It retains established rows and admits an undecided row exactly when any original reason is selected."
msgstr "一种查询操作描述，声明完整的原始已确立及未决行分区、已接受理由选择，以及具名原始证据工作区的已知理由清单。它保留已确立行，且当任一原始理由被选择时恰好接纳未决行。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAcceptedReasonFold|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to describe a selected accepted-reason fold over retained original row occurrences without re-querying or recomputing their payload."
msgstr "用于描述对保留原始行出现项的所选已接受理由折叠，不重新查询或重算其载荷。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAcceptedReasonFold|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid treating acceptance as repaired evidence, complete information, a candidate-union operation or proof that the description executed."
msgstr "避免将接受视为修复的证据、完整信息、候选并集操作或描述已执行的证明。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAcceptedReasonFold|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Supply acceptedFoldInput, acceptedFoldOutput and foldEvidenceWorkspace, declare the complete foldEstablishedRow, foldUndecidedRow, foldAcceptedReason and foldKnownReason collections, and retain inherited node effect and stratum declarations."
msgstr "提供 acceptedFoldInput、acceptedFoldOutput 及 foldEvidenceWorkspace，声明完整的 foldEstablishedRow、foldUndecidedRow、foldAcceptedReason 及 foldKnownReason 集合，并保留继承的节点效应及层级声明。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAcceptedReasonFold|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Class membership selects complete supplied collections; no edges means declared empty in that profile. An importer must fail on unavailable or truncated source lists and must not import a terminal-error prefix as a successful complete fold."
msgstr "类成员关系选择完整的所提供集合；在此配置中，无边表示声明为空。导入器必须拒绝不可用或截断的来源列表，不能将终端错误前的前缀作为成功完整折叠导入。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAcceptedReasonFold|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A selected fold: ex:fold a gmeow:QueryAcceptedReasonFold ; gmeow:acceptedFoldInput ex:original ; gmeow:acceptedFoldOutput ex:folded ; gmeow:foldEvidenceWorkspace ex:workspace ."
msgstr "所选折叠：ex:fold a gmeow:QueryAcceptedReasonFold ; gmeow:acceptedFoldInput ex:original ; gmeow:acceptedFoldOutput ex:folded ; gmeow:foldEvidenceWorkspace ex:workspace ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAcceptedReasonAnswer|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Query Accepted Reason Answer"
msgstr "查询已接受理由答案"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAcceptedReasonAnswer|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "An attributed selected fold answer retaining its original answer, exactly the declared established rows and undecided rows with accepted overlap, and separate answer-local acceptance annotations. Every such answer has an incoming typed selected fold operation."
msgstr "带有归属的所选折叠答案，保留其原始答案、恰好的声明已确立行及有已接受交集的未决行，并保留独立的答案内接受注释。每个此类答案都有入向类型化所选折叠操作。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAcceptedReasonAnswer|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain a supplied accepted-reason result with original row identities and the exact original query and loss-ledger resource collections."
msgstr "用于保留所提供已接受理由结果，以及原始行身份和确切的原始查询及损失账本资源集合。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAcceptedReasonAnswer|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring execution, aggregate completeness or a unique inverse operation owner from the answer type."
msgstr "避免从答案类型推断执行、聚合完整性或逆向唯一所属操作。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAcceptedReasonAnswer|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Supply acceptedFoldOriginal and an incoming acceptedFoldOutput from a typed QueryAcceptedReasonFold; retain solutionRow membership, required query and ledger contexts, and rowAcceptance annotations for admitted undecided rows."
msgstr "提供 acceptedFoldOriginal 及来自类型化 QueryAcceptedReasonFold 的入向 acceptedFoldOutput；保留 solutionRow 成员关系、必需查询和账本上下文，以及已接纳未决行的 rowAcceptance 注释。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAcceptedReasonAnswer|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Several operation descriptions may share an answer only when all operation-relative membership and accepted-intersection laws agree. Original row content authentication and successful native iterator completion are importer requirements."
msgstr "仅当全部操作相对成员关系及已接受交集定律一致时，多个操作描述才能共享答案。原始行内容认证及原生迭代器成功完成是导入器要求。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAcceptedReasonAnswer|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "An attributed fold result: ex:folded a gmeow:QueryAcceptedReasonAnswer ; gmeow:acceptedFoldOriginal ex:original ; gmeow:solutionRow ex:row ."
msgstr "带有归属的折叠结果：ex:folded a gmeow:QueryAcceptedReasonAnswer ; gmeow:acceptedFoldOriginal ex:original ; gmeow:solutionRow ex:row ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryOrderedEvidenceRow|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Query Ordered Evidence Row"
msgstr "查询有序证据行"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryOrderedEvidenceRow|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "An original solution-row occurrence declaring its complete supplied original reason collection, one original sequence position in the unsigned 64-bit value domain and one original evidence resource. The same occurrence can be retained by original and folded answers."
msgstr "原始解行出现项，声明其完整的所提供原始理由集合、无符号 64 位值域内的一个原始序列位置及一个原始证据资源。原始答案和折叠答案可以保留同一出现项。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryOrderedEvidenceRow|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use for an original retained row whose source order and evidence identity must survive accepted-reason folding."
msgstr "用于在已接受理由折叠后仍须保留来源顺序及证据身份的原始保留行。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryOrderedEvidenceRow|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid replacing occurrence identity with equal bindings, assigning a new dense output rank or claiming that an unchanged resource name authenticates unchanged payload."
msgstr "避免用相等绑定替代出现项身份、赋予新的稠密输出名次，或声称资源名称不变就认证了载荷不变。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryOrderedEvidenceRow|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Supply entryOrdinal as xsd:nonNegativeInteger no greater than 18446744073709551615, orderedRowEvidence and the complete supplied solutionReason collection; retain solutionFrame when supplied without overwriting it with acceptance context."
msgstr "提供不大于 18446744073709551615 的 xsd:nonNegativeInteger 类型 entryOrdinal、orderedRowEvidence 及完整的所提供 solutionReason 集合；在提供 solutionFrame 时保留它，不用接受上下文覆盖。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryOrderedEvidenceRow|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "There is no inverse answer-owner, required-reason or exclusive-frame rule. Empty declared reasons are permitted; unavailable reasons must fail import before asserting this complete profile. Authentic payload, evidence and reason preservation is not proved by graph identity alone."
msgstr "不施加逆向答案归属、理由必需或排他框架规则。允许声明的空理由集合；在断言此完整配置前，不可用理由必须导致导入失败。仅凭图身份不证明真实载荷、证据及理由得以保留。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryOrderedEvidenceRow|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "An original occurrence: ex:row a gmeow:QueryOrderedEvidenceRow ; gmeow:entryOrdinal \"4\"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ; gmeow:orderedRowEvidence ex:evidence ."
msgstr "原始出现项：ex:row a gmeow:QueryOrderedEvidenceRow ; gmeow:entryOrdinal \"4\"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ; gmeow:orderedRowEvidence ex:evidence ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRowAcceptance|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Query Row Acceptance"
msgstr "查询行接受"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRowAcceptance|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "An answer-local visible acceptance annotation naming one retained original undecided row and exactly its accepted original reasons. The annotation belongs to exactly one folded answer and does not replace the row or its original evidence."
msgstr "答案内可见接受注释，命名一个保留的原始未决行及恰好的已接受原始理由。注释恰好属于一个折叠答案，不替代该行或其原始证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRowAcceptance|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to keep selection-dependent accepted reasons separate from the original full row-reason collection."
msgstr "用于将依赖选择的已接受理由与行的完整原始理由集合分开。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRowAcceptance|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid annotating an established row, sharing the annotation between answers or treating acceptance as a new truth or completeness verdict."
msgstr "避免注释已确立行、跨答案共享注释，或将接受视为新的真值或完整性判定。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRowAcceptance|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Link the annotation from its answer through rowAcceptance, supply one acceptanceOriginalRow and retain every acceptanceReason in the original-reason and selected-reason intersection."
msgstr "从其答案通过 rowAcceptance 关联注释，提供一个 acceptanceOriginalRow，并保留原始理由与所选理由交集中的每个 acceptanceReason。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRowAcceptance|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Other answers may annotate the same original row with separate occurrences. This resource is not an invented native accepted-row digest or an immutable-content certificate."
msgstr "其他答案可以用独立出现项注释同一原始行。此资源不是虚构的原生已接受行摘要或不可变内容证书。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRowAcceptance|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A separate annotation: ex:accepted a gmeow:QueryRowAcceptance ; gmeow:acceptanceOriginalRow ex:row ; gmeow:acceptanceReason ex:reason ."
msgstr "独立注释：ex:accepted a gmeow:QueryRowAcceptance ; gmeow:acceptanceOriginalRow ex:row ; gmeow:acceptanceReason ex:reason ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/acceptedFoldInput|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "accepted fold original input"
msgstr "已接受折叠原始输入"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/acceptedFoldInput|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The one original attributed query answer whose complete row collection is partitioned by this selected fold."
msgstr "单个带有归属的原始查询答案，其完整行集合由此所选折叠划分。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/acceptedFoldInput|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain the original answer resource rather than a reconstructed row list."
msgstr "用于保留原始答案资源，而不是重建的行列表。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/acceptedFoldInput|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid using mergeAnswerInput, silently omitting original rows or treating input membership as source authentication."
msgstr "避免使用 mergeAnswerInput、静默遗漏原始行，或将输入成员关系视为来源认证。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/acceptedFoldInput|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Reference one QueryAnswer and declare its complete established and undecided partitions on the operation."
msgstr "引用一个 QueryAnswer，并在操作上声明其完整已确立及未决分区。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/acceptedFoldInput|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The input may have no rows. Its existing queryAnswerFor and queryLossLedger paths remain required nonfunctional collections."
msgstr "输入可以没有行。其现有 queryAnswerFor 及 queryLossLedger 路径仍是必需且非函数性的集合。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/acceptedFoldInput|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "An original input: ex:fold gmeow:acceptedFoldInput ex:original ."
msgstr "原始输入：ex:fold gmeow:acceptedFoldInput ex:original ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/acceptedFoldOutput|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "accepted fold output"
msgstr "已接受折叠输出"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/acceptedFoldOutput|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The one supplied selected fold answer whose retained rows and acceptance annotations agree with this operation’s original partitions and accepted selection."
msgstr "单个所提供所选折叠答案，其保留行及接受注释与此操作的原始分区及已接受选择一致。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/acceptedFoldOutput|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to bind the declared fold operation to its supplied attributed result."
msgstr "用于将声明折叠操作与其所提供的带有归属结果绑定。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/acceptedFoldOutput|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid interpreting the edge as proof of execution or imposing one inverse operation owner on the result."
msgstr "避免将此边理解为执行证明，或为结果施加逆向唯一所属操作。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/acceptedFoldOutput|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Reference one QueryAcceptedReasonAnswer with matching acceptedFoldOriginal and exact declared row and acceptance collections."
msgstr "引用一个 QueryAcceptedReasonAnswer，使 acceptedFoldOriginal 一致，并具有确切声明的行及接受集合。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/acceptedFoldOutput|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Every typed folded answer requires some incoming typed fold operation. Multiple descriptions can name one output when all their exactness laws agree."
msgstr "每个类型化折叠答案都要求某个入向类型化折叠操作。当全部精确定律一致时，多个描述可以命名同一输出。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/acceptedFoldOutput|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A supplied result: ex:fold gmeow:acceptedFoldOutput ex:folded ."
msgstr "所提供的结果：ex:fold gmeow:acceptedFoldOutput ex:folded ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/acceptedFoldOriginal|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "accepted fold retained original answer"
msgstr "已接受折叠保留的原始答案"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/acceptedFoldOriginal|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The one original QueryAnswer retained by a selected fold answer, agreeing by resource identity with every incoming selected fold operation’s input."
msgstr "所选折叠答案保留的单个原始 QueryAnswer，按资源身份与每个入向所选折叠操作的输入一致。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/acceptedFoldOriginal|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to keep the original rows, evidence and context accessible beside the filtered result."
msgstr "用于在过滤结果旁维持对原始行、证据及上下文的访问。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/acceptedFoldOriginal|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid replacing the original with an equal-binding answer or assuming that its resource name proves immutable source content."
msgstr "避免用绑定相等的答案替代原始答案，或假定其资源名称证明来源内容不可变。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/acceptedFoldOriginal|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Supply one original answer and retain its exact queryAnswerFor and queryLossLedger collections on the folded answer in both directions."
msgstr "提供一个原始答案，并在折叠答案上双向保留其确切 queryAnswerFor 及 queryLossLedger 集合。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/acceptedFoldOriginal|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Original and folded answers may reference the same row occurrences. This link does not select an aggregate information or completeness status."
msgstr "原始答案及折叠答案可以引用相同行出现项。此链接不选择聚合信息或完整性状态。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/acceptedFoldOriginal|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "The retained original: ex:folded gmeow:acceptedFoldOriginal ex:original ."
msgstr "保留的原始答案：ex:folded gmeow:acceptedFoldOriginal ex:original ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/foldEstablishedRow|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "fold established row"
msgstr "折叠已确立行"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/foldEstablishedRow|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "An original row in this operation’s complete source-established partition. Every such row is retained unconditionally, without a visible acceptance annotation."
msgstr "此操作完整来源已确立分区中的原始行。每个此类行都无条件保留，不附可见接受注释。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/foldEstablishedRow|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to declare the original established partition separately from undecided admission."
msgstr "用于单独声明原始已确立分区，与未决接纳分开。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/foldEstablishedRow|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid requiring accepted overlap for established rows or deriving established membership from missing status fields."
msgstr "避免要求已确立行具有已接受交集，或从缺失状态字段推导已确立成员关系。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/foldEstablishedRow|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Link each original established occurrence and retain it in the output solutionRow collection without rowAcceptance for that row."
msgstr "关联每个原始已确立出现项，并在输出 solutionRow 集合中保留它，不为该行提供 rowAcceptance。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/foldEstablishedRow|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The established and undecided partitions are disjoint and together equal the original answer’s declared row collection. An established row may itself have reasons overlapping the accepted set."
msgstr "已确立及未决分区互不相交，合起来恰好等于原始答案的声明行集合。已确立行本身可以具有与已接受集相交的理由。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/foldEstablishedRow|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "An unconditional retained row: ex:fold gmeow:foldEstablishedRow ex:establishedRow ."
msgstr "无条件保留行：ex:fold gmeow:foldEstablishedRow ex:establishedRow ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/foldUndecidedRow|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "fold undecided row"
msgstr "折叠未决行"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/foldUndecidedRow|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "An original row in this operation’s complete source-undecided partition, admitted exactly when at least one original solutionReason belongs to the selected accepted set."
msgstr "此操作完整来源未决分区中的原始行，当且仅当至少一个原始 solutionReason 属于所选已接受集时接纳。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/foldUndecidedRow|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to declare rows whose visible admission depends on explicit accepted-reason overlap."
msgstr "用于声明可见接纳依赖显式已接受理由交集的行。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/foldUndecidedRow|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid requiring all reasons to be accepted, removing nonaccepted original reasons or treating an absent partition as a status default."
msgstr "避免要求全部理由被接受、删除未接受原始理由，或将缺失分区视为状态默认值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/foldUndecidedRow|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Link each original undecided occurrence, retain it only on accepted overlap and supply a separate answer-local annotation containing the exact accepted intersection."
msgstr "关联每个原始未决出现项，仅在存在已接受交集时保留它，并提供包含精确已接受交集的独立答案内注释。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/foldUndecidedRow|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "A row with no declared reasons has no overlap and cannot be admitted as undecided. Complete source reasons must be available to the importer before this profile is asserted."
msgstr "没有声明理由的行没有交集，不能作为未决行被接纳。在断言此配置前，导入器必须获得完整来源理由。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/foldUndecidedRow|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A conditionally admitted row: ex:fold gmeow:foldUndecidedRow ex:undecidedRow ."
msgstr "有条件接纳的行：ex:fold gmeow:foldUndecidedRow ex:undecidedRow ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/foldAcceptedReason|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "fold accepted reason selection"
msgstr "折叠已接受理由选择"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/foldAcceptedReason|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A reason resource in this operation’s complete explicitly selected acceptance set. Every selected reason belongs to the declared known inventory of the named original evidence workspace."
msgstr "此操作完整显式所选接受集中的理由资源。每个所选理由都属于具名原始证据工作区声明的已知清单。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/foldAcceptedReason|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain the supplied accepted reason identities without rewriting original reasons or evidence."
msgstr "用于保留所提供已接受理由身份，不改写原始理由或证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/foldAcceptedReason|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid equating acceptance with an Agent’s loss acknowledgement, positive proof, repaired completeness or the union of reasons on emitted rows."
msgstr "避免将接受等同于 Agent 的损失确认、正面证明、修复的完整性或已发出行上理由的并集。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/foldAcceptedReason|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Link every selected original reason identity and retain the complete foldKnownReason inventory and foldEvidenceWorkspace context."
msgstr "关联每个所选原始理由身份，并保留完整 foldKnownReason 清单及 foldEvidenceWorkspace 上下文。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/foldAcceptedReason|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The selected set may be explicitly empty or contain a known reason unused by all selected rows. RDF set membership does not certify native sorted unique ID bytes or authenticate source availability."
msgstr "所选集合可以显式为空，或包含没有任何所选行使用的已知理由。RDF 集合成员关系不认证原生排序唯一 ID 字节，也不认证来源可用性。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/foldAcceptedReason|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "An explicit accepted member: ex:fold gmeow:foldAcceptedReason ex:reasonA ."
msgstr "显式已接受成员：ex:fold gmeow:foldAcceptedReason ex:reasonA ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/foldEvidenceWorkspace|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "fold original evidence workspace"
msgstr "折叠原始证据工作区"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/foldEvidenceWorkspace|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The one supplied original source evidence-owner context whose complete reason inventory is declared by this operation’s foldKnownReason collection."
msgstr "单个所提供原始来源证据所属上下文，其完整理由清单由此操作的 foldKnownReason 集合声明。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/foldEvidenceWorkspace|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to scope known accepted identities to the actual original evidence context."
msgstr "用于将已知接受身份限定在实际原始证据上下文内。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/foldEvidenceWorkspace|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid treating a resource reference as live memory access, owner liveness, source authentication or an instruction to create missing evidence."
msgstr "避免将资源引用视为实时内存访问、所属者存活性、来源认证或创建缺失证据的指令。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/foldEvidenceWorkspace|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain one supplied original workspace resource and its complete known-reason inventory without inventing a native ownership or hash recipe."
msgstr "保留一个所提供原始工作区资源及其完整已知理由清单，不虚构原生归属或哈希方案。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/foldEvidenceWorkspace|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The importer must validate actual selected source owner admission and fail on aborted ownership or unavailable evidence. Graph references alone do not establish those native conditions."
msgstr "导入器必须验证实际所选来源所属者接纳，并在归属中止或证据不可用时失败。仅有图引用不确立这些原生条件。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/foldEvidenceWorkspace|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "An original evidence context: ex:fold gmeow:foldEvidenceWorkspace ex:workspace ."
msgstr "原始证据上下文：ex:fold gmeow:foldEvidenceWorkspace ex:workspace ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/foldKnownReason|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "fold workspace known reason"
msgstr "折叠工作区已知理由"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/foldKnownReason|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A reason resource in the declared complete inventory of the operation’s named original evidence workspace. The inventory can include reasons unused by the selected original rows."
msgstr "操作具名原始证据工作区声明完整清单中的理由资源。清单可以包含所选原始行未使用的理由。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/foldKnownReason|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain the workspace-wide acceptance-admission scope instead of substituting the selected-row reason union."
msgstr "用于保留工作区范围的接受接纳作用域，而不是替换为所选行理由并集。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/foldKnownReason|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid rejecting an accepted reason merely because no selected row uses it or claiming that an invented known edge authenticates native evidence."
msgstr "避免仅因没有所选行使用某已接受理由而拒绝它，或声称虚构的已知边认证原生证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/foldKnownReason|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Declare every known reason supplied by the original workspace and require every foldAcceptedReason to belong to that same operation’s inventory."
msgstr "声明原始工作区提供的每个已知理由，并要求每个 foldAcceptedReason 属于同一操作的清单。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/foldKnownReason|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "An explicitly empty inventory is permitted only as a complete source declaration. Unavailable or truncated inventories must fail import before asserting this profile."
msgstr "仅作为完整来源声明时才允许显式空清单。在断言此配置前，不可用或截断清单必须导致导入失败。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/foldKnownReason|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A known unused reason: ex:fold gmeow:foldKnownReason ex:reasonUnused ."
msgstr "已知但未用的理由：ex:fold gmeow:foldKnownReason ex:reasonUnused ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/orderedRowEvidence|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "ordered row original evidence"
msgstr "有序行原始证据"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/orderedRowEvidence|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The one supplied original evidence resource retained by an ordered row occurrence. Its identity stays separate from the answer-local acceptance annotation."
msgstr "有序行出现项保留的单个所提供原始证据资源。其身份与答案内接受注释分开。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/orderedRowEvidence|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to preserve access to the row’s original evidence context while accepted reasons remain visibly separate."
msgstr "用于在已接受理由保持可见独立的同时，保留对行原始证据上下文的访问。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/orderedRowEvidence|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid rewriting original evidence as complete, substituting a generic reasoning result or claiming that resource identity validates immutable content."
msgstr "避免将原始证据改写为完整、替换为通用推理结果，或声称资源身份验证了不可变内容。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/orderedRowEvidence|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Link the actual supplied original evidence resource and preserve its authentic payload, information, completeness, reasons and frame through the importer."
msgstr "关联实际所提供原始证据资源，并由导入器保留其真实载荷、信息、完整性、理由及框架。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/orderedRowEvidence|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The required link and its resource identity are graph obligations. Authentic evidence contents, native owner liveness and preservation across edits require source admission; they are not proved by this association."
msgstr "必需链接及其资源身份是图义务。真实证据内容、原生所属者存活性及跨编辑保留要求来源接纳；此关联不证明它们。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/orderedRowEvidence|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Original evidence retained: ex:row gmeow:orderedRowEvidence ex:originalEvidence ."
msgstr "保留原始证据：ex:row gmeow:orderedRowEvidence ex:originalEvidence ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rowAcceptance|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "fold row acceptance annotation"
msgstr "折叠行接受注释"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rowAcceptance|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "An answer-local annotation for one retained original undecided row, carrying exactly the selected original reasons that overlap the operation’s accepted set."
msgstr "答案内注释，用于一个保留的原始未决行，恰好携带与操作已接受集相交的所选原始理由。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rowAcceptance|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to expose acceptance without replacing the original row or removing its other reasons."
msgstr "用于公开接受，而不替代原始行或删除其其他理由。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rowAcceptance|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid annotating established rows, sharing annotation occurrences across answers or treating RDF serialization order as source row order."
msgstr "避免注释已确立行、跨答案共享注释出现项，或将 RDF 序列化顺序视为来源行顺序。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rowAcceptance|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Link one QueryRowAcceptance per admitted undecided row and preserve its acceptanceOriginalRow and nonempty acceptanceReason intersection."
msgstr "为每个已接纳未决行关联一个 QueryRowAcceptance，并保留其 acceptanceOriginalRow 及非空 acceptanceReason 交集。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rowAcceptance|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "An explicitly empty accepted set yields no annotations. Each annotation has one answer owner; the answer itself may have several consistent incoming selected fold descriptions."
msgstr "显式空已接受集不产生注释。每个注释具有一个所属答案；答案本身可以有多个一致的入向所选折叠描述。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rowAcceptance|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Visible acceptance retained separately: ex:folded gmeow:rowAcceptance ex:annotation ."
msgstr "独立保留的可见接受：ex:folded gmeow:rowAcceptance ex:annotation ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/acceptanceOriginalRow|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "acceptance original row"
msgstr "接受原始行"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/acceptanceOriginalRow|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The one original retained undecided row occurrence described by an answer-local acceptance annotation."
msgstr "答案内接受注释描述的单个保留原始未决行出现项。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/acceptanceOriginalRow|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to preserve the distinction between original row identity and visible acceptance context."
msgstr "用于保留原始行身份与可见接受上下文之间的区分。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/acceptanceOriginalRow|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid identifying a replacement row by equal bindings or using the annotation as a new original evidence record."
msgstr "避免按相等绑定标识替代行，或将注释用作新的原始证据记录。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/acceptanceOriginalRow|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Reference the same original occurrence present in the owning answer’s solutionRow collection and the selected operation’s undecided partition."
msgstr "引用同一个原始出现项，它位于所属答案的 solutionRow 集合及所选操作的未决分区中。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/acceptanceOriginalRow|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Within one answer there is one annotation per original row. Other answers may reuse the row through distinct annotations without imposing an inverse row-owner rule."
msgstr "在同一答案内，针对同一原始行的接受注释唯一。其他答案可以通过独立注释复用该行，不施加逆向行归属规则。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/acceptanceOriginalRow|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "The original occurrence: ex:annotation gmeow:acceptanceOriginalRow ex:row ."
msgstr "原始出现项：ex:annotation gmeow:acceptanceOriginalRow ex:row ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/acceptanceReason|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "visible accepted original reason"
msgstr "可见已接受原始理由"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/acceptanceReason|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "An original row reason that also belongs to the selected operation’s accepted set, retained in the exact nonempty intersection exposed by an answer-local acceptance annotation."
msgstr "同时属于所选操作已接受集的原始行理由，保留在答案内接受注释公开的精确非空交集中。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/acceptanceReason|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to show precisely which original reasons were accepted while retaining every original reason on the row."
msgstr "用于准确显示哪些原始理由被接受，同时在行上保留每个原始理由。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/acceptanceReason|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid adding a reason absent from either source collection, deleting unaccepted original reasons or interpreting acceptance as repaired truth or completeness."
msgstr "避免添加任一来源集合中不存在的理由、删除未接受原始理由，或将接受理解为修复的真值或完整性。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/acceptanceReason|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain all and only reason resources linked both by solutionReason from the original row and by foldAcceptedReason from the operation."
msgstr "恰好保留同时由原始行通过 solutionReason 关联、由操作通过 foldAcceptedReason 关联的全部理由资源。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/acceptanceReason|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "At least one accepted reason is required per annotation. Graph exactness is relative to declared complete collections; authentic source completeness and unchanged payload remain importer requirements."
msgstr "每个注释至少要求一个已接受理由。图精确性相对于声明完整集合而言；真实来源完整性及载荷不变仍是导入器要求。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/acceptanceReason|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "One visible accepted reason: ex:annotation gmeow:acceptanceReason ex:reasonA ."
msgstr "一个可见已接受理由：ex:annotation gmeow:acceptanceReason ex:reasonA ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAcceptedFoldInputAgreementLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "accepted fold input agreement law"
msgstr "已接受折叠输入一致定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAcceptedFoldInputAgreementLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Every selected fold operation’s output retains exactly its original input answer resource through acceptedFoldOriginal."
msgstr "每个所选折叠操作的输出都通过 acceptedFoldOriginal 恰好保留其原始输入答案资源。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAcceptedFoldInputAgreementLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to reject a result context naming a different original answer."
msgstr "用于拒绝命名不同原始答案的结果上下文。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAcceptedFoldInputAgreementLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid equating originals by equal row bindings or introducing a unique inverse operation owner on an output."
msgstr "避免因行绑定相等而将原始答案视为相同，或为输出引入逆向唯一所属操作。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAcceptedFoldInputAgreementLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Bind the operation input and output and require the output’s acceptedFoldOriginal edge to that same input resource."
msgstr "绑定操作输入及输出，并要求输出的 acceptedFoldOriginal 边关联至同一输入资源。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAcceptedFoldInputAgreementLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The required single original coordinate handles conflicting originals. Other laws require a typed operation context for every folded answer."
msgstr "必需单个原始坐标处理相冲突原始答案。其他定律为每个折叠答案要求类型化操作上下文。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAcceptedFoldInputAgreementLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Matching original context: ex:fold gmeow:acceptedFoldInput ex:original ; gmeow:acceptedFoldOutput ex:folded . ex:folded gmeow:acceptedFoldOriginal ex:original ."
msgstr "一致原始上下文：ex:fold gmeow:acceptedFoldInput ex:original ; gmeow:acceptedFoldOutput ex:folded . ex:folded gmeow:acceptedFoldOriginal ex:original ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAcceptedFoldPartitionLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "accepted fold partition law"
msgstr "已接受折叠分区定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAcceptedFoldPartitionLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The original answer’s declared solution rows are exactly the disjoint established and undecided partitions of a selected fold, and every original member has the ordered-evidence row type."
msgstr "原始答案声明的解行恰好是所选折叠的互不相交已确立及未决分区，每个原始成员都具有有序证据行类型。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAcceptedFoldPartitionLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to reject missing, extra or doubly partitioned original row occurrences."
msgstr "用于拒绝缺失、额外或同时属于两个分区的原始行出现项。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAcceptedFoldPartitionLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid deriving source partitions from absent statuses, dropping an original occurrence or identifying equal-binding rows."
msgstr "避免从缺失状态推导来源分区、丢弃原始出现项或将绑定相等的行视为相同。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAcceptedFoldPartitionLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Require input membership to imply ordered-row type and one partition, each partition to imply input membership, and forbid membership in both partitions."
msgstr "要求输入成员关系蕴含有序行类型及一个分区，各分区蕴含输入成员关系，并禁止同时属于两分区。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAcceptedFoldPartitionLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Complete collections may be explicitly empty. The graph checks declared partition membership rather than authentic source availability or payload contents."
msgstr "完整集合可以显式为空。图检查声明分区成员关系，而非真实来源可用性或载荷内容。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAcceptedFoldPartitionLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Distinct source partitions: ex:fold gmeow:foldEstablishedRow ex:established ; gmeow:foldUndecidedRow ex:undecided ."
msgstr "不同来源分区：ex:fold gmeow:foldEstablishedRow ex:established ; gmeow:foldUndecidedRow ex:undecided ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAcceptedFoldPositionLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "accepted fold original position law"
msgstr "已接受折叠原始位置定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAcceptedFoldPositionLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Every ordered evidence row position lies in the unsigned 64-bit value domain. Within a selected original answer, equal original sequence positions require the same row occurrence resource."
msgstr "每个有序证据行位置都处于无符号 64 位值域内。在所选原始答案内，相等原始序列位置要求同一行出现项资源。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAcceptedFoldPositionLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to reject an out-of-range original position or distinct selected original rows competing for one source position."
msgstr "用于拒绝超出范围的原始位置，或不同所选原始行竞争同一来源位置。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAcceptedFoldPositionLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid changing the canonical entryOrdinal datatype, renumbering filtered output, requiring contiguous positions or claiming RDF membership certifies native iterator emission order."
msgstr "避免改变规范 entryOrdinal 数据类型、为过滤输出重新编号、要求连续位置，或声称 RDF 成员关系认证了原生迭代器发出顺序。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAcceptedFoldPositionLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "On every typed ordered row, compare a bound xsd:nonNegativeInteger position with the exact maximum 18446744073709551615 through logic:termLessEqual; within a selected input use logic:termEqual on bound positions and require equal row resources."
msgstr "在每个类型化有序行上，通过 logic:termLessEqual 将绑定的 xsd:nonNegativeInteger 位置与精确最大值 18446744073709551615 比较；在所选输入内，对绑定位置使用 logic:termEqual 并要求行资源相等。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAcceptedFoldPositionLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The existing nonnegative integer carrier and explicit upper bound retain the original u64 numeric value domain, without a source literal or byte-encoding identity claim. Output order uses retained original positions, possibly with gaps; native ordering and successful completion remain importer requirements."
msgstr "现有非负整数载体及显式上界保留原始 u64 数值域，不声称来源字面量或字节编码身份相同。输出顺序使用保留的原始位置，可有空隙；原生顺序及成功完成仍是导入器要求。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAcceptedFoldPositionLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retained source positions: ex:first gmeow:entryOrdinal \"0\"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger . ex:later gmeow:entryOrdinal \"4\"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ."
msgstr "保留的来源位置：ex:first gmeow:entryOrdinal \"0\"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger . ex:later gmeow:entryOrdinal \"4\"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAcceptedFoldKnownReasonLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "accepted fold known reason law"
msgstr "已接受折叠已知理由定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAcceptedFoldKnownReasonLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Every selected accepted reason belongs to the same operation’s declared complete known-reason inventory for its named original workspace."
msgstr "每个所选已接受理由都属于同一操作为其具名原始工作区声明的完整已知理由清单。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAcceptedFoldKnownReasonLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to reject accepted identities absent from the declared original evidence scope."
msgstr "用于拒绝声明原始证据作用域中缺失的已接受身份。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAcceptedFoldKnownReasonLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid replacing workspace-wide knownness with a requirement that an emitted row use every accepted reason."
msgstr "避免用发出行必须使用每个已接受理由的要求替代工作区范围的已知性。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAcceptedFoldKnownReasonLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Bind a foldAcceptedReason member and require foldKnownReason for that same reason on that operation."
msgstr "绑定一个 foldAcceptedReason 成员，并要求同一操作为同一理由具有 foldKnownReason。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAcceptedFoldKnownReasonLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Known accepted reasons unused by selected rows remain legal. This graph implication does not authenticate a source inventory or establish native owner liveness."
msgstr "所选行未使用的已知已接受理由仍合法。此图蕴含不认证来源清单，也不确立原生所属者存活性。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAcceptedFoldKnownReasonLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A known accepted identity: ex:fold gmeow:foldKnownReason ex:unused ; gmeow:foldAcceptedReason ex:unused ."
msgstr "已知的已接受身份：ex:fold gmeow:foldKnownReason ex:unused ; gmeow:foldAcceptedReason ex:unused ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAcceptedFoldEstablishedLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "accepted fold established retention law"
msgstr "已接受折叠已确立行保留定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAcceptedFoldEstablishedLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Every original established row is retained by the selected fold output unconditionally on accepted-reason overlap."
msgstr "每个原始已确立行都由所选折叠输出保留，不以已接受理由交集为条件。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAcceptedFoldEstablishedLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain established occurrences even under an explicitly empty accepted selection."
msgstr "用于即使在显式空已接受选择下也保留已确立出现项。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAcceptedFoldEstablishedLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid filtering established rows by reasons or treating their overlap as a visible acceptance override."
msgstr "避免按理由过滤已确立行，或将其交集视为可见接受覆盖。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAcceptedFoldEstablishedLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Bind a selected operation, its output and an established partition row, then require output solutionRow membership for that exact row resource."
msgstr "绑定所选操作、其输出及已确立分区行，然后要求输出 solutionRow 包含该确切行资源。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAcceptedFoldEstablishedLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "An established row receives no acceptance annotation even when its original reasons overlap the accepted set; partition and acceptance laws enforce that distinction."
msgstr "即使已确立行的原始理由与已接受集相交，该行也不获得接受注释；分区及接受定律实施此区分。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAcceptedFoldEstablishedLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Unconditional output membership: ex:fold gmeow:foldEstablishedRow ex:row ; gmeow:acceptedFoldOutput ex:folded . ex:folded gmeow:solutionRow ex:row ."
msgstr "无条件输出成员关系：ex:fold gmeow:foldEstablishedRow ex:row ; gmeow:acceptedFoldOutput ex:folded . ex:folded gmeow:solutionRow ex:row ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAcceptedFoldUndecidedLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "accepted fold undecided admission law"
msgstr "已接受折叠未决接纳定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAcceptedFoldUndecidedLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "An original undecided row belongs to the selected output if and only if at least one of its declared original reasons belongs to the accepted selection."
msgstr "当且仅当原始未决行的至少一个声明原始理由属于已接受选择时，该行属于所选输出。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAcceptedFoldUndecidedLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to preserve ANY-overlap admission rather than an all-reasons test."
msgstr "用于保留 ANY 交集接纳，而非全部理由检查。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAcceptedFoldUndecidedLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid accepting a no-overlap row, requiring every reason to be accepted or deleting original reasons after admission."
msgstr "避免接受无交集行、要求每个理由均被接受，或在接纳后删除原始理由。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAcceptedFoldUndecidedLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Require a joined original-reason and accepted-set witness for every emitted undecided row, and require emission for every undecided row with such a witness."
msgstr "为每个发出的未决行要求连接原始理由与已接受集的见证，并为每个具有此类见证的未决行要求发出。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAcceptedFoldUndecidedLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "A fresh existential witness realizes the reverse direction without a positive nested universal. Exactness is relative to the complete declared original reason collection."
msgstr "新绑定存在见证实现反向要求，不使用正极性的嵌套全称量化。精确性相对于完整声明原始理由集合而言。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAcceptedFoldUndecidedLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "One accepted reason suffices: ex:row gmeow:solutionReason ex:a, ex:b . ex:fold gmeow:foldUndecidedRow ex:row ; gmeow:foldAcceptedReason ex:a ."
msgstr "一个已接受理由即足够：ex:row gmeow:solutionReason ex:a, ex:b . ex:fold gmeow:foldUndecidedRow ex:row ; gmeow:foldAcceptedReason ex:a ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAcceptedFoldOutputLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "accepted fold exact output law"
msgstr "已接受折叠精确输出定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAcceptedFoldOutputLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Every declared output solution row is an original established row or an original undecided row with an accepted original-reason overlap."
msgstr "每个声明输出解行都是原始已确立行，或具有已接受原始理由交集的原始未决行。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAcceptedFoldOutputLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to reject fabricated or replacement output row identities."
msgstr "用于拒绝虚构或替代的输出行身份。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAcceptedFoldOutputLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid claiming this membership law validates arbitrary candidate edges, binding schemas, numeric scores or authenticated payload contents."
msgstr "避免声称此成员关系定律验证任意候选边、绑定模式、数值分数或经过认证的载荷内容。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAcceptedFoldOutputLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Bind each output row and require established membership or undecided membership with a fresh reason witness joined through original and accepted reason edges."
msgstr "绑定每个输出行，并要求已确立成员关系，或具有新绑定理由见证的未决成员关系；该见证通过原始理由边及已接受理由边连接。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAcceptedFoldOutputLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The law constrains solutionRow identities. Reusing an identity retains access to declared graph content but does not prove that its authentic original content was unchanged."
msgstr "此定律约束 solutionRow 身份。复用身份保留对声明图内容的访问，但不证明其真实原始内容未改变。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAcceptedFoldOutputLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "An original row retained: ex:original gmeow:solutionRow ex:row . ex:folded gmeow:solutionRow ex:row ."
msgstr "保留的原始行：ex:original gmeow:solutionRow ex:row . ex:folded gmeow:solutionRow ex:row ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAcceptedFoldAcceptanceLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "accepted fold acceptance accounting law"
msgstr "已接受折叠接受核算定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAcceptedFoldAcceptanceLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Every emitted original undecided row has an answer-local typed acceptance annotation, and every annotation linked from the output names an emitted original undecided row."
msgstr "每个发出的原始未决行都有答案内类型化接受注释，从输出关联的每个注释都命名一个发出的原始未决行。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAcceptedFoldAcceptanceLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to make every visible undecided admission explicit without annotating established rows."
msgstr "用于使每个可见未决接纳显式化，不注释已确立行。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAcceptedFoldAcceptanceLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid missing annotations, extra annotations on excluded rows or an override annotation on an established row."
msgstr "避免注释缺失、在被排除行上添加额外注释，或在已确立行上添加覆盖注释。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAcceptedFoldAcceptanceLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Require a fresh typed-and-linked annotation witness for each retained undecided row and require each linked annotation’s original row to be retained and undecided."
msgstr "为每个保留未决行要求新绑定、类型化且已关联的注释见证，并要求每个关联注释的原始行被保留且为未决。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAcceptedFoldAcceptanceLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Required annotation coordinates and typed collection ranges prevent missing-row escape. Annotation uniqueness and exact accepted reasons are enforced separately."
msgstr "必需注释坐标及类型化集合值域防止利用缺失行逃避约束。注释唯一性及精确已接受理由由独立要求实施。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAcceptedFoldAcceptanceLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Visible admitted occurrence: ex:folded gmeow:solutionRow ex:row ; gmeow:rowAcceptance ex:annotation . ex:annotation gmeow:acceptanceOriginalRow ex:row ."
msgstr "可见已接纳出现项：ex:folded gmeow:solutionRow ex:row ; gmeow:rowAcceptance ex:annotation . ex:annotation gmeow:acceptanceOriginalRow ex:row ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRowAcceptanceOwnerLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "row acceptance answer owner law"
msgstr "行接受答案归属定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRowAcceptanceOwnerLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Every acceptance annotation belongs to exactly one typed folded answer. Separate answers use separate annotations even when they retain the same original row."
msgstr "每个接受注释恰好属于一个类型化折叠答案。不同答案使用不同注释，即使保留同一原始行。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRowAcceptanceOwnerLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to keep selection-dependent acceptance context local to its answer."
msgstr "用于使依赖选择的接受上下文局限于其答案。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRowAcceptanceOwnerLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid imposing inverse ownership on original rows or a unique inverse operation owner on folded answers."
msgstr "避免对原始行施加逆向归属，或对折叠答案施加逆向唯一所属操作。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRowAcceptanceOwnerLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Require a fresh existing typed answer owner, then compare any two rowAcceptance links to the annotation through logic:termEqual."
msgstr "要求以新绑定见证一个已有且已类型化的所属答案，然后通过 logic:termEqual 比较任意两个关联至该注释的 rowAcceptance 链接。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRowAcceptanceOwnerLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The Formula uses one outer universal, a fresh joined owner existential and a guarded owner-pair implication, without a positive nested universal."
msgstr "此 Formula 使用一个外层全称量化、新绑定的连接所属者存在量化及带守卫的所属者对蕴含，不包含正极性的嵌套全称量化。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRowAcceptanceOwnerLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "One annotation owner: ex:folded gmeow:rowAcceptance ex:annotation . ex:annotation a gmeow:QueryRowAcceptance ."
msgstr "一个注释所属者：ex:folded gmeow:rowAcceptance ex:annotation . ex:annotation a gmeow:QueryRowAcceptance ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRowAcceptanceUniquenessLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "row acceptance original row uniqueness law"
msgstr "行接受原始行唯一性定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRowAcceptanceUniquenessLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Within one folded answer, two acceptance annotations naming the same original row must be the same annotation resource."
msgstr "在同一折叠答案内，命名同一原始行的两个接受注释必须是同一注释资源。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRowAcceptanceUniquenessLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to reject duplicate visible acceptance occurrences for one row in one answer."
msgstr "用于拒绝同一答案内一个行具有重复可见接受出现项。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRowAcceptanceUniquenessLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid merging annotations across answers or identifying original rows solely by equal bindings."
msgstr "避免跨答案合并注释，或仅按相等绑定将原始行视为相同。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRowAcceptanceUniquenessLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Bind two annotations linked from one answer and to the same acceptanceOriginalRow, then require logic:termEqual on annotation identities."
msgstr "绑定从同一答案关联且指向同一 acceptanceOriginalRow 的两个注释，然后要求注释身份满足 logic:termEqual。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRowAcceptanceUniquenessLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Other answers may reuse the original row with distinct annotations and different compatible accepted selections."
msgstr "其他答案可用独立注释及不同但相容的已接受选择复用原始行。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRowAcceptanceUniquenessLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "One annotation per original row: ex:folded gmeow:rowAcceptance ex:annotation . ex:annotation gmeow:acceptanceOriginalRow ex:row ."
msgstr "每个原始行一个注释：ex:folded gmeow:rowAcceptance ex:annotation . ex:annotation gmeow:acceptanceOriginalRow ex:row ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRowAcceptanceReasonsLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "row acceptance exact reasons law"
msgstr "行接受精确理由定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRowAcceptanceReasonsLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "An answer-local annotation’s accepted reasons are exactly the intersection of its original row’s declared full reasons and each incoming selected operation’s accepted set."
msgstr "答案内注释的已接受理由，恰好是其原始行声明完整理由与每个入向所选操作已接受集的交集。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRowAcceptanceReasonsLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain all and only visibly accepted original reason identities."
msgstr "用于恰好保留全部可见已接受原始理由身份。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRowAcceptanceReasonsLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid dropping an intersecting reason, adding a reason absent from either collection or rewriting the row’s original reasons as only the accepted subset."
msgstr "避免遗漏交集中理由、添加任一集合中不存在的理由，或将行原始理由改写为仅含已接受子集。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRowAcceptanceReasonsLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Require every acceptanceReason in both original and selected collections, and every reason in both collections in acceptanceReason on that same annotation."
msgstr "要求每个 acceptanceReason 同时位于原始集合及所选集合，并要求同时位于两集合的每个理由出现在同一注释的 acceptanceReason 中。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRowAcceptanceReasonsLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The two guarded directions compare complete declared sets. They do not authenticate source completeness or detect source deletions followed by consistent graph edits."
msgstr "两个带守卫方向比较声明完整集合。它们不认证来源完整性，也不检测来源删除后进行的一致图编辑。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryRowAcceptanceReasonsLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Separate complete and accepted reasons: ex:row gmeow:solutionReason ex:a, ex:b . ex:annotation gmeow:acceptanceOriginalRow ex:row ; gmeow:acceptanceReason ex:a ."
msgstr "独立完整理由及已接受理由：ex:row gmeow:solutionReason ex:a, ex:b . ex:annotation gmeow:acceptanceOriginalRow ex:row ; gmeow:acceptanceReason ex:a ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAcceptedFoldContextLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "accepted fold exact original context law"
msgstr "已接受折叠精确原始上下文定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAcceptedFoldContextLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The selected output retains exactly the original answer’s queryAnswerFor targets and queryLossLedger resources in both collection directions."
msgstr "所选输出在集合的两个方向上，恰好保留原始答案的 queryAnswerFor 目标及 queryLossLedger 资源。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAcceptedFoldContextLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to preserve declared query and original loss-ledger identities even when some original rows are not emitted."
msgstr "用于即使部分原始行未发出，也保留声明查询及原始损失账本身份。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAcceptedFoldContextLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid selecting one context witness, imposing a single-query or single-ledger maximum, inferring aggregate status or claiming ledger-content immutability is validated."
msgstr "避免只选择一个上下文见证、施加单查询或单账本最大值、推断聚合状态，或声称账本内容不可变性已被验证。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAcceptedFoldContextLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Require original-to-output and output-to-original membership for queryAnswerFor, and both directions independently for queryLossLedger."
msgstr "为 queryAnswerFor 要求原始到输出及输出到原始成员关系，并为 queryLossLedger 独立要求两个方向。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAcceptedFoldContextLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "These four implications preserve declared resource collections. Authentic original ledger contents and any additional host-supplied aggregate statuses retain their separate source requirements."
msgstr "这四个蕴含保留声明资源集合。真实原始账本内容及任何额外宿主提供聚合状态仍有独立来源要求。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAcceptedFoldContextLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Multiple contexts retained: ex:original gmeow:queryAnswerFor ex:q1, ex:q2 ; gmeow:queryLossLedger ex:l1, ex:l2 . ex:folded gmeow:queryAnswerFor ex:q1, ex:q2 ; gmeow:queryLossLedger ex:l1, ex:l2 ."
msgstr "保留多个上下文：ex:original gmeow:queryAnswerFor ex:q1, ex:q2 ; gmeow:queryLossLedger ex:l1, ex:l2 . ex:folded gmeow:queryAnswerFor ex:q1, ex:q2 ; gmeow:queryLossLedger ex:l1, ex:l2 ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAcceptedFoldAnswerContextLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "accepted fold answer operation context law"
msgstr "已接受折叠答案操作上下文定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAcceptedFoldAnswerContextLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Every typed folded answer has an existing typed selected fold operation linked to it through acceptedFoldOutput, so its declared rows and annotations are subject to operation-relative laws."
msgstr "每个类型化折叠答案都有已有类型化所选折叠操作通过 acceptedFoldOutput 与其关联，因此其声明行及注释受操作相对定律约束。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAcceptedFoldAnswerContextLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to reject a standalone folded answer that evades accepted-set and partition obligations by lacking an operation context."
msgstr "用于拒绝因缺少操作上下文而逃避已接受集及分区义务的独立折叠答案。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAcceptedFoldAnswerContextLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid requiring a unique inverse operation owner or fabricating an executed occurrence from an operation description."
msgstr "避免要求逆向唯一所属操作，或从操作描述虚构已执行出现项。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAcceptedFoldAnswerContextLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Require a fresh joined existential QueryAcceptedReasonFold witness whose acceptedFoldOutput is this answer."
msgstr "要求新绑定的连接存在见证 QueryAcceptedReasonFold，其 acceptedFoldOutput 为此答案。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAcceptedFoldAnswerContextLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Several descriptions may share the answer only when all their membership and exact accepted-intersection obligations agree. Accepted sets differing only in unused known reasons can remain consistent."
msgstr "仅当全部成员关系及精确已接受交集义务一致时，多个描述才能共享答案。仅在未使用已知理由上不同的已接受集可以保持一致。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAcceptedFoldAnswerContextLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "An explicit operation witness: ex:fold a gmeow:QueryAcceptedReasonFold ; gmeow:acceptedFoldOutput ex:folded . ex:folded a gmeow:QueryAcceptedReasonAnswer ."
msgstr "显式操作见证：ex:fold a gmeow:QueryAcceptedReasonFold ; gmeow:acceptedFoldOutput ex:folded . ex:folded a gmeow:QueryAcceptedReasonAnswer ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryVerdictComparison|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Query Verdict Comparison"
msgstr "查询判定比较"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryVerdictComparison|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "An outer-owned internal binary query-choice occurrence comparing a known selected answer-axis value with its outer choice’s expected value. Its matching guard selects the left target when supported and the known-nonmatching right target otherwise."
msgstr "属于外层选择的内部二元查询选择出现项，将选定答案轴的已知值与外层选择的预期值比较。匹配守卫有支持时选择左目标，否则选择已知不匹配的右目标。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryVerdictComparison|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use as the internal comparison reached through a QueryVerdictChoice’s left operand after knownness is established."
msgstr "用于确立已知性后，通过 QueryVerdictChoice 左操作数到达的内部比较。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryVerdictComparison|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid copying answer, axis or expected-value roles onto the comparison, sharing it between distinct outer choices or treating unknown context as known inequality."
msgstr "避免将答案、轴或预期值角色复制到比较上、跨不同外层选择共享比较，或将未知上下文视为已知不相等。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryVerdictComparison|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Supply one guardSituation, one matching leftOperand and one known-nonmatching rightOperand, inherited node effect and stratum, and one distinct typed structural outer owner through that outer’s leftOperand."
msgstr "提供一个 guardSituation、一个匹配 leftOperand 及一个已知不匹配 rightOperand，继承的节点效应与层级，并通过外层的 leftOperand 提供一个不同的类型化结构性外层所属者。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryVerdictComparison|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "An inner-only execution uses its own choiceEvaluationState and its unique structural outer context, with knownness supported there. It needs no fabricated outer execution, native start instruction or distinct downstream branch targets."
msgstr "仅内部执行使用自身 choiceEvaluationState 及唯一结构性外层上下文，在该 State 上有已知性支持。它不需要虚构外层执行、原生启动指令或不同的下游分支目标。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryVerdictComparison|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "An owned binary comparison: ex:outer logic:leftOperand ex:comparison . ex:comparison a gmeow:QueryVerdictComparison ; logic:guardSituation ex:matchingSituation ; logic:leftOperand ex:match ; logic:rightOperand ex:nonmatch ."
msgstr "具有所属者的二元比较：ex:outer logic:leftOperand ex:comparison . ex:comparison a gmeow:QueryVerdictComparison ; logic:guardSituation ex:matchingSituation ; logic:leftOperand ex:match ; logic:rightOperand ex:nonmatch ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/choiceEvaluationState|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "query choice evaluation state"
msgstr "查询选择求值状态"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/choiceEvaluationState|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The supplied State of a reported outer verdict-choice or internal comparison evaluation. Its situationObtains support is checked against that node’s bound answer context, without making the reusable node a native transaction root."
msgstr "报告的外层判定选择或内部比较求值所提供的 State。其 situationObtains 支持依据该节点已绑定答案上下文检查，不使可复用节点成为原生事务根。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/choiceEvaluationState|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain the actual declared evaluation State on a reported outer or inner choice execution."
msgstr "用于在报告的外层或内部选择执行上保留实际声明的求值 State。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/choiceEvaluationState|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid using a node-global flag, substituting an answer resource for State, adding a native start instruction or attaching this selected role to a nonchoice execution."
msgstr "避免使用节点全局标志、以答案资源替代 State、添加原生启动指令，或将此所选角色附加到非选择执行上。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/choiceEvaluationState|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Link at most one typed State from the QueryNodeExecution; outer and inner choice executions require this coordinate and retain their resolved querySelectedBranch separately."
msgstr "从 QueryNodeExecution 至多关联一个类型化 State；外层及内部选择执行要求此坐标，并单独保留解析后的 querySelectedBranch。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/choiceEvaluationState|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Generic nonchoice executions without this role require no State. A graph link grades declared support rather than authenticating execution history or invoking a query adapter."
msgstr "没有此角色的通用非选择执行不要求 State。图链接评定声明支持，不认证执行历史，也不调用查询适配器。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/choiceEvaluationState|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A reported evaluation context: ex:execution gmeow:choiceEvaluationState ex:state . ex:state a gmeow:State ."
msgstr "报告的求值上下文：ex:execution gmeow:choiceEvaluationState ex:state . ex:state a gmeow:State ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryVerdictComparisonOwnerLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "query verdict comparison owner law"
msgstr "查询判定比较归属定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryVerdictComparisonOwnerLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Every internal verdict comparison has an existing typed structural outer choice owner distinct from itself. Any two typed outer choices naming that comparison as left operand must be the same owner resource."
msgstr "每个内部判定比较都有已存在、已类型化且不同于自身的结构性外层选择所属者。任意两个将该比较命名为左操作数的类型化外层选择必须是同一所属资源。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryVerdictComparisonOwnerLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to keep the comparison’s borrowed answer, axis and expected context unique and non-self-referential."
msgstr "用于使比较借用的答案、轴及预期上下文唯一且非自引用。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryVerdictComparisonOwnerLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid selecting an arbitrary outer context, copying its bound fields onto the comparison or imposing inverse ownership on downstream targets, States or Situations."
msgstr "避免选择任意外层上下文、将其绑定字段复制到比较上，或对下游目标、State 或 Situation 资源施加逆向归属。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryVerdictComparisonOwnerLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Require a fresh typed-and-linked outer owner witness, compare typed owner pairs through termEqual, and separately forbid a typed owner link from the comparison to itself."
msgstr "要求新绑定的类型化且已关联外层所属者见证，通过 termEqual 比较类型化所属者对，并单独禁止从比较指向自身的类型化所属者链接。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryVerdictComparisonOwnerLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The owner existential contains only positive stored joins. Owner-pair equality and non-self comparison use separate guarded universal branches; no positive nested universal or blanket class disjointness is introduced."
msgstr "所属者存在量化仅包含正向存储连接。所属者对相等及非自身比较使用独立带守卫全称分支；不引入正极性的嵌套全称量化或全面类不相交约束。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryVerdictComparisonOwnerLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A structural owner: ex:outer a gmeow:QueryVerdictChoice ; logic:leftOperand ex:comparison . ex:comparison a gmeow:QueryVerdictComparison ."
msgstr "结构性所属者：ex:outer a gmeow:QueryVerdictChoice ; logic:leftOperand ex:comparison . ex:comparison a gmeow:QueryVerdictComparison ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryChoiceEvaluationStateLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "query choice evaluation state law"
msgstr "查询选择求值状态定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryChoiceEvaluationStateLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Every reported outer verdict-choice or internal comparison execution has a supplied typed evaluation State. The selected choiceEvaluationState role is restricted to those executed node kinds."
msgstr "每个报告的外层判定选择或内部比较执行都有所提供的类型化求值 State。所选 choiceEvaluationState 角色仅限这些已执行节点种类。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryChoiceEvaluationStateLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to reject missing selected evaluation States and choice-state roles on unrelated query executions."
msgstr "用于拒绝缺失的所选求值 State，以及无关查询执行上的选择状态角色。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryChoiceEvaluationStateLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid requiring State on every generic QueryNodeExecution or treating missing required choice context as an unknown answer value."
msgstr "避免要求每个通用 QueryNodeExecution 都有 State，或将缺失必需选择上下文视为未知答案值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryChoiceEvaluationStateLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "For an executed outer or inner node require a fresh State witness joined by choiceEvaluationState; for a supplied choice-state edge require a separate fresh executed-node witness typed as outer or inner."
msgstr "对已执行外层或内部节点，要求通过 choiceEvaluationState 连接的新绑定 State 见证；对所提供选择状态边，要求独立新绑定、类型为外层或内部的已执行节点见证。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryChoiceEvaluationStateLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The optional generic range and qualified maximum enforce State type and at most one coordinate without a global required path. Both existence witnesses have distinct names and neither creates an authentic execution."
msgstr "可选通用值域及限定最大值约束 State 类型及至多一个坐标，不施加全局必需路径。两个存在见证使用不同名称，均不创建真实执行。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryChoiceEvaluationStateLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A selected evaluation: ex:execution gmeow:executesQueryNode ex:outer ; gmeow:choiceEvaluationState ex:state . ex:outer a gmeow:QueryVerdictChoice . ex:state a gmeow:State ."
msgstr "所选求值：ex:execution gmeow:executesQueryNode ex:outer ; gmeow:choiceEvaluationState ex:state . ex:outer a gmeow:QueryVerdictChoice . ex:state a gmeow:State ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryChoiceKnownnessLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "query choice knownness law"
msgstr "查询选择已知性定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryChoiceKnownnessLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "At a reported choice evaluation State, the outer knownness Situation is supported exactly when its selected answer axis has a known value. A reported internal comparison additionally requires that knownness support at its own State."
msgstr "在报告的选择求值 State 上，当且仅当所选答案轴具有已知值时，外层已知性 Situation 有支持。报告的内部比较还要求在自身 State 上具有该已知性支持。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryChoiceKnownnessLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to align generic binary guard support with the same attributed answer context and prevent inner evaluation under unknown evidence."
msgstr "用于使通用二元守卫支持与同一带有归属的答案上下文一致，并防止在未知证据下进行内部求值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryChoiceKnownnessLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid treating InfoBoth or InfoNotEvaluated as unknown, selecting a different outer owner or fabricating an outer execution for an inner-only report."
msgstr "避免将 InfoBoth 或 InfoNotEvaluated 视为未知、选择不同外层所属者，或为仅内部报告虚构外层执行。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryChoiceKnownnessLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Join execution, State, node, unique structural outer context and guard; expand the information and completeness known-value alternatives in both guarded support directions, with distinct fresh actual-value witnesses."
msgstr "连接执行、State、节点、唯一结构性外层上下文及守卫；在两个带守卫支持方向上展开信息及完整性已知值备选，使用不同的新绑定实际值见证。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryChoiceKnownnessLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Absent axis values and their explicit unknown sentinels make knownness false within this selected contract. Missing structural fields or evaluation State is invalid, and Situation support is not authenticated history."
msgstr "在此所选契约内，缺失轴值及其显式未知哨兵使已知性为假。结构字段或求值 State 缺失为无效，Situation 支持并非认证历史。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryChoiceKnownnessLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Known context support: ex:answer gmeow:queryInformationState logic:InfoNotEvaluated . ex:state logic:situationObtains ex:knownSituation ."
msgstr "已知上下文支持：ex:answer gmeow:queryInformationState logic:InfoNotEvaluated . ex:state logic:situationObtains ex:knownSituation ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryChoiceMatchLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "query choice matching guard law"
msgstr "查询选择匹配守卫定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryChoiceMatchLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "At the same reported State and bound answer context, the internal matching Situation is supported exactly when the selected actual value is known and equals the expected value."
msgstr "在同一报告 State 及已绑定答案上下文中，当且仅当所选实际值已知且等于预期值时，内部匹配 Situation 有支持。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryChoiceMatchLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to reject contradictory generic matching support even when matching, nonmatching or unknown targets happen to coincide."
msgstr "用于拒绝矛盾的通用匹配支持，即使匹配、不匹配或未知目标恰好相同。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryChoiceMatchLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid admitting unknown expected sentinels, coercing information into completeness values or relying on the reported target alone to validate binary guard truth."
msgstr "避免接纳未知预期哨兵、将信息强制转换为完整性值，或仅依靠报告目标验证二元守卫真值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryChoiceMatchLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Join the execution context, expected value and comparison guard; expand known equality for both axes into two guarded support directions using separate fresh actual-value witnesses."
msgstr "连接执行上下文、预期值及比较守卫；使用独立新绑定实际值见证，将两个轴的已知相等展开为两个带守卫支持方向。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryChoiceMatchLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Missing or explicit unknown actual values and known inequality forbid matching support. This check applies during outer unknown evaluations as well as known outer or inner evaluations, without requiring distinct target resources."
msgstr "缺失或显式未知实际值及已知不相等禁止匹配支持。此检查既适用于外层未知求值，也适用于已知外层或内部求值，不要求目标资源不同。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryChoiceMatchLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A known matching value: ex:answer gmeow:queryInformationState logic:InfoBoth . ex:outer gmeow:choiceExpectedValue logic:InfoBoth . ex:state logic:situationObtains ex:matchSituation ."
msgstr "已知匹配值：ex:answer gmeow:queryInformationState logic:InfoBoth . ex:outer gmeow:choiceExpectedValue logic:InfoBoth . ex:state logic:situationObtains ex:matchSituation ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryReportedFusionScore|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Query Reported Fusion Score"
msgstr "查询已报告融合分数"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryReportedFusionScore|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A reported exact-decimal fused-score Quantity with one declared dimension, one applicable reference frame and one selected source-profile interpretation record. It is not a fixed-point datatype or an arithmetic-conformant result class."
msgstr "已报告的精确十进制融合分数 Quantity，具有一个声明量纲、一个适用参照系及一个所选来源配置解释记录。它不是定点数据类型或算术符合性结果类。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryReportedFusionScore|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain an exact supplied fused magnitude with its explicit quantitative interpretation and source convention."
msgstr "用于保留所提供的精确融合量值及其显式定量解释和来源约定。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryReportedFusionScore|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid using the old unweighted integer QueryFusionScore, a rerank float, Probability, Confidence or an arithmetic certificate as a substitute."
msgstr "避免用旧的非加权整数 QueryFusionScore、重排浮点数、Probability、Confidence 或算术证书替代。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryReportedFusionScore|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Supply one xsd:decimal math:quantityValue, math:hasDimension, hasReferenceFrame and reportedFusionScoreProfile, preserving the same dimension and frame resources on the selected profile record."
msgstr "提供一个 xsd:decimal 类型的 math:quantityValue、math:hasDimension、hasReferenceFrame 及 reportedFusionScoreProfile，并在所选配置记录上保留相同量纲及参照系资源。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryReportedFusionScore|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The carrier-range law checks nonnegative magnitude and the selected source carrier capacity only. Fixed-point quantum membership, truncation, complete summation, native admission and authentic call/result association remain outside this foundation."
msgstr "载体范围定律仅检查量值非负及所选来源载体容量。定点量化步长符合性、截断、完整求和、原生接纳及真实调用/结果关联不属于此基础。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryReportedFusionScore|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A reported magnitude: ex:score a gmeow:QueryReportedFusionScore ; math:quantityValue \"0.016393442622950819\"^^xsd:decimal ; math:hasDimension math:dimensionless ; gmeow:hasReferenceFrame ex:frame ; gmeow:reportedFusionScoreProfile ex:profile ."
msgstr "报告的量值：ex:score a gmeow:QueryReportedFusionScore ; math:quantityValue \"0.016393442622950819\"^^xsd:decimal ; math:hasDimension math:dimensionless ; gmeow:hasReferenceFrame ex:frame ; gmeow:reportedFusionScoreProfile ex:profile ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryFusionScoreProfile|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Query Fusion Score Profile"
msgstr "查询融合分数配置"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryFusionScoreProfile|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The declared interpretation and source-profile context selected by a reported fusion score, retaining one source convention, one declared dimension, one applicable reference frame and the convention’s supplied native identity form."
msgstr "已报告融合分数选择的声明解释及来源配置上下文，保留一个来源约定、一个声明量纲、一个适用参照系及该约定所提供的原生身份形式。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryFusionScoreProfile|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to keep the declared source arithmetic claim and quantitative context distinct from a reported magnitude and its actual application."
msgstr "用于将声明的来源算术主张及定量上下文，与报告量值及其实际应用分开。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryFusionScoreProfile|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid treating the record as a complete source profile, a retained source-call resource, a call/result association or a content-unique identity derived from name, version or native bytes."
msgstr "避免将此记录视为完整来源配置、保留的来源调用资源、调用/结果关联，或从名称、版本或原生字节推导的内容唯一身份。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryFusionScoreProfile|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Supply fusionScoreConvention, fusionScoreDimension and hasReferenceFrame; retain actual digest bytes for the weighted scale-18 convention or actual selected profile name and version for the unit scale-12 convention."
msgstr "提供 fusionScoreConvention、fusionScoreDimension 及 hasReferenceFrame；对 18 位小数加权约定保留实际摘要字节，或对 12 位小数单位权重约定保留实际所选配置名称及版本。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryFusionScoreProfile|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The record itself is the selected declared context. The actual full source profile supplies its components; recorded name/version neither determines nor validates them. Authentic source-call, full-profile and result association remains application-owned."
msgstr "记录本身就是所选声明上下文。实际完整来源配置提供其组件；记录的名称/版本既不确定也不验证组件。真实来源调用、完整配置及结果关联仍由应用负责。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryFusionScoreProfile|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A declared context: ex:profile a gmeow:QueryFusionScoreProfile ; gmeow:fusionScoreDimension math:dimensionless ; gmeow:hasReferenceFrame ex:frame ."
msgstr "声明的上下文：ex:profile a gmeow:QueryFusionScoreProfile ; gmeow:fusionScoreDimension math:dimensionless ; gmeow:hasReferenceFrame ex:frame ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/reportedFusionScoreProfile|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "reported fusion score profile"
msgstr "已报告融合分数配置"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/reportedFusionScoreProfile|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The one declared interpretation and source-profile context selected by a reported exact-decimal fusion-score carrier."
msgstr "已报告精确十进制融合分数载体所选择的单个声明解释及来源配置上下文。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/reportedFusionScoreProfile|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to share an explicit profile record across supplied score quantities without adding another scalar-value property."
msgstr "用于使所提供分数的量载体共享显式配置记录，不添加另一标量值属性。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/reportedFusionScoreProfile|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid interpreting this link as an association to an authenticated source call or as proof that the selected arithmetic produced the reported value."
msgstr "避免将此链接理解为与经过认证的来源调用关联，或理解为所选算术产生报告值的证明。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/reportedFusionScoreProfile|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Reference one QueryFusionScoreProfile and retain its exact dimension and reference-frame resources on the score quantity."
msgstr "引用一个 QueryFusionScoreProfile，并在该分数的量载体上保留其确切量纲及参照系资源。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/reportedFusionScoreProfile|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Several score carriers may select the same declared context. Equal magnitudes, native bytes or name/version labels do not merge profile records or establish an application."
msgstr "多个分数载体可以选择同一声明上下文。相等量值、原生字节或名称/版本标签不合并配置记录，也不确立应用。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/reportedFusionScoreProfile|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "An explicit profile selection: ex:score gmeow:reportedFusionScoreProfile ex:profile ."
msgstr "显式配置选择：ex:score gmeow:reportedFusionScoreProfile ex:profile ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fusionScoreConvention|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "fusion score source convention"
msgstr "融合分数来源约定"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fusionScoreConvention|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The explicitly selected source arithmetic convention described by a fusion-score profile record: weighted scale-18 numerator division or pinned unit scale-12 reciprocal-first arithmetic."
msgstr "融合分数配置记录描述的显式所选来源算术约定：18 位小数加权分子除法，或固定版本的 12 位小数单位权重倒数优先算术。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fusionScoreConvention|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to distinguish the two observed source claims without introducing independent parameter defaults or arbitrary combinations of numeric conventions."
msgstr "用于区分两种观察到的来源主张，不引入独立参数默认值或任意数值约定组合。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fusionScoreConvention|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid treating selection as arithmetic verification, substituting current upstream behavior for a pinned consumer or inferring a convention from an equal decimal value."
msgstr "避免将选择视为算术验证、用当前上游行为替代固定版本消费者，或从相等十进制值推断约定。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fusionScoreConvention|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Select one of the two declared convention resources and retain its matching native identity form, declared dimension and applicable frame."
msgstr "选择两种声明约定资源之一，并保留其相符原生身份形式、声明量纲及适用参照系。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fusionScoreConvention|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Each convention describes source precision, k, rounding placement, rank and range/overflow behavior. This foundation certifies neither quantum membership nor truncation, component sums, native admission or source authenticity."
msgstr "每种约定描述来源精度、k、舍入位置、名次及范围/溢出行为。此基础不认证量化步长符合性、截断、组件和、原生接纳或来源真实性。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fusionScoreConvention|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A weighted convention selection: ex:profile gmeow:fusionScoreConvention gmeow:fusionWeightedScale18Convention ."
msgstr "加权约定选择：ex:profile gmeow:fusionScoreConvention gmeow:fusionWeightedScale18Convention ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fusionScoreDimension|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "fusion score declared dimension"
msgstr "融合分数声明量纲"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fusionScoreDimension|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The one explicitly declared mathematical dimension of the score interpretation carried by a fusion-score profile record."
msgstr "融合分数配置记录承载的分数解释所具有的单个显式声明数学量纲。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fusionScoreDimension|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain quantitative meaning without inventing a parallel magnitude carrier or inferring dimension from the word score."
msgstr "用于保留定量含义，不虚构并行量值载体，也不从分数一词推断量纲。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fusionScoreDimension|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid treating this declaration as dimension metadata serialized by the inspected APIs or silently substituting dimensionless when required context is unavailable."
msgstr "避免将此声明视为所检查 API 序列化的量纲元数据，或在必需上下文不可用时静默替换为无量纲。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fusionScoreDimension|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Reference an actual math:Dimension and use that same resource through math:hasDimension on each score selecting this interpretation."
msgstr "引用一个实际 math:Dimension，并在选择此解释的每个分数上通过 math:hasDimension 使用同一资源。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fusionScoreDimension|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The API surfaces examined supply no mathematical dimension object. A declared interpretation needs actual source or adapter justification; equal dimensions alone do not equate arithmetic, calibration, frames or profiles."
msgstr "所检查 API 接口不提供数学量纲对象。声明解释需要实际来源或适配器依据；仅有量纲相等不使算术、校准、参照系或配置相等。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fusionScoreDimension|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "An explicitly declared interpretation: ex:profile gmeow:fusionScoreDimension math:dimensionless ."
msgstr "显式声明的解释：ex:profile gmeow:fusionScoreDimension math:dimensionless ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fusionProfileDigest|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "fusion profile supplied digest"
msgstr "融合配置所提供摘要"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fusionProfileDigest|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The actual supplied native profile byte identity retained under the weighted scale-18 convention, separately from the RDF interpretation-record identity."
msgstr "在 18 位小数加权约定下保留的实际所提供原生配置字节身份，与 RDF 解释记录身份分开。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fusionProfileDigest|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to preserve the source’s returned profile bytes without inventing a name, version, semantic IRI or replacement hash recipe."
msgstr "用于保留来源返回的配置字节，不虚构名称、版本、语义 IRI 或替代哈希方案。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fusionProfileDigest|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid requiring native bytes for a source that exposes name/version instead, recomputing a digest from incomplete graph fields or equating records because their bytes match."
msgstr "避免为提供名称/版本的来源要求原生字节、从不完整图字段重算摘要，或因字节相同而将记录视为同一。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fusionProfileDigest|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain one xsd:hexBinary literal from the actual source profile identity on the selected interpretation record."
msgstr "在所选解释记录上保留一个来自实际来源配置身份的 xsd:hexBinary 字面量。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fusionProfileDigest|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The source-form law checks the applicable identity representation. It does not authenticate a digest, grade native byte width, prove covered weights/policy content or create a source-call/result association."
msgstr "来源形式定律检查适用身份表示。它不认证摘要、不评定原生字节宽度、不证明覆盖的权重/策略内容，也不创建来源调用/结果关联。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fusionProfileDigest|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Synthetic input identity bytes: ex:profile gmeow:fusionProfileDigest \"0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef\"^^xsd:hexBinary ."
msgstr "合成输入身份字节：ex:profile gmeow:fusionProfileDigest \"0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef\"^^xsd:hexBinary ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fusionProfileName|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "fusion profile supplied name"
msgstr "融合配置所提供名称"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fusionProfileName|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The actual textual source profile identity retained under the pinned unit scale-12 convention together with its actual selected version."
msgstr "在固定版本的 12 位小数单位权重约定下，与实际所选版本一同保留的实际文本来源配置身份。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fusionProfileName|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to preserve a supplied profile name without pretending the source exposes a Katamari-style native digest."
msgstr "用于保留所提供配置名称，不假称来源暴露 Katamari 式原生摘要。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fusionProfileName|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid using the name or name/version pair as a unique key for the complete component set, source-call context or RDF interpretation record."
msgstr "避免将名称或名称/版本对用作完整组件集、来源调用上下文或 RDF 解释记录的唯一键。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fusionProfileName|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain one xsd:string literal from the source’s selected profile identity and its actual fusionProfileVersion."
msgstr "从来源所选配置身份保留一个 xsd:string 字面量，以及其实际 fusionProfileVersion。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fusionProfileName|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The actual selected full FusionProfile supplies its components. Recorded name/version alone neither determines nor validates them, and this foundation does not serialize them or authenticate their application."
msgstr "实际所选完整 FusionProfile 提供其组件。仅记录名称/版本既不确定也不验证组件，此基础不序列化组件，也不认证其应用。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fusionProfileName|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Synthetic input name: ex:profile gmeow:fusionProfileName \"example-profile\"^^xsd:string ."
msgstr "合成输入名称：ex:profile gmeow:fusionProfileName \"example-profile\"^^xsd:string ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fusionProfileVersion|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "fusion profile selected source version"
msgstr "融合配置所选来源版本"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fusionProfileVersion|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The actual u32 version of the selected source FusionProfile under the pinned unit scale-12 convention, retained as an identifier coordinate rather than a measured magnitude."
msgstr "固定版本的 12 位小数单位权重约定下，所选来源 FusionProfile 的实际 u32 版本，作为标识符坐标保留，而不是测得量值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fusionProfileVersion|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to preserve version supplied by the actual selected public profile input or source call context."
msgstr "用于保留实际所选公共配置输入或来源调用上下文提供的版本。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fusionProfileVersion|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid guessing a crate version, treating version as a returned candidate field or default, or inventing a version for the byte-identified scale-18 source."
msgstr "避免猜测 crate 版本、将版本视为返回候选字段或默认值，或为按字节标识的 18 位小数来源虚构版本。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fusionProfileVersion|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain one xsd:unsignedInt value from the actual selected FusionProfile alongside its supplied fusionProfileName."
msgstr "从实际所选 FusionProfile 保留一个 xsd:unsignedInt 值，连同其所提供 fusionProfileName。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fusionProfileVersion|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The inspected result returns a fusion name; its version comes from the selected full profile input. Name/version does not uniquely determine components or establish a call/result association in this foundation."
msgstr "所检查结果返回融合名称；版本来自所选完整配置输入。名称/版本不唯一确定组件，也不在此基础中确立调用/结果关联。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fusionProfileVersion|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Synthetic selected version: ex:profile gmeow:fusionProfileVersion \"3\"^^xsd:unsignedInt ."
msgstr "合成所选版本：ex:profile gmeow:fusionProfileVersion \"3\"^^xsd:unsignedInt ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fusionWeightedScale18Convention|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "weighted scale-18 fusion convention"
msgstr "18 位小数加权融合约定"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fusionWeightedScale18Convention|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The observed positive weighted reciprocal-rank source convention with k equal to 60 and u128 raw units at scale 10^18. Each present-class coefficient is divided once by 60 plus retained source rank, truncated before class-order checked summation; an absent class contributes zero."
msgstr "观察到的正权重倒数名次来源约定，k 等于 60，原始单位为按 10^18 缩放的 u128。对每个存在类别，其系数仅除以 60 加保留来源名次一次，在按类别顺序进行溢出检查求和前截断；缺失类别贡献零。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fusionWeightedScale18Convention|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain the observed scale-18 weighted source claim independently of old unweighted integer fusion or a differently rounded reciprocal-first source."
msgstr "用于保留观察到的 18 位小数加权来源主张，独立于旧非加权整数融合或舍入不同的倒数优先来源。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fusionWeightedScale18Convention|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid normalizing weights to sum one, renumbering source tied ranks into distinct-subject ranks or claiming that selecting this value verifies arithmetic or fitting."
msgstr "避免将权重归一化为总和一、将来源并列名次重编号为不同主体名次，或声称选择此值验证了算术或拟合。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fusionWeightedScale18Convention|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Select this convention explicitly and retain actual native profile digest bytes plus the declared dimension and reference frame of the reported Quantity."
msgstr "显式选择此约定，并保留实际原生配置摘要字节，以及已报告 Quantity 的声明量纲及参照系。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fusionWeightedScale18Convention|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The candidate uses its minimum retained rank within each class; final score overflow refuses rather than saturates. Fitting, measured/unmeasured mode, complete weights/contributions, quantum membership and native profile authentication remain outside this foundation."
msgstr "候选项在每个类别内使用其保留的最小名次；最终分数溢出时拒绝而非饱和。拟合、实测/未实测模式、完整权重/贡献、量化步长符合性及原生配置认证不属于此基础。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fusionWeightedScale18Convention|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "An explicit weighted source claim: ex:profile gmeow:fusionScoreConvention gmeow:fusionWeightedScale18Convention ."
msgstr "显式加权来源主张：ex:profile gmeow:fusionScoreConvention gmeow:fusionWeightedScale18Convention ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fusionUnitScale12Convention|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "unit scale-12 reciprocal-first fusion convention"
msgstr "12 位小数单位权重倒数优先融合约定"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fusionUnitScale12Convention|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The observed pinned unit-weight source convention with k equal to 60 and signed i128 raw units at scale 10^12. The reciprocal is truncated first and then checked-multiplied by the unit coefficient for each admitted family or defocus stratum; contribution sums are checked."
msgstr "观察到的固定版本单位权重来源约定，k 等于 60，原始单位为按 10^12 缩放的有符号 i128。先截断倒数，再为每个已接纳检索族或 defocus 层级与单位系数进行溢出检查乘法；贡献和也进行检查。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fusionUnitScale12Convention|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain the actual pinned unit-weight source claim with its selected profile name/version and quantitative interpretation."
msgstr "用于保留实际固定版本单位权重来源主张，连同其所选配置名称/版本及定量解释。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fusionUnitScale12Convention|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid substituting current upstream Precision/Score behavior, importing fitted Katamari coefficients or equating reciprocal-first and numerator-division arithmetic."
msgstr "避免替换为当前上游 Precision/Score 行为、导入已拟合 Katamari 系数，或将倒数优先算术与分子除法算术等同。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fusionUnitScale12Convention|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Select this convention explicitly and retain actual selected source profile name/version, declared dimension and applicable reference frame."
msgstr "显式选择此约定，并保留实际所选来源配置名称/版本、声明量纲及适用参照系。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fusionUnitScale12Convention|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Source family ranks count distinct subjects from one, with defocus ranked as an admitted component. Positive unit contributions yield nonnegative scores despite the signed carrier. The actual full profile supplies its component set; names/versions alone do not determine or validate it."
msgstr "来源检索族名次从一开始按不同主体计数，defocus 作为已接纳组件参与排名。即使载体有符号，正单位贡献也产生非负分数。实际完整配置提供其组件集；仅有名称/版本既不确定也不验证组件集。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fusionUnitScale12Convention|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "An explicit unit source claim: ex:profile gmeow:fusionScoreConvention gmeow:fusionUnitScale12Convention ."
msgstr "显式单位权重来源主张：ex:profile gmeow:fusionScoreConvention gmeow:fusionUnitScale12Convention ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionScoreProfileSourceFormLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "fusion score profile source form law"
msgstr "融合分数配置来源形式定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionScoreProfileSourceFormLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A declared fusion-score profile uses the supplied native identity form appropriate to its selected source convention: digest bytes alone for weighted scale-18, or actual profile name and selected version for unit scale-12."
msgstr "声明融合分数配置使用与其所选来源约定相符的所提供原生身份形式：18 位小数加权约定仅用摘要字节，12 位小数单位权重约定用实际配置名称及所选版本。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionScoreProfileSourceFormLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to require the applicable identity representation without a universal native-byte requirement or a parameter default."
msgstr "用于要求适用身份表示，不施加普遍原生字节要求或参数默认值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionScoreProfileSourceFormLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid equating identity form with digest authenticity, content-unique profile identity, component validation or a source-call/result association."
msgstr "避免将身份形式等同于摘要真实性、内容唯一配置身份、组件验证或来源调用/结果关联。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionScoreProfileSourceFormLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Under each explicit convention require its applicable identity fields and forbid the other form, using distinct fresh existence witnesses and local datatype/maximality restrictions."
msgstr "在每个显式约定下要求其适用身份字段并禁止另一形式，使用不同的新绑定存在见证及局部数据类型及最大基数限制。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionScoreProfileSourceFormLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "This law grades representation form only. Actual identity bytes/text/version, native byte width and authentic binding to the selected full source profile remain import and application obligations; equal metadata does not merge interpretation records."
msgstr "此定律仅评定表示形式。实际身份字节/文本/版本、原生字节宽度及与所选完整来源配置的真实绑定仍是导入及应用义务；相等元数据不合并解释记录。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionScoreProfileSourceFormLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "The unit identity form: ex:profile gmeow:fusionProfileName \"example-profile\"^^xsd:string ; gmeow:fusionProfileVersion \"3\"^^xsd:unsignedInt ."
msgstr "单位权重身份形式：ex:profile gmeow:fusionProfileName \"example-profile\"^^xsd:string ; gmeow:fusionProfileVersion \"3\"^^xsd:unsignedInt ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionScoreContextAgreementLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "fusion score interpretation agreement law"
msgstr "融合分数解释一致定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionScoreContextAgreementLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A reported fusion score and its selected declared profile interpretation use the exact same dimension resource and the exact same applicable reference-frame resource."
msgstr "已报告融合分数及其所选声明配置解释使用完全相同的量纲资源及完全相同的适用参照系资源。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionScoreContextAgreementLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to keep quantitative meaning explicit and consistent across a supplied score and its declared context."
msgstr "用于使所提供分数与其声明上下文之间的定量含义明确且一致。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionScoreContextAgreementLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid comparing only labels, merging equal-looking frames or claiming this agreement authenticates an actual source call or arithmetic application."
msgstr "避免仅比较标签、合并看似相同的参照系，或声称此一致性认证实际来源调用或算术应用。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionScoreContextAgreementLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Bind the score’s selected profile and each side’s stored dimension and frame, then require termEqual on the corresponding resource pairs."
msgstr "绑定分数所选配置及两端存储的量纲和参照系，然后要求对应资源对满足 termEqual。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionScoreContextAgreementLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The profile record itself is the selected interpretation context; no separate call-context resource or result link is introduced. Authentic association with an actual source call, full profile and result remains application-owned."
msgstr "配置记录本身就是所选解释上下文；不引入独立调用上下文资源或结果链接。与实际来源调用、完整配置及结果的真实关联仍由应用负责。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionScoreContextAgreementLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A shared frame resource: ex:score gmeow:hasReferenceFrame ex:frame ; gmeow:reportedFusionScoreProfile ex:profile . ex:profile gmeow:hasReferenceFrame ex:frame ."
msgstr "共享参照系资源：ex:score gmeow:hasReferenceFrame ex:frame ; gmeow:reportedFusionScoreProfile ex:profile . ex:profile gmeow:hasReferenceFrame ex:frame ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionScoreCarrierRangeLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "fusion score representable carrier range law"
msgstr "融合分数可表示载体范围定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionScoreCarrierRangeLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A reported fused magnitude is nonnegative and no greater than the selected observed source carrier’s exact capacity: unsigned 128-bit units at scale 10^18 or the positive capacity of signed 128-bit units at scale 10^12."
msgstr "报告融合量值非负，且不大于所选观察来源载体的精确容量：按 10^18 缩放的无符号 128 位单位，或按 10^12 缩放的有符号 128 位单位的正容量。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionScoreCarrierRangeLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to reject negative or over-capacity decimal reports under these explicit positive-weight source claims."
msgstr "用于在这些显式正权重来源主张下，拒绝负数或超容量十进制报告。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionScoreCarrierRangeLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid calling an in-range decimal a fixed-point value, full numeric-domain member, quantum-valid value or arithmetic-conformant result."
msgstr "避免将范围内十进制数称为定点值、完整数值域成员、符合量化步长的值或算术符合性结果。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionScoreCarrierRangeLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Bind the exact decimal magnitude and selected convention; compare against zero and the appropriate exact decimal carrier maximum with supported term comparisons."
msgstr "绑定精确十进制量值及所选约定；使用受支持项比较与零及适用的精确十进制载体最大值比较。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionScoreCarrierRangeLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "These are carrier-range checks only. An in-range decimal finer than the selected quantum can pass. Truncation, quantum membership, complete summation, native admission and source authenticity are not certified; xsd:decimal already excludes nonfinite values."
msgstr "这些仅是载体范围检查。比所选量化步长更细的范围内十进制数可以通过。不认证截断、量化步长符合性、完整求和、原生接纳或来源真实性；xsd:decimal 已排除非有限值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionScoreCarrierRangeLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A reported zero remains valid: ex:score math:quantityValue \"0\"^^xsd:decimal ."
msgstr "报告零仍有效：ex:score math:quantityValue \"0\"^^xsd:decimal ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryWeightedFusion|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Query Weighted Fusion"
msgstr "查询加权融合"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryWeightedFusion|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A query-node description for the selected weighted reciprocal-rank application contract, retaining its original union evidence and declared source interpretation through application occurrences."
msgstr "描述所选加权倒数名次应用契约的查询节点；通过应用出现保留原始并集证据及声明的来源解释。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryWeightedFusion|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to describe weighted fusion separately from the existing unweighted integer operator."
msgstr "用于将加权融合与现有的非加权整数算子分开描述。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryWeightedFusion|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid treating the node description as an execution, fitting procedure, ordering policy or permission to broaden ReciprocalRankFusion."
msgstr "避免将节点描述视为执行、拟合过程、排序策略或扩大 ReciprocalRankFusion 契约的许可。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryWeightedFusion|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Link the actual reported application through executesQueryNode and retain the complete coefficient, contribution, score and declared-sum account on that occurrence."
msgstr "通过 executesQueryNode 关联实际报告的应用，并在该出现上保留完整的系数、贡献、分数及声明求和记录。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryWeightedFusion|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The selected application uses the weighted scale-eighteen source convention. Declared decimal summation does not certify raw fixed-point admission, rank truncation or native execution."
msgstr "所选应用使用 18 位小数加权来源约定。声明的十进制求和不认证原始定点接纳、名次截断或原生执行。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryWeightedFusion|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped fragment: ex:weightedNode a gmeow:QueryWeightedFusion . Its inherited effect and stratum bindings are omitted here."
msgstr "虚构的局部片段：ex:weightedNode a gmeow:QueryWeightedFusion . 此处省略继承的效果及层级绑定。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryWeightedFusionApplication|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Query Weighted Fusion Application"
msgstr "查询加权融合应用"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryWeightedFusionApplication|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A consumer-reported successful weighted-fusion occurrence joining one original union, one answer occurrence, one selected profile interpretation, explicit measured status and complete applied quantitative evidence."
msgstr "消费者报告的一次成功加权融合出现，将一个原始并集、一个答案出现、一个所选配置解释、显式实测状态及完整的已应用定量证据关联起来。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryWeightedFusionApplication|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to associate an actual reported call and result with the selected source-profile interpretation and original evidence identities."
msgstr "用于将实际报告的调用及结果与所选来源配置解释和原始证据身份关联。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryWeightedFusionApplication|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid fabricating an empty successful answer for a failed call, authenticating a source by declaration or inventing a second execution for the ordering returned by the same native result."
msgstr "避免为失败调用虚构空的成功答案、凭声明认证来源，或为同一原生结果返回的排序虚构第二次执行。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryWeightedFusionApplication|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Supply executesQueryNode, weightedFusionInput, weightedFusionOutput, weightedFusionProfile, weightedFusionMeasured and every actual coefficient, score and applicable full fit."
msgstr "提供 executesQueryNode、weightedFusionInput、weightedFusionOutput、weightedFusionProfile、weightedFusionMeasured，以及每个实际系数、分数和适用的完整拟合。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryWeightedFusionApplication|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "A successful empty union retains its nonempty declared class set and coefficients. Partial recall retains its original loss and completeness evidence. Source authentication and native arithmetic remain separate requirements."
msgstr "成功的空并集仍保留实际声明的非空类别集及系数。部分召回保留原始损失及完整性证据。来源认证与原生算术仍是独立要求。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryWeightedFusionApplication|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped fragment: ex:call a gmeow:QueryWeightedFusionApplication ; gmeow:executesQueryNode ex:weightedNode . Other required occurrence bindings are omitted."
msgstr "虚构的局部片段：ex:call a gmeow:QueryWeightedFusionApplication ; gmeow:executesQueryNode ex:weightedNode . 此处省略其他必需的出现绑定。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryWeightedFusionAnswer|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Query Weighted Fusion Answer"
msgstr "查询加权融合答案"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryWeightedFusionAnswer|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The attributed answer occurrence of one reported weighted-fusion application, retaining its original union and exactly the same query, candidate and loss-ledger identities."
msgstr "一次已报告加权融合应用的归属答案出现，保留原始并集以及完全相同的查询、候选项及损失账本身份。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryWeightedFusionAnswer|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use for the one result occurrence whose reported scores and any applied-order enrichment belong to the same native call."
msgstr "用于同一次原生调用的已报告分数及任何已应用排序扩充共同所属的那个结果出现。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryWeightedFusionAnswer|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid minting a separate native result for ordering, copying original evidence identities or inferring complete recall from successful fusion."
msgstr "避免为排序另造原生结果、复制原始证据身份，或从成功融合推断召回完整。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryWeightedFusionAnswer|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain weightedOriginalUnion and the original queryAnswerFor, queryCandidate and queryLossLedger links, and identify the unique incoming application owner."
msgstr "保留 weightedOriginalUnion 及原始 queryAnswerFor、queryCandidate 和 queryLossLedger 链接，并标识唯一的传入应用所有者。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryWeightedFusionAnswer|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "An empty successful answer has no candidates or scores. Its classes, mode and profile remain on the owning application; inherited answer attribution and verdict obligations still apply."
msgstr "成功的空答案没有候选项或分数。类别、模式和配置仍属于所属应用；继承的答案归属及判定义务仍然适用。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryWeightedFusionAnswer|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped fragment: ex:answer a gmeow:QueryWeightedFusionAnswer ; gmeow:weightedOriginalUnion ex:union . Inherited answer obligations and the application owner are omitted."
msgstr "虚构的局部片段：ex:answer a gmeow:QueryWeightedFusionAnswer ; gmeow:weightedOriginalUnion ex:union . 此处省略继承的答案义务及应用所有者。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAppliedFusionCoefficient|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Query Applied Fusion Coefficient"
msgstr "查询已应用融合系数"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAppliedFusionCoefficient|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A positive exact-decimal dimensionless Quantity applied for one original retrieval class at its source class ordinal in a reported weighted-fusion application."
msgstr "已报告加权融合应用中，按来源类别序号为一个原始检索类别应用的正精确十进制无量纲 Quantity。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAppliedFusionCoefficient|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use for actual applied coefficients in both measured mode and explicitly reported unmeasured unit mode."
msgstr "用于实际应用的系数，包括实测模式及来源明确报告的未实测单位权重模式。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAppliedFusionCoefficient|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid classifying an unmeasured unit as QueryFusionClassWeight, normalizing coefficients to probabilities or adding a parallel scalar weight property."
msgstr "避免将未实测单位权重归类为 QueryFusionClassWeight、把系数归一化为概率，或增设并行标量权重属性。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAppliedFusionCoefficient|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Supply appliedCoefficientClass, entryOrdinal as xsd:nonNegativeInteger, decimal math:quantityValue, explicit dimensionless dimension and the selected applicable reference frame."
msgstr "提供 appliedCoefficientClass、类型为 xsd:nonNegativeInteger 的 entryOrdinal、十进制 math:quantityValue、显式无量纲量纲及选定的适用参照系。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAppliedFusionCoefficient|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Compatible applications may share a fully coordinated coefficient. Source class order and native raw-scalar interpretation remain import evidence; numeric positivity and capacity do not certify the fixed-point grid."
msgstr "兼容的应用可以共享具有完整坐标的系数。来源类别顺序及原生原始标量解释仍由导入证据负责；数值正性及容量不认证定点量化网格。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAppliedFusionCoefficient|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped fragment: ex:coefficient a gmeow:QueryAppliedFusionCoefficient ; math:quantityValue \"1.0\"^^xsd:decimal ; gmeow:appliedCoefficientClass ex:lexical ; gmeow:entryOrdinal \"0\"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger . Dimension, frame and application are omitted."
msgstr "虚构的局部片段：ex:coefficient a gmeow:QueryAppliedFusionCoefficient ; math:quantityValue \"1.0\"^^xsd:decimal ; gmeow:appliedCoefficientClass ex:lexical ; gmeow:entryOrdinal \"0\"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger . 此处省略量纲、参照系及应用。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryWeightedFusionContribution|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Query Weighted Fusion Contribution"
msgstr "查询加权融合贡献"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryWeightedFusionContribution|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A reported nonnegative exact-decimal dimensionless contribution Quantity for one applied coefficient in one candidate score, with an original minimum-rank witness when that class delivered the candidate."
msgstr "一个候选项分数中，针对一个已应用系数报告的非负精确十进制无量纲贡献 Quantity；若该类别交付了此候选项，则带有原始最小名次见证。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryWeightedFusionContribution|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain every declared class contribution, including absent-class zeros and zero-valued contributions from present ranks."
msgstr "用于保留每个声明类别的贡献，包括缺失类别的零贡献，以及具有实际名次的零值贡献。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryWeightedFusionContribution|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid treating zero as proof of class absence, creating an entry for an undelivered candidate or equating a reported contribution with verified truncation arithmetic."
msgstr "避免将零视为类别缺失的证明、为未交付候选项创建条目，或将报告贡献等同于已验证的截断算术。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryWeightedFusionContribution|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Supply contributionCoefficient, decimal math:quantityValue, explicit dimensionless dimension and applicable frame; retain at most one original contributionRankEntry and the unique score owner."
msgstr "提供 contributionCoefficient、十进制 math:quantityValue、显式无量纲量纲及适用参照系；保留至多一个原始 contributionRankEntry 及唯一的分数所有者。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryWeightedFusionContribution|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Every score retains one contribution per actual coefficient. A missing original class/candidate entry requires an unwitnessed zero; a present rank can also contribute zero. Candidate identity follows the owning score."
msgstr "每个分数为每个实际系数保留一个贡献。缺少原始类别/候选项条目时必须是无见证零贡献；存在名次时也可能贡献零。候选项身份由所属分数确定。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryWeightedFusionContribution|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped fragment: ex:absentPart a gmeow:QueryWeightedFusionContribution ; math:quantityValue \"0.0\"^^xsd:decimal ; gmeow:contributionCoefficient ex:coefficient . Missing owner and context must be supplied in a complete account."
msgstr "虚构的局部片段：ex:absentPart a gmeow:QueryWeightedFusionContribution ; math:quantityValue \"0.0\"^^xsd:decimal ; gmeow:contributionCoefficient ex:coefficient . 完整记录中必须补充缺失的所有者及上下文。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAppliedFusionScore|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Query Applied Fusion Score"
msgstr "查询已应用融合分数"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAppliedFusionScore|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A reported fused-score Quantity for one original candidate in one weighted application, retaining a complete class-contribution account and an explicit finite decimal-sum witness."
msgstr "一次加权应用中，为一个原始候选项报告的融合分数 Quantity，保留完整的类别贡献记录及显式有限十进制求和见证。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAppliedFusionScore|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to connect the reported-score foundation to an actual reported candidate and application occurrence."
msgstr "用于将已报告分数基础与实际报告的候选项及应用出现关联。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAppliedFusionScore|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid reusing old integer QueryFusionScore fields, merging scores across calls because magnitudes match or calling a declared exact sum a native arithmetic certificate."
msgstr "避免复用旧的整数 QueryFusionScore 字段、因量值相等而合并不同调用的分数出现，或将声明的精确和称为原生算术证书。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAppliedFusionScore|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Supply appliedScoreCandidate, every weightedScoreContribution, weightedScoreFoldStep and weightedScoreFinalStep, plus the inherited decimal magnitude, dimension, frame and selected reportedFusionScoreProfile."
msgstr "提供 appliedScoreCandidate、每个 weightedScoreContribution、weightedScoreFoldStep 及 weightedScoreFinalStep，以及继承的十进制量值、量纲、参照系及所选 reportedFusionScoreProfile。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAppliedFusionScore|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Every typed score has exactly one application owner. The declared contribution sum equals its decimal magnitude; fixed-point grid, floor division, authentic source execution and applied order are separate acceptance boundaries."
msgstr "每个具有此类型的分数恰有一个应用所有者。声明的贡献和等于其十进制量值；定点网格、向下取整除法、真实来源执行及已应用排序是独立的验收边界。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAppliedFusionScore|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped fragment: ex:score a gmeow:QueryAppliedFusionScore ; gmeow:appliedScoreCandidate ex:candidate . Its inherited quantitative coordinates, owner, contributions and complete fold are omitted."
msgstr "虚构的局部片段：ex:score a gmeow:QueryAppliedFusionScore ; gmeow:appliedScoreCandidate ex:candidate . 此处省略继承的定量坐标、所有者、贡献及完整折叠。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryWeightedScoreFoldStep|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Query Weighted Score Fold Step"
msgstr "查询加权分数折叠步骤"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryWeightedScoreFoldStep|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "One declared control step in a finite mathematical witness summing all reported contributions of an applied fusion score, distinct from the Quantity carrying its partial total."
msgstr "有限数学见证中的一个声明控制步骤，用于累加已应用融合分数的所有报告贡献；它与承载部分总和的 Quantity 不同。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryWeightedScoreFoldStep|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to express complete decimal summation through zero base, immediate predecessors, unique natural indices and a final bound."
msgstr "用于通过零基步、直接前驱、唯一自然数索引及最终界限表达完整十进制求和。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryWeightedScoreFoldStep|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid claiming that these witness steps were serialized by the native API, represent a second source execution or carry their magnitude directly as a scalar control field."
msgstr "避免声称这些见证步骤由原生 API 序列化、代表第二次来源执行，或将量值直接放在标量控制字段上。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryWeightedScoreFoldStep|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Supply entryOrdinal and weightedStepTotal; each positive step supplies weightedPreviousStep and weightedStepContribution under one unique score owner."
msgstr "提供 entryOrdinal 及 weightedStepTotal；每个正索引步骤在唯一分数所有者之下提供 weightedPreviousStep 及 weightedStepContribution。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryWeightedScoreFoldStep|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Witness indices start at mathematical zero and are independent of native class ordinals. Every actual contribution is used exactly once, including equal-valued and zero contributions."
msgstr "见证索引从数学上的零开始，与原生类别序号无关。每个实际贡献恰好使用一次，包括相等值贡献及零贡献。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryWeightedScoreFoldStep|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped fragment: ex:base a gmeow:QueryWeightedScoreFoldStep ; gmeow:entryOrdinal \"0\"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ; gmeow:weightedStepTotal ex:zeroTotal . The score owner and total Quantity context are omitted."
msgstr "虚构的局部片段：ex:base a gmeow:QueryWeightedScoreFoldStep ; gmeow:entryOrdinal \"0\"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ; gmeow:weightedStepTotal ex:zeroTotal . 此处省略分数所有者及总和 Quantity 的上下文。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryWeightedPartialSum|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Query Weighted Partial Sum"
msgstr "查询加权部分和"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryWeightedPartialSum|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A dimensionless exact-decimal Quantity carrying one partial total in a declared weighted-score sum witness, with one applicable reference frame."
msgstr "承载声明的加权分数求和见证中一个部分总和的无量纲精确十进制 Quantity，具有一个适用参照系。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryWeightedPartialSum|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to require local decimal magnitude and quantitative context on mathematical witness totals without narrowing generic math:Quantity."
msgstr "用于在数学见证总和上局部要求十进制量值及定量上下文，而不收窄通用 math:Quantity。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryWeightedPartialSum|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid adding reportedFusionScoreProfile merely to inherit witness context, inferring source reporting from witness use alone or forcing distinct Quantity identities for compatible steps."
msgstr "避免仅为继承见证上下文而添加 reportedFusionScoreProfile、仅从见证用途推断来源报告，或强制兼容步骤使用不同的 Quantity 身份。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryWeightedPartialSum|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Supply one xsd:decimal math:quantityValue, math:hasDimension math:dimensionless and hasReferenceFrame; connect the Quantity through weightedStepTotal from an owned fold step."
msgstr "提供一个 xsd:decimal 类型的 math:quantityValue、math:hasDimension math:dimensionless 及 hasReferenceFrame；通过所属折叠步骤上的 weightedStepTotal 关联该 Quantity。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryWeightedPartialSum|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The owning score and application supply the profile context, and the exact frame resources agree. Compatible steps may share the same total Quantity. Its range follows from the complete nonnegative fold and bounded final score. An actually source-reported Quantity may also serve as a compatible total; witness use alone does not assert reporting."
msgstr "所属分数及应用提供配置上下文，且参照系资源完全相同。兼容步骤可共享同一个总和 Quantity。其范围由完整非负折叠及有界最终分数推出。实际由来源报告的 Quantity 也可兼任兼容的总和；仅有见证用途不声明来源报告。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryWeightedPartialSum|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped fragment: ex:zeroTotal a gmeow:QueryWeightedPartialSum ; math:quantityValue \"0.0\"^^xsd:decimal ; math:hasDimension math:dimensionless ; gmeow:hasReferenceFrame ex:frame . Its incoming step is omitted."
msgstr "虚构的局部片段：ex:zeroTotal a gmeow:QueryWeightedPartialSum ; math:quantityValue \"0.0\"^^xsd:decimal ; math:hasDimension math:dimensionless ; gmeow:hasReferenceFrame ex:frame . 此处省略传入步骤。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedFusionInput|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "weighted fusion original input"
msgstr "加权融合原始输入"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedFusionInput|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The one original unranked union consumed by a reported weighted-fusion application."
msgstr "已报告加权融合应用所消费的唯一原始无序并集。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedFusionInput|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain the actual original union and all its selected class-list evidence."
msgstr "用于保留实际原始并集及其全部选定类别列表证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedFusionInput|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid substituting a reconstructed union or deriving aggregate input ranks from serialization order."
msgstr "避免替换为重建并集，或从序列化顺序推导聚合输入名次。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedFusionInput|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Reference the original QueryUnionAnswer and preserve its query, candidate, loss and class-list resources."
msgstr "引用原始 QueryUnionAnswer，并保留其查询、候选项、损失及类别列表资源。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedFusionInput|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The selected application checks its candidate set against the retained lists. It does not invent a prior union execution."
msgstr "所选应用对照保留列表检查其候选集，不虚构先前的并集执行。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedFusionInput|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped fragment: ex:call gmeow:weightedFusionInput ex:union . Other required account bindings are omitted."
msgstr "虚构的局部片段：ex:call gmeow:weightedFusionInput ex:union . 此处省略其他必需的记录绑定。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedFusionOutput|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "weighted fusion answer occurrence"
msgstr "加权融合答案出现"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedFusionOutput|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The one attributed answer occurrence of a reported weighted-fusion application."
msgstr "已报告加权融合应用的唯一归属答案出现。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedFusionOutput|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to bind the reported result and any later applied-order enrichment to the same call."
msgstr "用于将已报告结果及任何后续已应用排序扩充绑定到同一次调用。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedFusionOutput|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid fabricating a second native result or omitting the unique application owner."
msgstr "避免虚构第二个原生结果或省略唯一应用所有者。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedFusionOutput|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Reference one QueryWeightedFusionAnswer whose weightedOriginalUnion agrees with the application input."
msgstr "引用一个 QueryWeightedFusionAnswer，其 weightedOriginalUnion 须与应用输入一致。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedFusionOutput|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The answer preserves original query, candidate and loss identities in both directions."
msgstr "答案双向保留原始查询、候选项及损失身份。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedFusionOutput|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped fragment: ex:call gmeow:weightedFusionOutput ex:answer . Other required account bindings are omitted."
msgstr "虚构的局部片段：ex:call gmeow:weightedFusionOutput ex:answer . 此处省略其他必需的记录绑定。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedFusionProfile|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "weighted fusion selected profile context"
msgstr "加权融合所选配置上下文"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedFusionProfile|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The one declared source-profile interpretation selected by a reported weighted-fusion application."
msgstr "已报告加权融合应用选择的唯一声明来源配置解释。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedFusionProfile|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to associate actual reported use with the retained profile resource independently of its partial native identity metadata."
msgstr "用于将实际报告的使用与保留的配置资源关联，且不依赖其不完整的原生身份元数据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedFusionProfile|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid treating equal digests as content-unique profiles, authenticating a call or manufacturing missing interpretation coordinates."
msgstr "避免将相等摘要视为内容唯一配置、认证调用，或制造缺失的解释坐标。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedFusionProfile|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Reference the actual selected interpretation record with the weighted scale-eighteen convention, explicit dimensionless dimension and complete applicable frame."
msgstr "引用实际选定的解释记录，带有 18 位小数加权约定、明确的无量纲量纲及完整适用参照系。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedFusionProfile|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The source full profile supplies components; the record alone does not serialize or authenticate them. All applied scores select this exact resource."
msgstr "来源完整配置提供组件；此记录本身不序列化或认证这些组件。所有已应用分数选择同一个确切资源。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedFusionProfile|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped fragment: ex:call gmeow:weightedFusionProfile ex:profile . Other required account bindings are omitted."
msgstr "虚构的局部片段：ex:call gmeow:weightedFusionProfile ex:profile . 此处省略其他必需的记录绑定。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedFusionMeasured|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "weighted fusion measured mode"
msgstr "加权融合实测模式"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedFusionMeasured|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The required typed Boolean reporting whether the actual application selected measured fitted coefficients or explicit unmeasured unit coefficients."
msgstr "必需的类型化布尔值，报告实际应用选择了实测拟合系数，还是显式未实测单位系数。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedFusionMeasured|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain the actual source branch without interpreting missing fit evidence as an unmeasured result."
msgstr "用于保留实际来源分支，而不将缺少拟合证据解释为未实测结果。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedFusionMeasured|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid changing true to false when full fits are unavailable or requiring measured coefficients to differ from one."
msgstr "避免在完整拟合不可用时将 true 改为 false，或要求实测系数必须不同于一。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedFusionMeasured|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Supply one xsd:boolean; true requires the actual full fit collection, while false forbids fits and requires every applied coefficient to equal decimal one."
msgstr "提供一个 xsd:boolean；true 要求实际完整拟合集，false 禁止拟合且要求每个已应用系数等于十进制一。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedFusionMeasured|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Boolean value comparison handles its legal lexical forms. Unit coefficients can be genuinely measured, so their numeric value alone does not determine mode."
msgstr "按布尔值比较可处理合法词法形式。单位系数也可以确实经过实测，因此仅凭数值不能确定模式。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedFusionMeasured|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped fragment: ex:call gmeow:weightedFusionMeasured \"false\"^^xsd:boolean . Other required account bindings are omitted."
msgstr "虚构的局部片段：ex:call gmeow:weightedFusionMeasured \"false\"^^xsd:boolean . 此处省略其他必需的记录绑定。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedFusionCoefficient|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "weighted fusion applied coefficient"
msgstr "加权融合已应用系数"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedFusionCoefficient|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "One member of the complete nonempty class-indexed coefficient collection actually applied by a reported weighted-fusion occurrence."
msgstr "已报告加权融合出现实际应用的、完整非空类别索引系数集中的一个成员。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedFusionCoefficient|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain every declared class coefficient even when that class delivers no candidate."
msgstr "用于保留每个声明类别的系数，即使该类别没有交付候选项。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedFusionCoefficient|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid dropping unavailable classes, silently normalizing values or treating an unmeasured unit as fit evidence."
msgstr "避免丢弃不可用类别、静默归一化数值，或将未实测单位系数视为拟合证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedFusionCoefficient|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Reference one fully coordinated applied coefficient per original retrieval class and preserve its actual distinct source ordinal."
msgstr "为每个原始检索类别引用一个具有完整坐标的已应用系数，并保留其实际且互异的来源序号。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedFusionCoefficient|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Compatible calls may share coefficient quantities. Every typed coefficient must have an actual reported application owner, without unique inverse ownership."
msgstr "兼容调用可以共享系数 Quantity。每个具有此类型的系数必须具有实际报告的应用所有者，但不要求逆向所有权唯一。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedFusionCoefficient|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped fragment: ex:call gmeow:weightedFusionCoefficient ex:lexicalCoefficient, ex:spaceCoefficient . Other required account bindings are omitted."
msgstr "虚构的局部片段：ex:call gmeow:weightedFusionCoefficient ex:lexicalCoefficient, ex:spaceCoefficient . 此处省略其他必需的记录绑定。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedFusionFit|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "weighted fusion applied full fit"
msgstr "加权融合所应用完整拟合"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedFusionFit|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "An actual full measured fit selected by the reported application, retaining its original judged-set and fitted class-weight quantities."
msgstr "已报告应用选择的一个实际完整实测拟合，保留原始已评判集及拟合类别权重 Quantity。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedFusionFit|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to record every selected full fit in measured mode."
msgstr "用于在实测模式下记录每个选定完整拟合。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedFusionFit|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid substituting fit-in-force summaries, inventing judged sets or silently falling back to unmeasured mode."
msgstr "避免用生效拟合摘要替代、虚构已评判集，或静默退回未实测模式。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedFusionFit|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Reference each supplied QueryFusionWeightFit; require exact class-set and numeric agreement with applied coefficients and compatibility of every supplied fitted-weight frame."
msgstr "引用每个所提供的 QueryFusionWeightFit；要求其与已应用系数的类别集及数值完全一致，并要求每个所提供拟合权重参照系兼容。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedFusionFit|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "An absent fitted-weight frame stays legal. Supplied unit metadata must preserve compatible native raw-scalar interpretation without silent conversion; no generic unit-equivalence check is claimed."
msgstr "缺少拟合权重参照系仍然合法。所提供单位元数据必须保留兼容的原生原始标量解释，不能静默转换；此处不声称通用单位等价检查。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedFusionFit|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped fragment: ex:call gmeow:weightedFusionFit ex:actualFullFit . Other required account bindings are omitted."
msgstr "虚构的局部片段：ex:call gmeow:weightedFusionFit ex:actualFullFit . 此处省略其他必需的记录绑定。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedFusionScore|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "weighted fusion applied score"
msgstr "加权融合已应用分数"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedFusionScore|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "One reported score in the complete original-candidate-indexed account of a weighted-fusion application."
msgstr "加权融合应用中，按原始候选项索引的完整记录中的一个报告分数。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedFusionScore|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain exactly one score for every original candidate and none for unrelated candidates."
msgstr "用于为每个原始候选项保留恰好一个分数，且不为无关候选项保留分数。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedFusionScore|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid adding a score to an empty union or merging separate call occurrences because their scores agree."
msgstr "避免向空并集添加分数，或因分数相等而合并不同调用出现。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedFusionScore|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Reference every QueryAppliedFusionScore and retain its original appliedScoreCandidate and exact selected profile."
msgstr "引用每个 QueryAppliedFusionScore，并保留其原始 appliedScoreCandidate 及确切的所选配置。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedFusionScore|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The collection is empty exactly when the original candidate union is empty. Each typed score has one application owner."
msgstr "当且仅当原始候选并集为空时，该集合为空。每个具有此类型的分数有一个应用所有者。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedFusionScore|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped fragment: ex:call gmeow:weightedFusionScore ex:firstScore, ex:secondScore . Other required account bindings are omitted."
msgstr "虚构的局部片段：ex:call gmeow:weightedFusionScore ex:firstScore, ex:secondScore . 此处省略其他必需的记录绑定。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedOriginalUnion|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "weighted answer original union"
msgstr "加权答案原始并集"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedOriginalUnion|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The one original union retained by a weighted-fusion answer occurrence."
msgstr "加权融合答案出现保留的唯一原始并集。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedOriginalUnion|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to preserve original evidence identity alongside reported weighted results."
msgstr "用于在报告的加权结果旁保留原始证据身份。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedOriginalUnion|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid copying lists, candidates or losses into replacement identities or claiming the union has an aggregate input score."
msgstr "避免将列表、候选项或损失复制为替代身份，或声称并集具有聚合输入分数。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedOriginalUnion|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Reference the same QueryUnionAnswer as the owning application weightedFusionInput."
msgstr "引用与所属应用 weightedFusionInput 相同的 QueryUnionAnswer。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedOriginalUnion|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Original query, candidate and loss-ledger memberships agree exactly between union and answer."
msgstr "并集与答案之间的原始查询、候选项及损失账本成员完全一致。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedOriginalUnion|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped fragment: ex:answer gmeow:weightedOriginalUnion ex:union . Other required account bindings are omitted."
msgstr "虚构的局部片段：ex:answer gmeow:weightedOriginalUnion ex:union . 此处省略其他必需的记录绑定。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedCoefficientClass|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "applied coefficient original class"
msgstr "已应用系数原始类别"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedCoefficientClass|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The exact original retrieval-family or space resource to which an applied coefficient belongs."
msgstr "已应用系数所属的确切原始检索族或空间资源。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedCoefficientClass|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain class identity separately from numeric coefficient and source ordinal."
msgstr "用于将类别身份与数值系数及来源序号分开保留。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedCoefficientClass|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid coercing a retrieval class into an RDF Class or merging classes by display label."
msgstr "避免将检索类别强制转换为 RDF Class，或按显示标签合并类别。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedCoefficientClass|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Reference the original rankedListClass resource from a retained input list."
msgstr "引用保留输入列表的原始 rankedListClass 资源。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedCoefficientClass|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "One coefficient per distinct class is required within an application; distinct original lists may name the same class."
msgstr "一次应用内每个不同类别须有一个系数；不同原始列表可以命名相同类别。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedCoefficientClass|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped fragment: ex:coefficient gmeow:appliedCoefficientClass ex:lexical . Other required account bindings are omitted."
msgstr "虚构的局部片段：ex:coefficient gmeow:appliedCoefficientClass ex:lexical . 此处省略其他必需的记录绑定。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedScoreContribution|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "weighted score class contribution"
msgstr "加权分数类别贡献"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedScoreContribution|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "One reported class contribution in the complete coefficient-indexed contribution collection of an applied score."
msgstr "已应用分数的完整系数索引贡献集合中的一个报告类别贡献。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedScoreContribution|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain every contribution including zero and equal-valued components."
msgstr "用于保留每个贡献，包括零贡献及相等值组件。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedScoreContribution|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid collapsing components by magnitude, omitting absent-class zeros or sharing a contribution across distinct score owners."
msgstr "避免按量值合并组件、省略缺失类别的零贡献，或在不同分数所有者之间共享贡献。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedScoreContribution|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Reference exactly one contribution per applied coefficient and include each in the declared finite fold exactly once."
msgstr "为每个已应用系数引用恰好一个贡献，并在声明的有限折叠中将每个贡献纳入恰好一次。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedScoreContribution|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Multiplicity is by contribution resource and coefficient, not distinct decimal value. The class set is nonempty for every selected source application."
msgstr "重数取决于贡献资源及系数，而不是不同的十进制值。每个选定来源应用的类别集均非空。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedScoreContribution|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped fragment: ex:score gmeow:weightedScoreContribution ex:leftPart, ex:rightPart . Other required account bindings are omitted."
msgstr "虚构的局部片段：ex:score gmeow:weightedScoreContribution ex:leftPart, ex:rightPart . 此处省略其他必需的记录绑定。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/contributionCoefficient|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "weighted contribution applied coefficient"
msgstr "加权贡献已应用系数"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/contributionCoefficient|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The one actual applied class coefficient indexing a weighted contribution."
msgstr "为加权贡献建立索引的唯一实际已应用类别系数。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/contributionCoefficient|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to connect a reported contribution to its original retrieval class through the actual coefficient."
msgstr "用于通过实际系数将报告贡献关联到其原始检索类别。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/contributionCoefficient|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid substituting an unrelated coefficient or copying class identity into a second contribution coordinate."
msgstr "避免替换为无关系数，或将类别身份复制到第二个贡献坐标。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/contributionCoefficient|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Reference a coefficient retained by the application of the unique owning score."
msgstr "引用由唯一所属分数的应用所保留的系数。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/contributionCoefficient|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Candidate identity follows the score owner. The coefficient must be represented exactly once in that score’s contribution set."
msgstr "候选项身份由分数所有者确定。该系数在该分数的贡献集中必须恰好表示一次。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/contributionCoefficient|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped fragment: ex:part gmeow:contributionCoefficient ex:coefficient . Other required account bindings are omitted."
msgstr "虚构的局部片段：ex:part gmeow:contributionCoefficient ex:coefficient . 此处省略其他必需的记录绑定。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/contributionRankEntry|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "weighted contribution minimum-rank witness"
msgstr "加权贡献最小名次见证"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/contributionRankEntry|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "At most one original ranked entry witnessing the minimum delivered rank for the class and candidate of this contribution."
msgstr "至多一个原始有序条目，见证该贡献的类别及候选项的最小交付名次。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/contributionRankEntry|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain original source rank evidence without replacing its occurrence identity."
msgstr "用于保留原始来源名次证据，而不替换其出现身份。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/contributionRankEntry|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid fabricating a witness for an absent class/candidate or requiring distinct tied minimum entries to merge."
msgstr "避免为缺失的类别/候选项虚构见证，或要求不同的并列最小条目合并。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/contributionRankEntry|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Reference an entry in an original retained list with the applied class and score candidate, and preserve its supplied rank no greater than every matching original rank."
msgstr "引用原始保留列表中、具有已应用类别及分数候选项的条目，并保留其来源名次；该名次不得大于任何匹配原始名次。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/contributionRankEntry|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "A present delivery requires a witness even for a zero contribution. Without an original match no witness is permitted and the contribution is decimal zero."
msgstr "有交付时，即使贡献为零也需要见证。没有原始匹配时，不允许见证且贡献为十进制零。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/contributionRankEntry|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped fragment: ex:part gmeow:contributionRankEntry ex:originalEntry . Other required account bindings are omitted."
msgstr "虚构的局部片段：ex:part gmeow:contributionRankEntry ex:originalEntry . 此处省略其他必需的记录绑定。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedScoreCandidate|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "applied fusion score original candidate"
msgstr "已应用融合分数原始候选项"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedScoreCandidate|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The one original candidate resource identified by an applied fusion score."
msgstr "已应用融合分数标识的唯一原始候选项资源。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedScoreCandidate|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to preserve candidate identity across original union, answer and quantitative account."
msgstr "用于在原始并集、答案及定量记录之间保留候选项身份。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedScoreCandidate|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid deriving identity from score equality, output position or a display label."
msgstr "避免从分数相等、输出位置或显示标签推导身份。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedScoreCandidate|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Reference a queryCandidate of the original union of the owning application."
msgstr "引用所属应用原始并集中的一个 queryCandidate。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedScoreCandidate|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Each original candidate has exactly one applied score in an application; separate calls retain separate score occurrences."
msgstr "一次应用中，每个原始候选项恰有一个已应用分数；不同调用保留各自的分数出现。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedScoreCandidate|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped fragment: ex:score gmeow:appliedScoreCandidate ex:candidate . Other required account bindings are omitted."
msgstr "虚构的局部片段：ex:score gmeow:appliedScoreCandidate ex:candidate . 此处省略其他必需的记录绑定。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedScoreFoldStep|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "weighted score declared fold step"
msgstr "加权分数声明折叠步骤"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedScoreFoldStep|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A member of the complete finite set of declared mathematical witness steps for an applied score."
msgstr "已应用分数的完整有限声明数学见证步骤集中的一个成员。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedScoreFoldStep|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain the zero base and every positive contribution step."
msgstr "用于保留零基步及每个正索引贡献步骤。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedScoreFoldStep|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid claiming native serialized accumulator metadata or leaving a predecessor gap."
msgstr "避免声称存在原生序列化累加器元数据，或留下前驱空缺。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedScoreFoldStep|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Reference the base and all uniquely indexed steps bounded by weightedScoreFinalStep; each typed step has one score owner."
msgstr "引用基步及所有唯一索引且受 weightedScoreFinalStep 界定的步骤；每个具有此类型的步骤有一个分数所有者。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedScoreFoldStep|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Every original score contribution is used exactly once, including equal and zero values. These steps are declared arithmetic witnesses."
msgstr "每个原始分数贡献恰好使用一次，包括相等值和零值。这些步骤是声明的算术见证。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedScoreFoldStep|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped fragment: ex:score gmeow:weightedScoreFoldStep ex:base, ex:stepOne, ex:stepTwo . Other required account bindings are omitted."
msgstr "虚构的局部片段：ex:score gmeow:weightedScoreFoldStep ex:base, ex:stepOne, ex:stepTwo . 此处省略其他必需的记录绑定。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedScoreFinalStep|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "weighted score final witness step"
msgstr "加权分数最终见证步骤"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedScoreFinalStep|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The one final step of the declared finite-sum witness for an applied score, carrying a total equal to the reported decimal score."
msgstr "已应用分数的声明有限求和见证的唯一最终步骤，承载等于报告十进制分数的总和。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedScoreFinalStep|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to bound the complete witness and compare its final Quantity magnitude to the reported score."
msgstr "用于界定完整见证，并比较其最终 Quantity 量值与报告分数。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedScoreFinalStep|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid requiring total and score Quantity resources to be identical or certifying native admission from declared sum equality."
msgstr "避免要求总和与分数 Quantity 资源必须是同一个资源，或从声明的和相等认证原生接纳。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedScoreFinalStep|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Reference one retained fold step whose index bounds every step and whose total decimal value equals the score value."
msgstr "引用一个保留的折叠步骤，其索引界定所有步骤，且总和十进制值等于分数值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedScoreFinalStep|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The final step is a member of the same score fold. With nonempty source classes every score has at least one positive step after its base."
msgstr "最终步骤属于同一分数的折叠。来源类别非空时，每个分数在基步之后至少具有一个正索引步骤。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedScoreFinalStep|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped fragment: ex:score gmeow:weightedScoreFinalStep ex:stepTwo . Other required account bindings are omitted."
msgstr "虚构的局部片段：ex:score gmeow:weightedScoreFinalStep ex:stepTwo . 此处省略其他必需的记录绑定。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedStepTotal|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "weighted witness partial total"
msgstr "加权见证部分总和"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedStepTotal|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The one coordinated partial-sum Quantity carrying the decimal total of a declared fold step."
msgstr "承载声明折叠步骤十进制总和的唯一具有协调坐标的部分和 Quantity。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedStepTotal|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to separate control-step identity from its dimensioned mathematical magnitude."
msgstr "用于将控制步骤身份与其带量纲数学量值分开。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedStepTotal|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid placing a shadow scalar total on the step or adding a source-reported profile link merely to inherit witness context."
msgstr "避免在步骤上放置影子标量总和，或仅为继承见证上下文而添加来源报告配置链接。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedStepTotal|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Reference a QueryWeightedPartialSum with required decimal value, explicit dimensionless dimension and the exact frame of the owning score."
msgstr "引用一个 QueryWeightedPartialSum，具有必需十进制值、显式无量纲量纲及与所属分数完全相同的参照系。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedStepTotal|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Compatible steps may share the total resource; no unique inverse owner or forced Quantity disjointness is introduced."
msgstr "兼容步骤可以共享总和资源；不引入逆向唯一所有者或强制的 Quantity 不相交性。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedStepTotal|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped fragment: ex:stepOne gmeow:weightedStepTotal ex:partialTotal . Other required account bindings are omitted."
msgstr "虚构的局部片段：ex:stepOne gmeow:weightedStepTotal ex:partialTotal . 此处省略其他必需的记录绑定。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedPreviousStep|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "weighted witness previous step"
msgstr "加权见证前一步骤"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedPreviousStep|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The unique same-score immediate predecessor of a positive-index declared fold step, absent on the zero base."
msgstr "正索引声明折叠步骤在同一分数内的唯一直接前驱；零基步上不存在此链接。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedPreviousStep|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to express a gap-free finite mathematical sum witness."
msgstr "用于表达无空缺的有限数学求和见证。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedPreviousStep|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid creating a predecessor on the base, crossing score owners or inventing a native execution trace."
msgstr "避免在基步上创建前驱、跨越分数所有者，或虚构原生执行轨迹。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedPreviousStep|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "For each positive step reference a retained step whose natural index plus one equals the current index."
msgstr "为每个正索引步骤引用一个保留步骤，其自然数索引加一等于当前索引。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedPreviousStep|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The maximum is one, positive steps require it and base steps forbid it. The actual index equation uses the existing result-first termSum signature."
msgstr "该链接的最大基数为一；正索引步骤要求此链接，基步禁止此链接。实际索引等式使用现有的结果优先 termSum 签名。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedPreviousStep|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped fragment: ex:stepTwo gmeow:weightedPreviousStep ex:stepOne . Other required account bindings are omitted."
msgstr "虚构的局部片段：ex:stepTwo gmeow:weightedPreviousStep ex:stepOne . 此处省略其他必需的记录绑定。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedStepContribution|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "weighted witness added contribution"
msgstr "加权见证所加贡献"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedStepContribution|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The one actual score contribution added by a positive-index declared fold step, absent on the zero base."
msgstr "正索引声明折叠步骤所加的唯一实际分数贡献；零基步上不存在此链接。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedStepContribution|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to account for every reported component exactly once in the finite sum."
msgstr "用于在有限和中恰好计入每个报告组件一次。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedStepContribution|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid adding unrelated contributions, counting a component twice or deduplicating equal-valued components."
msgstr "避免添加无关贡献、重复计算组件，或对相等值组件去重。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedStepContribution|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Reference an actual contribution of the score that owns the step; the current total equals the preceding total plus the exact decimal value of that contribution."
msgstr "引用所属步骤分数的实际贡献；当前总和等于前一总和加上该贡献的精确十进制值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedStepContribution|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Every contribution has one positive step in its score and every positive step has one contribution. This checks declared summation without validating native floor division."
msgstr "每个贡献在其分数中有一个正索引步骤，且每个正索引步骤有一个贡献。此检查验证声明的求和，而不验证原生向下取整除法。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/weightedStepContribution|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped fragment: ex:stepTwo gmeow:weightedStepContribution ex:rightPart . Other required account bindings are omitted."
msgstr "虚构的局部片段：ex:stepTwo gmeow:weightedStepContribution ex:rightPart . 此处省略其他必需的记录绑定。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionProfileContextLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "weighted fusion profile context law"
msgstr "加权融合配置上下文定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionProfileContextLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The selected application profile declares the weighted scale-eighteen convention and the dimensionless interpretation."
msgstr "所选应用配置声明 18 位小数加权约定及无量纲解释。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionProfileContextLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to keep the chosen source convention and quantitative interpretation explicit."
msgstr "用于保持所选来源约定及定量解释明确。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionProfileContextLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid accepting a different convention merely because decimal values agree."
msgstr "避免仅因十进制值相等而接受不同约定。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionProfileContextLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Bind the supplied convention and dimension on the selected profile and compare them with the selected weighted convention and math:dimensionless."
msgstr "绑定所选配置上提供的约定及量纲，并与选定加权约定及 math:dimensionless 比较。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionProfileContextLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "This checks declared context, not native profile content, digest authenticity or arithmetic execution."
msgstr "此检查验证声明上下文，不验证原生配置内容、摘要真实性或算术执行。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionProfileContextLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped example: A fictional profile selecting the unit scale-twelve convention cannot serve this selected weighted application."
msgstr "虚构的局部示例：选择 12 位小数单位权重约定的虚构配置不能用于此选定加权应用。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionOutputPreservationLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "weighted fusion output preservation law"
msgstr "加权融合输出保留定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionOutputPreservationLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The weighted answer retains the original input union and exactly the same query, candidate and loss-ledger resources in both directions."
msgstr "加权答案保留原始输入并集，并双向保留完全相同的查询、候选项及损失账本资源。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionOutputPreservationLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to preserve original evidence across the reported answer occurrence."
msgstr "用于跨报告答案出现保留原始证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionOutputPreservationLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid copying identities, omitting original links or adding unrelated output membership."
msgstr "避免复制身份、省略原始链接或添加无关输出成员。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionOutputPreservationLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Under one application guard require original-union agreement and both directions for queryAnswerFor, queryCandidate and queryLossLedger."
msgstr "在同一个应用守卫下，要求原始并集一致，并要求 queryAnswerFor、queryCandidate 及 queryLossLedger 的双向保留。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionOutputPreservationLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "No rule creates verdicts from losses or promotes a successful fusion into complete recall."
msgstr "没有规则根据损失创建判定，或将成功融合提升为完整召回。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionOutputPreservationLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped example: A fictional answer that adds an unrelated candidate fails even if it retains every original candidate."
msgstr "虚构的局部示例：即使保留了每个原始候选项，添加无关候选项的虚构答案仍不符合要求。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionInputInventoryLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "weighted fusion input inventory law"
msgstr "加权融合输入清单定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionInputInventoryLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Every selected original list has its supplied class, and original-union candidate membership equals the membership of its retained lists."
msgstr "每个选定原始列表都有其所提供类别，且原始并集候选成员等于其保留列表的候选成员。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionInputInventoryLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to validate the original input inventory in the selected application context."
msgstr "用于在选定应用上下文中验证原始输入清单。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionInputInventoryLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inventing a prior union execution or duplicating existing ranked-entry ownership and list-membership laws."
msgstr "避免虚构先前的并集执行，或重复现有有序条目所有权及列表成员定律。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionInputInventoryLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Require each retained list class, retain each list candidate in the union and require every union candidate in an original retained list."
msgstr "要求每个保留列表具有类别，将每个列表候选项保留在并集中，并要求每个并集候选项位于某个原始保留列表中。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionInputInventoryLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Existing ranked-list laws already equate list membership with original entry identities. Standalone unions acquire no new global restrictions."
msgstr "现有有序列表定律已将列表成员与原始条目身份对应。独立并集不增加新的全局限制。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionInputInventoryLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped example: A fictional union cannot retain a candidate that occurs in none of its original retained lists."
msgstr "虚构的局部示例：虚构并集不能保留其所有原始保留列表中均不存在的候选项。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionCoefficientInventoryLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "weighted fusion coefficient inventory law"
msgstr "加权融合系数清单定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionCoefficientInventoryLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Applied coefficients cover exactly the original retrieval classes and are unique by class and numeric source ordinal within the application."
msgstr "已应用系数精确覆盖原始检索类别，并在应用内按类别及数值来源序号唯一。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionCoefficientInventoryLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain a complete class-indexed coefficient inventory."
msgstr "用于保留完整的类别索引系数清单。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionCoefficientInventoryLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid merging original lists by class label or treating ordinal uniqueness as authenticated source order."
msgstr "避免按类别标签合并原始列表，或将序号唯一性视为经过认证的来源顺序。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionCoefficientInventoryLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Check both class-coverage directions and pairwise coefficient identity when class resources or numeric ordinal values agree."
msgstr "检查类别覆盖的两个方向；当类别资源相同或序号数值相等时，要求对应系数具有相同身份。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionCoefficientInventoryLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Distinct original lists may name the same class. Actual source order and profile digest coverage remain import evidence."
msgstr "不同原始列表可以命名同一类别。实际来源顺序及配置摘要覆盖仍由导入证据负责。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionCoefficientInventoryLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped example: Two fictional coefficient resources naming the same original class fail within one application."
msgstr "虚构的局部示例：一次虚构应用中，两个系数资源命名同一个原始类别时不符合要求。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionCoefficientContextLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "weighted fusion coefficient context law"
msgstr "加权融合系数上下文定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionCoefficientContextLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Every applied coefficient uses the exact reference-frame resource selected by its owning application profile."
msgstr "每个已应用系数使用所属应用配置选择的完全相同参照系资源。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionCoefficientContextLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain compatible quantitative context on actual applied coefficients."
msgstr "用于在实际已应用系数上保留兼容定量上下文。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionCoefficientContextLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid treating equal coefficient values as context equivalence."
msgstr "避免将相等系数值视为上下文等价。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionCoefficientContextLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Bind the selected profile frame and coefficient frame before exact resource comparison."
msgstr "在进行确切资源比较前，绑定所选配置参照系及系数参照系。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionCoefficientContextLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Dimensionless dimension and required frame completeness are separate local restrictions. Compatible applications may share a coordinated coefficient."
msgstr "无量纲量纲及必需参照系的完整性是独立的局部限制。兼容应用可以共享具有协调坐标的系数。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionCoefficientContextLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped example: A fictional coefficient with a different stored frame fails even when its decimal value is one."
msgstr "虚构的局部示例：即使十进制值为一，存储了不同参照系的虚构系数仍不符合要求。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionMeasuredModeLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "weighted fusion measured mode law"
msgstr "加权融合实测模式定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionMeasuredModeLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The actual Boolean mode requires full fits when measured, and forbids fits while requiring unit applied coefficients when unmeasured."
msgstr "实际布尔模式在实测时要求完整拟合；未实测时禁止拟合，并要求已应用系数为单位值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionMeasuredModeLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to preserve the selected source measured or unmeasured branch."
msgstr "用于保留所选来源的实测或未实测分支。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionMeasuredModeLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid changing mode to hide missing full fits or deriving measurement status from unit values."
msgstr "避免通过改变模式掩盖完整拟合缺失，或从单位值推导实测状态。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionMeasuredModeLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Compare the bound typed Boolean by value; true requires a fit, false forbids fits and requires every applied coefficient to equal exact decimal one."
msgstr "按值比较绑定的类型化布尔值；true 要求拟合，false 禁止拟合且要求每个已应用系数等于精确十进制一。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionMeasuredModeLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "A measured fit may legitimately contain units. Missing fit evidence never authorizes changing true to false."
msgstr "实测拟合可以合法包含单位值。缺失拟合证据绝不授权将 true 改为 false。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionMeasuredModeLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped example: A fictional unmeasured report with a nonunit coefficient fails; a measured unit coefficient remains permitted."
msgstr "虚构的局部示例：含非单位系数的虚构未实测报告不符合要求；实测单位系数仍然允许。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionFitAgreementLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "weighted fusion fit agreement law"
msgstr "加权融合拟合一致性定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionFitAgreementLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Each actual selected full fit has exactly the applied coefficient class set with equal decimal values, and every actually supplied fit-weight frame equals the selected profile frame."
msgstr "每个实际选定完整拟合的类别集与已应用系数类别集完全相同，十进制值相等，且每个实际提供的拟合权重参照系等于所选配置参照系。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionFitAgreementLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to connect applied coefficients to complete original measured evidence without dropping contradictory context."
msgstr "用于将已应用系数关联到完整原始实测证据，而不丢弃矛盾上下文。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionFitAgreementLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid substituting fit summaries, inventing judged sets or silently converting supplied unit metadata."
msgstr "避免用拟合摘要替代、虚构已评判集，或静默转换所提供单位元数据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionFitAgreementLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Check both class/value directions; when a fitted weight actually has a frame, compare each such frame with the selected profile frame."
msgstr "检查类别/数值的两个方向；拟合权重实际具有参照系时，将每个该参照系与所选配置参照系比较。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionFitAgreementLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Absent fitted-weight frames remain legal. Supplied unit metadata must preserve compatible native raw-scalar interpretation at import; this law supplies no generic unit equivalence or conversion."
msgstr "缺少拟合权重参照系仍然合法。所提供单位元数据必须在导入时保留兼容的原生原始标量解释；此定律不提供通用单位等价或转换。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionFitAgreementLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped example: A fictional fitted weight with the correct class and decimal value still fails when its supplied frame differs from the selected frame."
msgstr "虚构的局部示例：即使类别及十进制值正确，提供的参照系不同于所选参照系的虚构拟合权重仍不符合要求。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionScoreAccountLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "weighted fusion score account law"
msgstr "加权融合分数记录定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionScoreAccountLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The reported application has exactly one applied score for every original candidate and no unrelated score candidate."
msgstr "报告的应用为每个原始候选项保留恰好一个已应用分数，且不含无关的分数候选项。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionScoreAccountLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain a complete candidate-indexed quantitative account."
msgstr "用于保留完整的候选项索引定量记录。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionScoreAccountLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid adding a score to an empty union or merging score occurrences across calls."
msgstr "避免向空并集添加分数，或跨调用合并分数出现。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionScoreAccountLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Require candidate-to-score coverage, score-to-original-candidate inclusion and pairwise score identity for equal candidates within the application."
msgstr "要求候选项到分数的覆盖、分数到原始候选项的包含关系，以及应用内相同候选项的分数身份两两相等。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionScoreAccountLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Candidate identity remains the original resource. Equal score magnitudes do not equate candidates or calls."
msgstr "候选项身份仍是原始资源。相等分数量值不会使候选项或调用等同。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionScoreAccountLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped example: A fictional two-candidate union with only one applied score fails."
msgstr "虚构的局部示例：具有两个候选项却只有一个已应用分数的虚构并集不符合要求。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionAnswerOwnerLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "weighted fusion answer owner law"
msgstr "加权融合答案所有者定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionAnswerOwnerLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Every typed weighted answer has one and only one typed incoming weighted application owner."
msgstr "每个具有加权答案类型的资源有且仅有一个具有类型的传入加权应用所有者。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionAnswerOwnerLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to keep answer occurrences tied to actual reported applications."
msgstr "用于将答案出现关联到实际报告的应用。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionAnswerOwnerLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid accepting isolated typed answers or treating inverse ownership as source authentication."
msgstr "避免接受孤立的类型化答案，或将逆向所有权视为来源认证。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionAnswerOwnerLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Require an incoming application and compare any two typed application owners of the same answer."
msgstr "要求一个传入应用，并比较同一答案的任意两个类型化应用所有者。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionAnswerOwnerLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The same native result supplies scores and ordering; later order enrichment belongs to this answer occurrence."
msgstr "同一个原生结果提供分数及排序；后续排序扩充属于此答案出现。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionAnswerOwnerLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped example: A fictional answer referenced by two distinct application occurrences fails unique ownership."
msgstr "虚构的局部示例：由两个不同应用出现引用的虚构答案不符合唯一所有权要求。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionScoreOwnerLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "weighted fusion score owner law"
msgstr "加权融合分数所有者定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionScoreOwnerLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Every typed applied score has one and only one typed incoming weighted application owner."
msgstr "每个具有已应用分数类型的资源有且仅有一个具有类型的传入加权应用所有者。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionScoreOwnerLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to give each applied score an unambiguous occurrence context."
msgstr "用于为每个已应用分数提供无歧义的出现上下文。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionScoreOwnerLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid accepting an isolated score or sharing one score occurrence across distinct calls."
msgstr "避免接受孤立分数，或在不同调用之间共享同一分数出现。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionScoreOwnerLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Require incoming application ownership and exact equality of any two typed owners."
msgstr "要求传入应用所有权，并要求任意两个类型化所有者完全相同。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionScoreOwnerLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Quantitative equality does not merge score resources. The inherited foundation still requires magnitude, dimension, frame and selected profile."
msgstr "定量相等不会合并分数资源。继承的基础仍要求量值、量纲、参照系及所选配置。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionScoreOwnerLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped example: A fictional score with no application owner fails even when all its quantitative coordinates are present."
msgstr "虚构的局部示例：即使所有定量坐标齐全，没有应用所有者的虚构分数仍不符合要求。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionContributionOwnerLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "weighted fusion contribution owner law"
msgstr "加权融合贡献所有者定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionContributionOwnerLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Every typed weighted contribution has one and only one typed incoming applied-score owner."
msgstr "每个具有加权贡献类型的资源有且仅有一个具有类型的传入已应用分数所有者。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionContributionOwnerLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to derive candidate and application context through one score occurrence."
msgstr "用于通过一个分数出现推导候选项及应用上下文。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionContributionOwnerLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid sharing a contribution occurrence across distinct scores or duplicating its candidate coordinate."
msgstr "避免在不同分数之间共享同一贡献出现，或重复其候选项坐标。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionContributionOwnerLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Require incoming typed score ownership and compare any two typed owners of the same contribution."
msgstr "要求传入的类型化分数所有权，并比较同一贡献的任意两个类型化所有者。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionContributionOwnerLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Equal-valued components remain distinct contribution occurrences where their coefficient or score context differs."
msgstr "当系数或分数上下文不同时，即使组件数值相等，也保留不同贡献出现。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionContributionOwnerLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped example: A fictional contribution linked by two distinct scores fails even when those scores have equal values."
msgstr "虚构的局部示例：由两个不同分数关联的虚构贡献不符合要求，即使这些分数的值相等。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionScoreProfileLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "weighted fusion score profile law"
msgstr "加权融合分数配置定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionScoreProfileLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Each applied score selects the exact profile resource selected by its owning weighted application."
msgstr "每个已应用分数选择所属加权应用选择的完全相同配置资源。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionScoreProfileLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to join reported magnitudes to the application declared interpretation."
msgstr "用于将报告量值关联到应用的声明解释。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionScoreProfileLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid replacing profile resource agreement with equal native bytes or name/version metadata."
msgstr "避免用相等原生字节或名称/版本元数据替代配置资源一致性。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionScoreProfileLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Bind weightedFusionProfile and each score reportedFusionScoreProfile, then compare the actual resources."
msgstr "绑定 weightedFusionProfile 及每个分数的 reportedFusionScoreProfile，再比较实际资源。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionScoreProfileLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The foundation separately enforces score/profile dimension and frame agreement. This law authenticates no source call."
msgstr "基础另行要求分数/配置的量纲及参照系一致。此定律不认证来源调用。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionScoreProfileLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped example: Two fictional profile records with equal digest literals cannot be substituted for one another in this application link."
msgstr "虚构的局部示例：在此应用链接中，两个摘要字面量相等的虚构配置记录不能互相替代。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionContributionAccountLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "weighted fusion contribution account law"
msgstr "加权融合贡献记录定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionContributionAccountLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Every applied score has exactly one reported contribution per actual applied coefficient and no contribution for an unrelated coefficient."
msgstr "每个已应用分数为每个实际已应用系数保留恰好一个报告贡献，且不含无关系数的贡献。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionContributionAccountLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain the complete coefficient-indexed component account."
msgstr "用于保留完整的系数索引组件记录。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionContributionAccountLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid discarding zero components or deduplicating equal decimal values."
msgstr "避免丢弃零组件，或对相等十进制值去重。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionContributionAccountLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Require contribution coverage for each coefficient, reverse coefficient inclusion and pairwise contribution uniqueness for the same score and coefficient."
msgstr "要求每个系数的贡献覆盖、反向系数包含关系，以及同一分数和系数的贡献身份两两唯一。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionContributionAccountLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Multiplicity follows resource and coefficient identity, not distinct magnitude. Native contribution arithmetic remains separately unqualified."
msgstr "重数取决于资源及系数身份，不取决于不同量值。原生贡献算术仍需另行确认。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionContributionAccountLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped example: A fictional score with two equal-valued contributions for different coefficients retains both components."
msgstr "虚构的局部示例：虚构分数中，针对不同系数的两个相等值贡献都应保留。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionContributionContextLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "weighted fusion contribution context law"
msgstr "加权融合贡献上下文定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionContributionContextLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Every reported contribution uses the exact selected application-profile frame."
msgstr "每个报告贡献使用完全相同的所选应用配置参照系。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionContributionContextLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to keep component magnitudes in the same declared quantitative context."
msgstr "用于使组件量值保持同一声明定量上下文。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionContributionContextLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid combining values from different stored frames because their decimals agree."
msgstr "避免因十进制值相等而组合不同存储参照系的值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionContributionContextLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Follow the contribution through its score and application, bind both frames and compare their resources."
msgstr "通过贡献所属分数及应用追踪上下文，绑定两个参照系并比较其资源。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionContributionContextLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Explicit dimensionless dimension is required locally. No native frame metadata is invented."
msgstr "局部要求显式无量纲量纲。不虚构原生参照系元数据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionContributionContextLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped example: A fictional zero contribution with a different supplied frame still fails."
msgstr "虚构的局部示例：提供了不同参照系的虚构零贡献仍不符合要求。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionRankWitnessLegitimacyLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "weighted fusion rank witness legitimacy law"
msgstr "加权融合名次见证合法性定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionRankWitnessLegitimacyLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Each linked rank witness is an original entry of a retained input list with the contribution coefficient class and score candidate."
msgstr "每个关联名次见证均是保留输入列表中的原始条目，具有贡献系数类别及分数候选项。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionRankWitnessLegitimacyLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to preserve the actual original rank evidence identity."
msgstr "用于保留实际原始名次证据身份。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionRankWitnessLegitimacyLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid fabricating a witness or substituting a copied entry from another union."
msgstr "避免虚构见证，或用从另一个并集复制的条目替代。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionRankWitnessLegitimacyLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Require a retained original list with the matching class, linked original entry and original candidate."
msgstr "要求一个保留的原始列表，具有匹配类别、关联的原始条目及原始候选项。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionRankWitnessLegitimacyLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The witness rank and unique list ownership remain governed by the existing ranked-entry contract."
msgstr "见证名次及唯一列表所有权仍由现有有序条目契约约束。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionRankWitnessLegitimacyLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped example: A fictional witness from an unrelated list fails despite carrying the same numeric rank."
msgstr "虚构的局部示例：即使数值名次相同，来自无关列表的虚构见证仍不符合要求。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionRankWitnessPresenceLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "weighted fusion rank witness presence law"
msgstr "加权融合名次见证存在定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionRankWitnessPresenceLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A class and candidate delivered by any original retained list require a rank-entry witness on the corresponding contribution."
msgstr "任一原始保留列表交付的类别及候选项，要求对应贡献具有名次条目见证。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionRankWitnessPresenceLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain evidence for every delivered class/candidate pair."
msgstr "用于为每个已交付类别/候选项对保留证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionRankWitnessPresenceLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid treating a zero value as permission to omit an actual rank witness."
msgstr "避免将零值视为可以省略实际名次见证的许可。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionRankWitnessPresenceLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "For each original matching entry require some contributionRankEntry; legitimacy and minimum laws constrain that witness."
msgstr "为每个原始匹配条目要求某个 contributionRankEntry；合法性及最小名次定律约束该见证。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionRankWitnessPresenceLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Equal minimum original entries need not merge and the witness need not be every tied entry."
msgstr "相等的最小原始条目无需合并，且见证不必是每个并列条目。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionRankWitnessPresenceLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped example: A fictional delivered candidate with a zero contribution still requires its original rank witness."
msgstr "虚构的局部示例：已交付但贡献为零的虚构候选项仍需原始名次见证。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionMinimumRankLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "weighted fusion minimum rank law"
msgstr "加权融合最小名次定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionMinimumRankLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The retained contribution witness rank is no greater than every original rank for the same class and candidate."
msgstr "保留贡献见证的名次不得大于同一类别及候选项的任何原始名次。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionMinimumRankLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to preserve source minimum-rank selection across original retained lists."
msgstr "用于在原始保留列表之间保留来源的最小名次选择。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionMinimumRankLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid renumbering tied or truncated ranks or inventing a preferred entry among equal minima."
msgstr "避免对并列或截断名次重编号，或在相等最小名次中虚构优先条目。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionMinimumRankLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Bind the witness rank and every original matching entry rank before exact integer comparison."
msgstr "绑定见证名次及每个原始匹配条目名次，再进行精确整数比较。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionMinimumRankLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Minimum rank is validated; authenticity of source delivery and native admission is not established."
msgstr "验证最小名次；不确立来源交付的真实性或原生接纳。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionMinimumRankLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped example: For fictional matching ranks forty and fifty, a witness at fifty fails the minimum condition."
msgstr "虚构的局部示例：原始匹配名次为四十和五十的虚构记录中，名次五十的见证不符合最小名次条件。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionSourceRankRangeLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "weighted fusion source rank range law"
msgstr "加权融合来源名次范围定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionSourceRankRangeLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Every original input entry selected by this weighted account has a rank within the positive unsigned native rank capacity."
msgstr "此加权记录选择的每个原始输入条目的名次均在正的原生无符号名次容量以内。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionSourceRankRangeLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain the source positive u64 rank boundary in the selected application context."
msgstr "用于在选定应用上下文中保留来源的正 u64 名次边界。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionSourceRankRangeLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid narrowing all ranked-query entries globally or accepting a larger positive rank here."
msgstr "避免全局收窄所有有序查询条目，或在此接受更大的正名次。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionSourceRankRangeLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Bind original selected entry ranks and compare them with exact positive integer 18446744073709551615."
msgstr "绑定原始选定条目的名次，并与精确正整数 18446744073709551615 比较。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionSourceRankRangeLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Existing entry restrictions require a positive integer; this law adds only the selected source upper bound and does not authenticate admission."
msgstr "现有条目限制要求正整数；此定律仅添加所选来源上界，不认证接纳。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionSourceRankRangeLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped example: A fictional selected rank above the unsigned capacity fails before any native arithmetic claim."
msgstr "虚构的局部示例：所选名次超出无符号容量的虚构记录，在任何原生算术主张之前即不符合要求。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionUnwitnessedZeroLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "weighted fusion unwitnessed zero law"
msgstr "加权融合无见证零值定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionUnwitnessedZeroLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A reported contribution without a rank-entry witness has exact decimal value zero."
msgstr "没有名次条目见证的报告贡献具有精确十进制零值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionUnwitnessedZeroLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to preserve the absent-class zero boundary."
msgstr "用于保留缺失类别的零值边界。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionUnwitnessedZeroLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring absence merely from zero or fabricating an entry to justify a nonzero value."
msgstr "避免仅从零推断缺失，或虚构条目为非零值提供依据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionUnwitnessedZeroLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Under a contribution guard bind its value and test the absence of a rank-entry witness before exact zero comparison."
msgstr "在贡献守卫下绑定其值，并在精确零值比较前检验名次条目见证是否不存在。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionUnwitnessedZeroLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Witness presence and legitimacy distinguish absent classes from delivered ranks that truncate to zero."
msgstr "见证存在性及合法性区分缺失类别与截断后为零的已交付名次。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionUnwitnessedZeroLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped example: A fictional unwitnessed nonzero contribution fails; a witnessed zero can remain valid."
msgstr "虚构的局部示例：无见证的虚构非零贡献不符合要求；有见证的零贡献仍可符合要求。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionCoefficientRangeLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "weighted fusion coefficient range law"
msgstr "加权融合系数范围定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionCoefficientRangeLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Every applied coefficient is greater than decimal zero and no greater than the exact weighted unsigned carrier capacity."
msgstr "每个已应用系数都大于十进制零，且不大于精确的加权无符号载体容量。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionCoefficientRangeLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to validate the necessary selected-source coefficient range."
msgstr "用于验证必需的所选来源系数范围。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionCoefficientRangeLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid claiming fixed-point quantum membership or native admission from a range check."
msgstr "避免从范围检查声称定点量化步长符合性或原生接纳。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionCoefficientRangeLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Bind the coefficient decimal value and compare it with zero and exact decimal 340282366920938463463.374607431768211455."
msgstr "绑定系数十进制值，并与零及精确十进制 340282366920938463463.374607431768211455 比较。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionCoefficientRangeLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Finer-quantum decimals within range are not rejected by this range law. No normalization or probability interpretation is imposed."
msgstr "此范围定律不会拒绝范围内具有更细量化步长的十进制值。不施加归一化或概率解释。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionCoefficientRangeLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped example: A fictional zero applied coefficient fails even in measured mode."
msgstr "虚构的局部示例：即使在实测模式下，虚构的零已应用系数仍不符合要求。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionContributionNonnegativeLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "weighted fusion contribution nonnegative law"
msgstr "加权融合贡献非负定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionContributionNonnegativeLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Every reported weighted contribution has a nonnegative exact decimal magnitude."
msgstr "每个报告的加权贡献具有非负精确十进制量值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionContributionNonnegativeLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to keep the complete declared sum monotone from its zero base."
msgstr "用于使完整声明和从零基步开始保持单调。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionContributionNonnegativeLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid adding a redundant independent component upper bound or treating nonnegativity as the native rank equation."
msgstr "避免添加冗余的独立组件上界，或将非负性视为原生名次等式。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionContributionNonnegativeLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Bind each contribution decimal value and compare it with exact decimal zero."
msgstr "绑定每个贡献十进制值，并与精确十进制零比较。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionContributionNonnegativeLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Complete finite summation and the foundation final-score bound imply the component upper bound without another range law."
msgstr "完整有限求和及基础的最终分数界限推出组件上界，无需另一条范围定律。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionContributionNonnegativeLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped example: A fictional negative component fails even when another component would compensate its value."
msgstr "虚构的局部示例：即使另一个组件会补偿其值，虚构的负组件仍不符合要求。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionFoldStepOwnerLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "weighted fusion fold step owner law"
msgstr "加权融合折叠步骤所有者定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionFoldStepOwnerLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Every typed declared fold step has one and only one typed incoming applied-score owner."
msgstr "每个具有声明折叠步骤类型的资源有且仅有一个具有类型的传入已应用分数所有者。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionFoldStepOwnerLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to keep witness control steps within one candidate-score occurrence."
msgstr "用于将见证控制步骤限制在一个候选项分数出现内。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionFoldStepOwnerLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid sharing a control-step identity across scores or accepting isolated typed steps."
msgstr "避免跨分数共享控制步骤身份，或接受孤立的类型化步骤。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionFoldStepOwnerLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Require incoming typed score membership and exact equality of any two score owners."
msgstr "要求传入的类型化分数成员关系，并要求任意两个分数所有者完全相同。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionFoldStepOwnerLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Total Quantity resources may be shared across compatible steps; this ownership law applies to control steps only."
msgstr "总和 Quantity 资源可以在兼容步骤之间共享；此所有权定律仅适用于控制步骤。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionFoldStepOwnerLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped example: A fictional step reused as a member of two distinct score folds fails."
msgstr "虚构的局部示例：被两个不同分数折叠作为成员复用的虚构步骤不符合要求。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionFoldBaseLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "weighted fusion fold base law"
msgstr "加权融合折叠基步定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionFoldBaseLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Every applied score has a zero-index base with total zero and no predecessor or added contribution."
msgstr "每个已应用分数都有一个零索引基步，其总和为零，且没有前驱或所加贡献。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionFoldBaseLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to establish the complete finite-sum witness base."
msgstr "用于确立完整有限求和见证的基步。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionFoldBaseLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid using an arbitrary initial total or attaching native accumulator provenance to the witness."
msgstr "避免使用任意初始总和，或为见证附加原生累加器来源主张。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionFoldBaseLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Require a zero-valued natural index member; on every zero-index step require decimal-zero total and absence of predecessor and contribution links."
msgstr "要求一个自然数索引值为零的成员；每个零索引步骤须具有十进制零总和，且无前驱及贡献链接。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionFoldBaseLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Index uniqueness gives one base. Boolean and numeric value comparisons do not rely on canonical lexical spelling."
msgstr "索引唯一性保证只有一个基步。布尔值及数值比较不依赖规范词法拼写。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionFoldBaseLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped example: A fictional base with decimal total one fails even if later totals match the reported score."
msgstr "虚构的局部示例：总和为十进制一的虚构基步不符合要求，即使后续总和匹配报告分数。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionFoldPositiveStepLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "weighted fusion fold positive step law"
msgstr "加权融合折叠正索引步骤定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionFoldPositiveStepLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Each positive-index declared fold step has one predecessor in the same score and one added contribution."
msgstr "每个正索引声明折叠步骤有一个同一分数内的前驱及一个所加贡献。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionFoldPositiveStepLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to prevent missing control links in the complete witness."
msgstr "用于防止完整见证中缺少控制链接。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionFoldPositiveStepLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid crossing score ownership or leaving a positive step without a component."
msgstr "避免跨越分数所有权，或使正索引步骤没有组件。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionFoldPositiveStepLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Require a same-score predecessor and contribution under the bound positive index; local maxima make both links single."
msgstr "在绑定的正索引守卫下要求同一分数内的前驱及贡献；局部最大基数限制使两个链接均为单值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionFoldPositiveStepLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The contribution-account law separately requires the component to be an actual contribution of that score."
msgstr "贡献记录定律另行要求该组件是此分数的实际贡献。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionFoldPositiveStepLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped example: A fictional positive step with no predecessor fails regardless of its stored total."
msgstr "虚构的局部示例：没有前驱的虚构正索引步骤不符合要求，与其存储总和无关。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionFoldIndexLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "weighted fusion fold index law"
msgstr "加权融合折叠索引定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionFoldIndexLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Each declared predecessor index plus one equals the current step index."
msgstr "每个声明前驱的索引加一等于当前步骤索引。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionFoldIndexLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to enforce immediate natural-index succession without gaps."
msgstr "用于强制自然数索引直接连续、没有空缺。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionFoldIndexLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid treating a stored current index as the result binding of termSum; its result-first output must be fresh."
msgstr "避免将存储的当前索引视为 termSum 的结果绑定；其结果优先输出必须是全新变量。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionFoldIndexLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Bind both stored indices, use result-first termSum with a fresh result variable and compare that result with the already-bound current index."
msgstr "绑定两个存储索引，使用结果优先 termSum 绑定全新结果变量，并将该结果与已绑定当前索引比较。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionFoldIndexLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "This is declared mathematical control structure, not a source-native class ordinal or serialized execution trace."
msgstr "这是声明的数学控制结构，不是来源原生类别序号或序列化执行轨迹。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionFoldIndexLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped example: A fictional step at index two cannot directly follow the base at index zero."
msgstr "虚构的局部示例：索引为二的虚构步骤不能直接以前驱索引为零的基步相接。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionFoldRecurrenceLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "weighted fusion fold recurrence law"
msgstr "加权融合折叠递推定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionFoldRecurrenceLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Each declared step total equals its preceding total plus the exact decimal magnitude of its added contribution."
msgstr "每个声明步骤总和等于其前一总和加上所加贡献的精确十进制量值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionFoldRecurrenceLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to enforce the actual finite reported-decimal recurrence."
msgstr "用于强制实际的有限报告十进制递推关系。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionFoldRecurrenceLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid adding scalar shadow totals, rebinding an existing total variable or claiming native floor-division parity."
msgstr "避免添加影子标量总和、重新绑定现有总和变量，或声称与原生向下取整除法相符。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionFoldRecurrenceLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Bind stored previous-total, component and current-total magnitudes before result-first termSum binds a fresh result; compare that result with the current stored magnitude."
msgstr "在结果优先 termSum 绑定全新结果前，绑定存储的前一总和、组件及当前总和量值；将该结果与当前存储量值比较。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionFoldRecurrenceLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Quantity context follows the owning score. The ordinary addition signature is reused without a new intrinsic or generic arithmetic framework."
msgstr "Quantity 上下文由所属分数确定。复用普通加法签名，不引入新内在算子或通用算术框架。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionFoldRecurrenceLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped example: Fictional equal components of decimal 0.01 yield successive totals 0.01 and 0.02 from a zero base."
msgstr "虚构的局部示例：两个值均为十进制 0.01 的虚构组件，从零基步产生依次为 0.01 和 0.02 的总和。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionFoldIndexUniquenessLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "weighted fusion fold index uniqueness law"
msgstr "加权融合折叠索引唯一性定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionFoldIndexUniquenessLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "No two declared steps of one applied score have the same numeric natural index."
msgstr "一个已应用分数的任意两个声明步骤都不能具有相同数值的自然数索引。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionFoldIndexUniquenessLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to keep the finite witness unambiguous."
msgstr "用于使有限见证保持无歧义。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionFoldIndexUniquenessLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid treating different lexical spellings of the same numeric index as different positions."
msgstr "避免将相同数值索引的不同词法拼写视为不同位置。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionFoldIndexUniquenessLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Bind both stored indices independently, compare their numeric values and require identical step resources when equal."
msgstr "分别绑定两个存储索引，比较其数值；相等时要求步骤资源相同。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionFoldIndexUniquenessLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Indices are scoped to one score; separate score witnesses may use the same natural indices."
msgstr "索引以单个分数为作用域；不同分数见证可以使用相同自然数索引。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionFoldIndexUniquenessLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped example: Two fictional step resources with the same numeric index in one fold fail uniqueness."
msgstr "虚构的局部示例：同一折叠中具有相同数值索引的两个虚构步骤资源不符合唯一性要求。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionFoldFinalLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "weighted fusion fold final law"
msgstr "加权融合折叠最终步骤定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionFoldFinalLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The final declared step belongs to the score fold, bounds every step index and has a decimal total equal to the reported score value."
msgstr "最终声明步骤属于分数折叠、界定每个步骤索引，且其十进制总和等于报告分数值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionFoldFinalLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to close the complete finite witness against the reported magnitude."
msgstr "用于使完整有限见证与报告量值闭合。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionFoldFinalLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid leaving extra steps above the final index or forcing final-total and reported-score resource identity."
msgstr "避免在最终索引以上保留额外步骤，或强制最终总和与报告分数具有相同资源身份。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionFoldFinalLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Require final membership, compare every member index with the final index and compare the stored final Quantity value with the inherited score value."
msgstr "要求最终步骤为成员，将每个成员索引与最终索引比较，并比较存储的最终 Quantity 值与继承的分数值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionFoldFinalLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The foundation bounds the score. Nonnegative recurrence therefore bounds all owned partial sums without a separate range law."
msgstr "基础界定分数。因此非负递推关系界定所有所属部分和，无需独立范围定律。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionFoldFinalLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped example: A fictional reported score of decimal 0.03 fails when its complete final witness total is decimal 0.02."
msgstr "虚构的局部示例：完整最终见证总和为十进制 0.02 时，报告分数为十进制 0.03 的虚构记录不符合要求。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionFoldContributionAccountLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "weighted fusion fold contribution account law"
msgstr "加权融合折叠贡献记录定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionFoldContributionAccountLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The declared fold uses every actual score contribution in exactly one positive step and no unrelated contribution."
msgstr "声明折叠在正索引步骤中恰好使用每个实际分数贡献一次，且不使用无关贡献。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionFoldContributionAccountLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to preserve complete contribution multiplicity in finite summation."
msgstr "用于在有限求和中保留完整的贡献重数。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionFoldContributionAccountLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid using SUM DISTINCT semantics, skipping zeros or counting equal-valued components only once."
msgstr "避免采用 SUM DISTINCT 语义、跳过零，或只计入相等值组件一次。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionFoldContributionAccountLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Require a positive step for every score contribution, reverse membership for every step contribution and step identity for repeated use of one component."
msgstr "要求每个分数贡献对应一个正索引步骤、每个步骤贡献反向属于该分数，并要求复用同一组件的步骤具有相同身份。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionFoldContributionAccountLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The base has no contribution and positive steps have one. Together with index and final laws this is a complete finite bijection."
msgstr "基步没有贡献，正索引步骤有一个贡献。与索引及最终步骤定律共同形成完整有限双射。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionFoldContributionAccountLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped example: Two fictional equal-valued contributions require two positive steps, while one contribution cannot be added twice."
msgstr "虚构的局部示例：两个相等值的虚构贡献需要两个正索引步骤；一个贡献不能被累加两次。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionPartialSumContextLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "weighted fusion partial sum context law"
msgstr "加权融合部分和上下文定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionPartialSumContextLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Every partial-total Quantity linked by an owned step has the exact frame of its owning applied score."
msgstr "由所属步骤关联的每个部分总和 Quantity，具有与所属已应用分数完全相同的参照系。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionPartialSumContextLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to carry the selected quantitative context onto derived mathematical witnesses."
msgstr "用于将所选定量上下文传递给派生数学见证。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionPartialSumContextLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid adding reportedFusionScoreProfile merely for witness context, inferring reporting from witness use alone or treating equal values as frame equivalence."
msgstr "避免仅为见证上下文而添加 reportedFusionScoreProfile、仅从见证用途推断报告，或将相等值视为参照系等价。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionPartialSumContextLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Follow the application, applied score and owned step to its total, bind both frames and compare the resources."
msgstr "通过应用、已应用分数及所属步骤追踪到总和，绑定两个参照系并比较其资源。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionPartialSumContextLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Explicit dimensionless dimension is local to QueryWeightedPartialSum. Its profile context follows the score and application without deriving a source-reported profile edge from witness use."
msgstr "在 QueryWeightedPartialSum 上局部明确要求无量纲量纲。其配置上下文由分数及应用确定，而不从见证用途推导来源报告配置链接。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionPartialSumContextLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped example: A fictional shared total can serve compatible steps with the same frame, but fails when one owning score has a different frame."
msgstr "虚构的局部示例：虚构的共享总和可供参照系相同的兼容步骤使用，但当某个所属分数具有不同参照系时不符合要求。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionCoefficientOwnerPresenceLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "weighted fusion coefficient owner presence law"
msgstr "加权融合系数所有者存在定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionCoefficientOwnerPresenceLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Every typed applied coefficient has at least one typed incoming weighted application owner."
msgstr "每个具有已应用系数类型的资源至少有一个具有类型的传入加权应用所有者。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionCoefficientOwnerPresenceLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to prevent context-free applied coefficient records without forbidding compatible sharing."
msgstr "用于防止已应用系数记录脱离上下文，同时不禁止兼容共享。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionCoefficientOwnerPresenceLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid imposing unique inverse coefficient ownership or accepting an isolated applied carrier."
msgstr "避免施加逆向唯一系数所有权，或接受孤立的已应用载体。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionCoefficientOwnerPresenceLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Require an incoming weightedFusionCoefficient edge from a typed reported application."
msgstr "要求从具有类型的报告应用传入 weightedFusionCoefficient 链接。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionCoefficientOwnerPresenceLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Every owning application separately enforces class, ordinal, mode, fit and frame compatibility; sharing does not merge applications."
msgstr "每个所属应用分别强制类别、序号、模式、拟合及参照系兼容性；共享不会合并应用。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionCoefficientOwnerPresenceLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped example: A fictional fully coordinated coefficient with no application owner fails this applied-account contract."
msgstr "虚构的局部示例：没有应用所有者的虚构系数，即使坐标完整，也不符合此已应用记录契约。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionPartialSumOwnerPresenceLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "weighted fusion partial sum owner presence law"
msgstr "加权融合部分和所有者存在定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionPartialSumOwnerPresenceLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Every typed partial-sum Quantity has at least one typed incoming declared fold step."
msgstr "每个具有部分和 Quantity 类型的资源至少有一个具有类型的传入声明折叠步骤。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionPartialSumOwnerPresenceLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to keep derived sum carriers within actual declared witness accounts."
msgstr "用于将派生求和载体保留在实际声明见证记录内。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionPartialSumOwnerPresenceLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid imposing unique inverse total ownership or inferring source reporting solely from the witness role."
msgstr "避免施加逆向唯一总和所有权，或仅根据见证角色推断来源报告。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionPartialSumOwnerPresenceLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Require weightedStepTotal from a typed QueryWeightedScoreFoldStep; that step separately requires its unique score owner."
msgstr "要求从具有类型的 QueryWeightedScoreFoldStep 传入 weightedStepTotal；该步骤另行要求唯一分数所有者。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionPartialSumOwnerPresenceLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Compatible control steps may share the same total Quantity. No artificial disjointness from other compatible Quantity roles is imposed."
msgstr "兼容控制步骤可共享同一个总和 Quantity。不施加其与其他兼容 Quantity 角色之间的人为不相交性。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WeightedFusionPartialSumOwnerPresenceLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped example: A fictional total Quantity shared by two compatible steps is permitted; an isolated typed partial sum fails."
msgstr "虚构的局部示例：两个兼容步骤共享一个虚构总和 Quantity 是允许的；孤立的类型化部分和不符合要求。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryFusionActivationAccount|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Query Fusion Activation Account"
msgstr "查询融合激活报告"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryFusionActivationAccount|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A complete reported activation and call-start snapshot account for one actual weighted-fusion application, retaining actual selection, the nonempty selected-vault roster and every original candidate’s found-vault scope."
msgstr "针对一个实际加权融合应用的完整已报告激活及调用开始快照记录，保留实际选择、非空所选库清单及每个原始候选项的发现库作用域。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryFusionActivationAccount|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to associate actual reported activation evidence with the existing weighted application and answer without inventing another source call."
msgstr "用于将实际报告的激活证据关联至现有加权应用及答案，不虚构另一次来源调用。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryFusionActivationAccount|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid importing an incomplete roster as empty, reconstructing it from read versions or treating wire snapshot absence as proof that a live vault had no first snapshot."
msgstr "避免将不完整清单作为空清单导入、从读取版本重建清单，或将传输中的快照缺失视为存活库没有首次快照的证明。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryFusionActivationAccount|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Link from the existing application through fusionActivationAccount; supply activationEnabled, the complete nonempty activationVaultRecord collection and one activationCandidateRecord per original applied score."
msgstr "从现有应用通过 fusionActivationAccount 关联；提供 activationEnabled、完整非空 activationVaultRecord 集合，并为每个原始应用分数提供一个 activationCandidateRecord。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryFusionActivationAccount|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The same captured snapshot list feeds native scoring and the returned union. Explicit first-snapshot absence requires actual live-at-capture and absence-reason evidence; missing proof fails this selected import. A successful empty candidate union still has a nonempty roster."
msgstr "同一个捕获快照列表用于原生评分及返回并集。显式首次快照缺失要求实际捕获时存活及缺失原因证据；缺失证明使此所选导入失败。成功空候选并集仍具有非空清单。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryFusionActivationAccount|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped fragment: ex:call gmeow:fusionActivationAccount ex:account . The existing application, its original answer and the complete account bindings are omitted."
msgstr "虚构限定片段：ex:call gmeow:fusionActivationAccount ex:account . 现有应用、其原始答案及完整报告绑定均省略。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryCandidateActivationRecord|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Query Candidate Activation Record"
msgstr "查询候选激活记录"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryCandidateActivationRecord|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A descriptive record for one original applied score’s nonempty actual found-vault scope and its aggregate activation Quantity exactly when the actual application selected activation."
msgstr "描述一个原始应用分数的非空实际发现库作用域的记录，且当且仅当实际应用选择激活时具有聚合激活 Quantity。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryCandidateActivationRecord|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain the candidate-specific aggregation scope independently of the whole selected-call snapshot roster."
msgstr "用于保留候选专属聚合作用域，与整个所选调用快照清单分开。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryCandidateActivationRecord|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid duplicating the original candidate identity, inventing per-vault activation components or treating a disabled wire zero as measured data."
msgstr "避免重复原始候选身份、虚构逐库激活组件，或将禁用时传输的零视为测得数据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryCandidateActivationRecord|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Supply activationAppliedScore and the complete nonempty activationFoundVault collection; supply reportedActivationValue exactly when the owner account’s activationEnabled is true."
msgstr "提供 activationAppliedScore 及完整非空 activationFoundVault 集合；当且仅当所属报告的 activationEnabled 为 true 时提供 reportedActivationValue。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryCandidateActivationRecord|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Each record has exactly one account owner, and its score belongs to that account’s existing application. The original candidate follows appliedScoreCandidate. Record identity is descriptive graph identity, not a native serialized identifier."
msgstr "每个记录恰好有一个所属报告，其分数属于该报告现有应用。原始候选项由 appliedScoreCandidate 确定。记录身份是描述性图身份，不是原生序列化标识符。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryCandidateActivationRecord|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped fragment: ex:row a gmeow:QueryCandidateActivationRecord ; gmeow:activationAppliedScore ex:score ; gmeow:activationFoundVault ex:vaultRecord . The owner and any enabled reported value are omitted."
msgstr "虚构限定片段：ex:row a gmeow:QueryCandidateActivationRecord ; gmeow:activationAppliedScore ex:score ; gmeow:activationFoundVault ex:vaultRecord . 所属者及启用时的任何已报告值均省略。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryVaultSnapshotRecord|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Query Vault Snapshot Record"
msgstr "查询库快照记录"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryVaultSnapshotRecord|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "One actual selected-call vault’s reported call-start snapshot state, retaining its supplied vault identity and either a present snapshot identity with held count or evidenced live-at-capture first-snapshot absence."
msgstr "一个实际调用所选库报告的调用开始快照状态，保留所提供库身份，以及存在的快照身份和保有计数，或有证据表明捕获时存活而缺失首次快照。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryVaultSnapshotRecord|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to preserve every selected vault, including vaults outside a particular candidate’s found-vault subset."
msgstr "用于保留每个所选库，包括特定候选发现库子集之外的库。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryVaultSnapshotRecord|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid interpreting raw wire None, a retired service, a budget-skipped read or a later current read as sufficient first-snapshot-absence evidence."
msgstr "避免将原始传输值 None、已退役服务、因预算跳过的读取或稍后的当前读取，理解为充分的首次快照缺失证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryVaultSnapshotRecord|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Supply activationVaultIdentity and activationSnapshotPresent; true requires activationSnapshotIdentity and activationSnapshotHeld, while qualified false forbids both."
msgstr "提供 activationVaultIdentity 及 activationSnapshotPresent；true 要求 activationSnapshotIdentity 及 activationSnapshotHeld，而具备限定依据的 false 禁止两者。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryVaultSnapshotRecord|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Each typed record has one account owner and is unique there by decoded vault bytes. False requires actual capture liveness and absence-reason evidence; unavailable evidence fails import. Present held count zero remains present."
msgstr "每个类型化记录有一个所属报告，在该报告内按解码库字节唯一。false 要求实际捕获时存活及缺失原因证据；证据不可用导致导入失败。存在的保有计数为零仍表示存在。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryVaultSnapshotRecord|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped fragment: ex:vaultRecord a gmeow:QueryVaultSnapshotRecord ; gmeow:activationSnapshotPresent false . The required vault identity, owner and actual live-at-capture absence evidence are omitted."
msgstr "虚构限定片段：ex:vaultRecord a gmeow:QueryVaultSnapshotRecord ; gmeow:activationSnapshotPresent false . 必需库身份、所属者，以及服务在实际捕获时仍存活且缺失首次快照的证据均省略。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryReportedActivation|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Query Reported Activation"
msgstr "查询已报告激活"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryReportedActivation|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "An enabled source-reported aggregate activation ranking-signal Quantity with an unsigned-long magnitude, explicit dimension and complete applicable reference frame."
msgstr "激活已启用时由来源报告的聚合激活排名信号 Quantity，具有无符号长整数量值、显式量纲及完整适用参照系。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryReportedActivation|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use for the actual aggregate returned for a candidate when activation was selected, including a genuinely reported zero."
msgstr "用于选择激活时为候选项实际返回的聚合值，包括真实报告的零。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryReportedActivation|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid treating disabled wire zero as an observation, using a confidence or probability interpretation, or certifying native saturation from the reported aggregate."
msgstr "避免将禁用时传输的零视为观察、采用置信度或概率解释，或从报告聚合值认证原生饱和算术。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryReportedActivation|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Supply math:quantityValue typed xsd:unsignedLong, math:hasDimension and hasReferenceFrame, and link through reportedActivationValue from an owned candidate record."
msgstr "提供 xsd:unsignedLong 类型的 math:quantityValue、math:hasDimension 及 hasReferenceFrame，并从具有所属者的候选记录通过 reportedActivationValue 关联。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryReportedActivation|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Values within one account share the exact dimension and frame resources. The API supplies neither mathematical context object; source or adapter justification is required. Compatible sharing is legal, and neither the fusion-score nor held-count frame is imposed."
msgstr "同一报告内的值共享完全相同的量纲及参照系资源。API 不提供这两个数学上下文对象；要求来源或适配器依据。允许相容共享，不施加融合分数或保有计数的参照系。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryReportedActivation|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped fragment: ex:activation a gmeow:QueryReportedActivation ; math:quantityValue \"0\"^^xsd:unsignedLong . Its actual enabled source context, dimension, complete frame and incoming record are omitted."
msgstr "虚构限定片段：ex:activation a gmeow:QueryReportedActivation ; math:quantityValue \"0\"^^xsd:unsignedLong . 其实际启用来源上下文、量纲、完整参照系及入向记录均省略。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QuerySnapshotHeldCount|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Query Snapshot Held Count"
msgstr "查询快照保有激活计数"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QuerySnapshotHeldCount|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "An actual present activation snapshot’s held-activation count Quantity with an unsigned-long magnitude, explicit dimension and complete applicable reference frame."
msgstr "实际存在的激活快照所具有的保有激活计数 Quantity，具有无符号长整数量值、显式量纲及完整适用参照系。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QuerySnapshotHeldCount|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain the actual held count paired with a supplied present snapshot identity."
msgstr "用于保留与所提供存在快照身份配对的实际保有计数。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QuerySnapshotHeldCount|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid treating held count as a candidate activation component, graph watermark, timestamp, candidate cardinality or confidence guarantee."
msgstr "避免将保有计数视为候选激活组件、图水位标记、时间戳、候选基数或置信度保证。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QuerySnapshotHeldCount|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Supply math:quantityValue typed xsd:unsignedLong, math:hasDimension and hasReferenceFrame; reference the Quantity through activationSnapshotHeld from a present owned snapshot record."
msgstr "提供 xsd:unsignedLong 类型的 math:quantityValue、math:hasDimension 及 hasReferenceFrame；从存在且具有所属者的快照记录通过 activationSnapshotHeld 引用该 Quantity。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QuerySnapshotHeldCount|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Zero is legal when actually supplied for a present snapshot. Compatible records may share a coordinated count Quantity. Its interpretation is justified independently of aggregate activation and fusion scores; no cross-vault held-count comparison or common frame is imposed."
msgstr "确为存在快照提供的零合法。相容记录可以共享完整协调的计数 Quantity。其解释独立于聚合激活及融合分数而获得依据；不施加跨库保有计数比较或共同参照系。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QuerySnapshotHeldCount|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped fragment: ex:held a gmeow:QuerySnapshotHeldCount ; math:quantityValue \"0\"^^xsd:unsignedLong . The present snapshot record, dimension and complete applicable frame are omitted."
msgstr "虚构限定片段：ex:held a gmeow:QuerySnapshotHeldCount ; math:quantityValue \"0\"^^xsd:unsignedLong . 存在快照记录、量纲及完整适用参照系均省略。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fusionActivationAccount|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "fusion activation account"
msgstr "融合激活报告"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fusionActivationAccount|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The at-most-one complete reported activation and snapshot account selected on an existing actual weighted-fusion application."
msgstr "在现有实际加权融合应用上选择的、至多一个完整已报告激活及快照记录。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fusionActivationAccount|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to enrich the same application and answer that already retain weighted scores and original evidence."
msgstr "用于丰富已保留加权分数及原始证据的同一个应用和答案。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fusionActivationAccount|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid creating a second execution or native answer merely to describe activation or later applied order."
msgstr "避免仅为描述激活或后续已应用顺序就创建第二次执行或原生答案。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fusionActivationAccount|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Reference a complete QueryFusionActivationAccount on the actual QueryWeightedFusionApplication."
msgstr "在实际 QueryWeightedFusionApplication 上引用完整 QueryFusionActivationAccount。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fusionActivationAccount|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Existing applications need not select this account. Once selected, every account obligation is mandatory; partial evidence cannot populate a weaker success branch."
msgstr "现有应用无需选择此报告。一经选择，每项报告义务都必需；部分证据不能填入较弱的成功分支。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fusionActivationAccount|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped fragment: ex:call gmeow:fusionActivationAccount ex:account . Other required account bindings and source admission evidence are omitted."
msgstr "虚构限定片段：ex:call gmeow:fusionActivationAccount ex:account . 其他必需报告绑定及来源接纳证据均省略。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/activationEnabled|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "activation selected"
msgstr "激活选择"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/activationEnabled|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The required typed Boolean retaining whether the actual source call selected activation as a comparison key."
msgstr "必需的类型化布尔值，保留实际来源调用是否选择激活作为比较键。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/activationEnabled|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to distinguish actual selected aggregate observations from the source’s inactive constant-zero branch."
msgstr "用于将实际所选聚合观察与来源未激活的恒零分支区分开来。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/activationEnabled|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring selection from an aggregate value, a digest alone or missing source input."
msgstr "避免从聚合值、仅有摘要或缺失来源输入推断选择。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/activationEnabled|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Supply the actual call-input xsd:boolean; true requires each candidate record’s reported aggregate and false forbids that Quantity edge."
msgstr "提供实际调用输入的 xsd:boolean；true 要求每个候选记录的已报告聚合值，false 禁止该 Quantity 边。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/activationEnabled|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Legal Boolean lexical variants compare by value. The future applied-policy account must agree with this actual selection; disabling activation does not remove the source snapshot roster."
msgstr "合法布尔词法变体按值比较。后续已应用策略报告必须与此实际选择一致；禁用激活不移除来源快照清单。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/activationEnabled|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped fragment: ex:account gmeow:activationEnabled false . Other required account bindings and source admission evidence are omitted."
msgstr "虚构限定片段：ex:account gmeow:activationEnabled false . 其他必需报告绑定及来源接纳证据均省略。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/activationCandidateRecord|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "activation candidate record"
msgstr "激活候选记录"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/activationCandidateRecord|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A member of the complete original-applied-score-indexed candidate record collection of a selected activation account."
msgstr "所选激活报告中按原始应用分数索引的完整候选记录集合的一个成员。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/activationCandidateRecord|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain exactly one activation record for every original applied score and no unrelated score."
msgstr "用于为每个原始应用分数恰好保留一个激活记录，不保留无关分数。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/activationCandidateRecord|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid omitting candidates, sharing one record across accounts or confusing an empty original union with an empty vault roster."
msgstr "避免遗漏候选项、跨报告共享一个记录，或将空原始并集与空库清单混淆。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/activationCandidateRecord|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Reference every QueryCandidateActivationRecord and retain its actual applied score and nonempty found-vault scope."
msgstr "引用每个 QueryCandidateActivationRecord，并保留其实际应用分数及非空发现库作用域。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/activationCandidateRecord|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "This collection is empty exactly when the existing application’s score collection is empty. Original query, candidate and loss identities remain governed by the weighted account."
msgstr "当且仅当现有应用分数集合为空时，此集合为空。原始查询、候选及损失身份仍由加权记录约束。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/activationCandidateRecord|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped fragment: ex:account gmeow:activationCandidateRecord ex:row . Other required account bindings and source admission evidence are omitted."
msgstr "虚构限定片段：ex:account gmeow:activationCandidateRecord ex:row . 其他必需报告绑定及来源接纳证据均省略。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/activationVaultRecord|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "activation selected-vault record"
msgstr "激活所选库记录"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/activationVaultRecord|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A member of the complete nonempty actual selected-call vault roster captured at call start for an activation account."
msgstr "激活报告中在调用开始时捕获的实际调用所选库完整非空清单的一个成员。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/activationVaultRecord|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to preserve selected vaults even when no candidate was found there or a budget prevented their later read."
msgstr "用于保留所选库，即使未在其中发现候选项，或预算阻止了其后续读取。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/activationVaultRecord|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid reconstructing this roster from read versions, dropping unavailable records or accepting an empty selected-call roster."
msgstr "避免从读取版本重建此清单、丢弃不可用记录，或接受空调用所选库清单。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/activationVaultRecord|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Reference every actual QueryVaultSnapshotRecord from the same captured list used for scoring and the returned union."
msgstr "从用于评分及返回并集的同一捕获列表引用每个实际 QueryVaultSnapshotRecord。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/activationVaultRecord|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Every selected account has at least one roster member. Candidate found-vault membership is a separate nonempty subset, not the entire roster. Ambiguous capture absence blocks this complete import."
msgstr "每个所选报告的清单至少有一个成员。候选发现库成员关系是独立非空子集，不是整个清单。捕获缺失含义不明会阻止此完整导入。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/activationVaultRecord|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped fragment: ex:account gmeow:activationVaultRecord ex:vaultA, ex:vaultB . Other required account bindings and source admission evidence are omitted."
msgstr "虚构限定片段：ex:account gmeow:activationVaultRecord ex:vaultA, ex:vaultB . 其他必需报告绑定及来源接纳证据均省略。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/activationAppliedScore|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "activation original applied score"
msgstr "激活原始应用分数"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/activationAppliedScore|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The one existing original applied-score resource selected by a candidate activation record."
msgstr "候选激活记录选择的单个现有原始应用分数资源。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/activationAppliedScore|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to recover the original candidate through the score’s existing appliedScoreCandidate link."
msgstr "用于通过分数现有 appliedScoreCandidate 链接恢复原始候选项。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/activationAppliedScore|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid copying candidate identities into a parallel coordinate or selecting a score from another application."
msgstr "避免将候选身份复制到并行坐标，或从其他应用选择分数。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/activationAppliedScore|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Reference a QueryAppliedFusionScore retained by the existing application that owns the activation account."
msgstr "引用所属激活报告的现有应用保留的 QueryAppliedFusionScore。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/activationAppliedScore|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Within one account, records selecting the same score are identical. Separate calls retain their existing separate score occurrences."
msgstr "同一报告内选择相同分数的记录相同。不同调用保留其现有独立分数出现项。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/activationAppliedScore|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped fragment: ex:row gmeow:activationAppliedScore ex:score . Other required account bindings and source admission evidence are omitted."
msgstr "虚构限定片段：ex:row gmeow:activationAppliedScore ex:score . 其他必需报告绑定及来源接纳证据均省略。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/activationFoundVault|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "activation candidate-found vault"
msgstr "激活候选发现库"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/activationFoundVault|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A member of the candidate’s complete nonempty actual found-vault set, referencing the same account’s selected-call snapshot roster."
msgstr "候选项完整非空实际发现库集的一个成员，引用同一报告的调用所选快照清单。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/activationFoundVault|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to preserve exactly the original candidate-found scope used by native aggregate activation."
msgstr "用于恰好保留原生聚合激活所用的原始候选发现作用域。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/activationFoundVault|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid including other selected roster vaults merely because they have snapshots or accepting an unavailable or empty found-vault collection."
msgstr "避免仅因其他所选清单库具有快照就纳入它们，或接受不可用或空发现库集合。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/activationFoundVault|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Reference the owning account’s roster records matching every actual original Candidate.vaults identity."
msgstr "引用所属报告中与每个实际原始 Candidate.vaults 身份相符的清单记录。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/activationFoundVault|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Each candidate has at least one found vault. Equality with the supplied original native set is an import obligation; graph membership laws cannot reconstruct unavailable external candidate evidence."
msgstr "每个候选项至少有一个发现库。与所提供原始原生集合精确相等是导入义务；图成员关系定律不能重建不可用的外部候选证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/activationFoundVault|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped fragment: ex:row gmeow:activationFoundVault ex:vaultA . Other required account bindings and source admission evidence are omitted."
msgstr "虚构限定片段：ex:row gmeow:activationFoundVault ex:vaultA . 其他必需报告绑定及来源接纳证据均省略。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/reportedActivationValue|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "reported aggregate activation value"
msgstr "已报告聚合激活值"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/reportedActivationValue|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The at-most-one actual reported aggregate activation Quantity of a candidate record, required exactly when its account selected activation."
msgstr "候选记录至多一个实际已报告聚合激活 Quantity，当且仅当其报告选择激活时必需。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/reportedActivationValue|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain a true reported zero or positive aggregate without claiming component recomputation."
msgstr "用于保留真实报告的零或正聚合值，不声称重算了组件。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/reportedActivationValue|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid writing the disabled source constant zero as a measured Quantity or summing snapshot held counts as candidate activation."
msgstr "避免将禁用来源恒零写作测得 Quantity，或将快照保有计数之和视为候选激活。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/reportedActivationValue|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Reference one fully coordinated QueryReportedActivation when activationEnabled is true; omit this edge when false."
msgstr "当 activationEnabled 为 true 时引用一个完整协调的 QueryReportedActivation；为 false 时省略此边。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/reportedActivationValue|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "All found vaults with qualified first-snapshot absence imply numeric zero. The converse is false: a real present snapshot may estimate zero. Per-vault candidate components are not exported by the inspected public Fused result."
msgstr "所有发现库均具有具备限定依据的首次快照缺失时，蕴含数值零。反向不成立：实际存在的快照可估计为零。所检查公共 Fused 结果不导出逐库候选组件。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/reportedActivationValue|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped fragment: ex:row gmeow:reportedActivationValue ex:activation . Other required account bindings and source admission evidence are omitted."
msgstr "虚构限定片段：ex:row gmeow:reportedActivationValue ex:activation . 其他必需报告绑定及来源接纳证据均省略。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/activationVaultIdentity|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "activation vault identity"
msgstr "激活库身份"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/activationVaultIdentity|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The required supplied sixteen-byte native vault identity on one selected-call snapshot record, represented as an unspaced either-case hexBinary literal."
msgstr "单个调用所选快照记录上必需的所提供 16 字节原生库身份，表示为无空格、大小写均可的 hexBinary 字面量。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/activationVaultIdentity|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to associate actual candidate-found vaults and the complete source snapshot roster by their supplied bytes."
msgstr "用于按所提供字节关联实际候选发现库及完整来源快照清单。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/activationVaultIdentity|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid treating VaultId as a UUID or thirty-two-byte digest, fabricating an IRI or recomputing a source construction hash."
msgstr "避免将 VaultId 视为 UUID 或 32 字节摘要、虚构 IRI 或重算来源构造哈希。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/activationVaultIdentity|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Supply xsd:hexBinary with exactly thirty-two hex digits matching ^[0-9A-Fa-f]{32}$."
msgstr "提供恰好具有 32 个十六进制数字、匹配 ^[0-9A-Fa-f]{32}$ 的 xsd:hexBinary。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/activationVaultIdentity|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The explicit lexical profile is not XSD-canonical normalization. Opposite-case spellings compare by decoded binary value and cannot identify distinct records in one account. Regex dialect projection residue remains explicit."
msgstr "显式词法配置不是 XSD 规范化。大小写相反的拼写按解码二进制值比较，不能在同一报告内标识不同记录。正则表达式方言投影残差仍显式保留。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/activationVaultIdentity|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped fragment: ex:vaultRecord gmeow:activationVaultIdentity \"00112233445566778899aAbBcCdDeEfF\"^^xsd:hexBinary . The bytes are fictional and are not an authenticated native identity."
msgstr "虚构限定片段：ex:vaultRecord gmeow:activationVaultIdentity \"00112233445566778899aAbBcCdDeEfF\"^^xsd:hexBinary . 字节为虚构，不是经过认证的原生身份。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/activationSnapshotPresent|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "activation snapshot present"
msgstr "激活快照存在"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/activationSnapshotPresent|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The required typed Boolean selecting actual snapshot presence or evidenced absence of a first snapshot in a live service at the original capture."
msgstr "必需的类型化布尔值，选择实际快照存在，或有证据表明原始捕获时存活服务缺失首次快照。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/activationSnapshotPresent|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to distinguish a present snapshot, including a zero held count, from qualified first-snapshot absence."
msgstr "用于将存在快照（包括保有计数为零）与具备限定依据的首次快照缺失区分开来。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/activationSnapshotPresent|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid selecting false from raw wire None, retirement, a skipped read, unavailable liveness evidence or a later current read."
msgstr "避免从原始传输值 None、退役、跳过读取、不可用存活证据或稍后当前读取选择 false。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/activationSnapshotPresent|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Supply true with actual snapshot identity and held Quantity; supply false only with actual live-at-capture association and absence-reason evidence, and neither conditional edge."
msgstr "提供 true 时附实际快照身份及保有计数 Quantity；仅在具有实际捕获时存活关联及缺失原因证据时提供 false，并不提供两条条件边。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/activationSnapshotPresent|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The public Option may be absent because the service was retired. Even a successful budget-cut union cannot establish the absence reason. Missing required proof fails this complete import rather than becoming false or zero."
msgstr "公共 Option 可能因服务退役而缺失。即使预算截断并集成功，也不能确立缺失原因。必需证明缺失使此完整导入失败，而不是变为 false 或零。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/activationSnapshotPresent|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped fragment: ex:vaultRecord gmeow:activationSnapshotPresent false . Other required account bindings and source admission evidence are omitted."
msgstr "虚构限定片段：ex:vaultRecord gmeow:activationSnapshotPresent false . 其他必需报告绑定及来源接纳证据均省略。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/activationSnapshotIdentity|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "activation snapshot identity"
msgstr "激活快照身份"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/activationSnapshotIdentity|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The supplied thirty-two-byte identity of the actual present call-start snapshot, represented as an unspaced either-case hexBinary literal."
msgstr "实际存在的调用开始快照所提供的 32 字节身份，表示为无空格、大小写均可的 hexBinary 字面量。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/activationSnapshotIdentity|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain the exact supplied snapshot bytes alongside that snapshot’s actual held count."
msgstr "用于连同该快照实际保有计数保留其确切所提供快照字节。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/activationSnapshotIdentity|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid fabricating a digest, converting a later current snapshot into historical evidence or populating this edge on qualified absence."
msgstr "避免虚构摘要、将稍后当前快照转作历史证据，或在具备限定依据的缺失情况下填入此边。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/activationSnapshotIdentity|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Supply xsd:hexBinary with exactly sixty-four hex digits matching ^[0-9A-Fa-f]{64}$ when activationSnapshotPresent is true."
msgstr "当 activationSnapshotPresent 为 true 时，提供恰好具有 64 个十六进制数字、匹配 ^[0-9A-Fa-f]{64}$ 的 xsd:hexBinary。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/activationSnapshotIdentity|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The edge is required for presence and forbidden for absence. Width and lexical-profile checks do not authenticate contents or prove native hashing; regex dialect residue remains explicit."
msgstr "存在时此边必需，缺失时禁止。宽度及词法配置检查不认证内容，也不证明原生哈希；正则表达式方言残差仍显式保留。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/activationSnapshotIdentity|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped fragment: ex:vaultRecord gmeow:activationSnapshotIdentity \"00112233445566778899aAbBcCdDeEfF00112233445566778899aAbBcCdDeEfF\"^^xsd:hexBinary . The bytes are fictional and are not an authenticated native identity."
msgstr "虚构限定片段：ex:vaultRecord gmeow:activationSnapshotIdentity \"00112233445566778899aAbBcCdDeEfF00112233445566778899aAbBcCdDeEfF\"^^xsd:hexBinary . 字节为虚构，不是经过认证的原生身份。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/activationSnapshotHeld|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "activation snapshot held count"
msgstr "激活快照保有计数"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/activationSnapshotHeld|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The one actual held-count Quantity paired with a present activation snapshot, absent on qualified first-snapshot absence."
msgstr "与存在激活快照配对的单个实际保有计数 Quantity，在具备限定依据的首次快照缺失时不存在。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/activationSnapshotHeld|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain the source’s supplied count without confusing it with a per-candidate activation estimate."
msgstr "用于保留来源提供的计数，不与逐候选激活估计混淆。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/activationSnapshotHeld|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid populating a default zero for absent or unavailable snapshots, or comparing this count with candidate cardinality."
msgstr "避免为缺失或不可用快照填入默认零，或将此计数与候选基数比较。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/activationSnapshotHeld|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Reference a fully coordinated QuerySnapshotHeldCount exactly when activationSnapshotPresent is true."
msgstr "当且仅当 activationSnapshotPresent 为 true 时，引用完整协调的 QuerySnapshotHeldCount。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/activationSnapshotHeld|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "An actual present count can be zero. Compatible sharing is permitted; supplied count interpretation and frame are independent of aggregate activation and fusion-score frames."
msgstr "实际存在的计数可以为零。允许相容共享；所提供计数的解释及参照系独立于聚合激活及融合分数参照系。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/activationSnapshotHeld|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped fragment: ex:vaultRecord gmeow:activationSnapshotHeld ex:held . Other required account bindings and source admission evidence are omitted."
msgstr "虚构限定片段：ex:vaultRecord gmeow:activationSnapshotHeld ex:held . 其他必需报告绑定及来源接纳证据均省略。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionActivationAccountOwnerLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "fusion activation account owner law"
msgstr "融合激活报告归属定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionActivationAccountOwnerLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Every typed activation account has exactly one incoming typed existing weighted application owner."
msgstr "每个类型化激活报告恰好具有一个入向类型化现有加权应用所属者。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionActivationAccountOwnerLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to bind each complete reported account to one actual source occurrence."
msgstr "用于将每个完整已报告记录绑定至一个实际来源出现项。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionActivationAccountOwnerLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid accepting isolated accounts or treating inverse ownership as source authentication."
msgstr "避免接受孤立报告，或将逆向归属视为来源认证。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionActivationAccountOwnerLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Require a typed incoming weighted application and compare any two such owners by resource equality."
msgstr "要求类型化入向加权应用，并按资源相等比较任意两个此类所属者。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionActivationAccountOwnerLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The application’s at-most-one selected account is a separate local maximum. Existing answer and weighted-score ownership remain unchanged."
msgstr "应用至多选择一个报告由独立局部最大基数约束。现有答案及加权分数归属保持不变。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionActivationAccountOwnerLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped example: A fictional account linked from two distinct weighted applications fails ownership."
msgstr "虚构限定示例：从两个不同加权应用关联的虚构报告违反归属约束。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionActivationCandidateInventoryLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "fusion activation candidate inventory law"
msgstr "融合激活候选清单定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionActivationCandidateInventoryLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "An activation account has exactly one candidate record for each applied score of its owning application and no unrelated selected score."
msgstr "激活报告为其所属应用的每个应用分数恰好具有一个候选记录，不具有无关所选分数。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionActivationCandidateInventoryLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to preserve the complete original candidate collection through existing applied-score identities."
msgstr "用于通过现有应用分数身份保留完整原始候选集合。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionActivationCandidateInventoryLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid adding unrelated scores, omitting original candidates or merging records merely because aggregate values agree."
msgstr "避免添加无关分数、遗漏原始候选项，或仅因聚合值相同而合并记录。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionActivationCandidateInventoryLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Require score-to-record coverage, reverse application-score membership and record identity for the same selected score."
msgstr "要求分数到记录覆盖、反向应用分数成员关系，以及同一所选分数对应的记录身份相同。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionActivationCandidateInventoryLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "A successful empty original union has no score records, while its selected-call snapshot roster remains nonempty. Candidate identity follows the existing applied score."
msgstr "成功空原始并集没有分数记录，但其调用所选快照清单仍非空。候选身份由现有应用分数确定。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionActivationCandidateInventoryLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped example: A fictional two-score application with only one activation candidate record fails coverage."
msgstr "虚构限定示例：具有两个分数却只有一个激活候选记录的虚构应用违反覆盖要求。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionActivationVaultUniquenessLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "fusion activation vault uniqueness law"
msgstr "融合激活库唯一性定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionActivationVaultUniquenessLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Equal decoded native vault identity bytes identify the same roster record within one activation account."
msgstr "在同一激活报告内，相同的已解码原生库身份字节标识同一清单记录。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionActivationVaultUniquenessLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to keep the complete selected-call roster unique by actual supplied vault identity."
msgstr "用于按实际所提供库身份保持完整调用所选清单唯一。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionActivationVaultUniquenessLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid using case-sensitive lexical equality or copying one vault into two record identities."
msgstr "避免使用区分大小写的词法相等，或将一个库复制为两个记录身份。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionActivationVaultUniquenessLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Bind both roster records and both actual hexBinary identities, compare the binary values with termEqual and require equal record resources."
msgstr "绑定两个清单记录及两个实际 hexBinary 身份，通过 termEqual 比较二进制值，并要求记录资源相等。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionActivationVaultUniquenessLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The either-case representation profile preserves decoded-byte identity. Width checks do not establish hash authenticity or a generic vault class."
msgstr "大小写均可的表示配置保留解码字节身份。宽度检查不确立哈希真实性或通用库类。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionActivationVaultUniquenessLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped example: Two fictional roster records with upper-case and lower-case spellings of the same vault bytes fail if their record identities differ."
msgstr "虚构限定示例：两个虚构清单记录若对同一库字节分别采用大写及小写拼写，而记录身份不同，则被拒绝。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionActivationCandidateOwnerLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "fusion activation candidate owner law"
msgstr "融合激活候选归属定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionActivationCandidateOwnerLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Every typed candidate activation record has exactly one incoming typed activation account owner."
msgstr "每个类型化候选激活记录恰好有一个入向类型化激活报告所属者。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionActivationCandidateOwnerLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to prevent orphaned records and keep candidate-specific evidence in one actual account."
msgstr "用于防止孤立记录，并使候选专属证据处于一个实际报告内。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionActivationCandidateOwnerLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid sharing a control record across accounts or accepting pairwise uniqueness without owner existence."
msgstr "避免跨报告共享控制记录，或接受仅有成对唯一性而没有所属者存在。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionActivationCandidateOwnerLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Require an incoming typed account and compare any two account owners of the same record."
msgstr "要求入向类型化报告，并比较同一记录的任意两个报告所属者。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionActivationCandidateOwnerLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Quantities may still be shared across compatible records. This ownership restriction applies to the descriptive record, not its magnitude carrier."
msgstr "量仍可以跨相容记录共享。此归属限制适用于描述记录，而非其量值载体。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionActivationCandidateOwnerLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped example: A fictional candidate record with no account owner fails even when its score and found-vault links are present."
msgstr "虚构限定示例：没有所属报告的虚构候选记录被拒绝，即使分数及发现库链接已存在。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionActivationCandidateContextLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "fusion activation candidate context law"
msgstr "融合激活候选上下文定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionActivationCandidateContextLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Each candidate record’s found-vault records belong to its own account roster, and its reported aggregate is present exactly when that account selected activation."
msgstr "每个候选记录的发现库记录属于其自身报告清单，且当且仅当该报告选择激活时存在其已报告聚合值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionActivationCandidateContextLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to preserve the actual aggregation subset and distinguish enabled observations from inactive source constants."
msgstr "用于保留实际聚合子集，并将启用观察与未激活来源常量区分开来。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionActivationCandidateContextLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid adding roster-only vaults to a candidate’s found scope or importing a disabled wire zero as an observed Quantity."
msgstr "避免将仅在清单中的库加入候选发现作用域，或将禁用时传输的零作为观察 Quantity 导入。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionActivationCandidateContextLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Join the account owner, require found-record roster membership and compare the bound Boolean mode to true or false before requiring or forbidding the aggregate edge."
msgstr "连接所属报告，要求发现记录属于清单，并将绑定布尔模式与 true 或 false 比较，再要求或禁止聚合边。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionActivationCandidateContextLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Nonempty found-vault membership is a local required closure. Exact equality with actual Candidate.vaults and actual call-input selection remain strict import obligations."
msgstr "非空发现库成员关系是局部必需闭包。与实际 Candidate.vaults 精确相等及实际调用输入选择仍是严格导入义务。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionActivationCandidateContextLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped example: A fictional disabled account carrying a candidate activation Quantity fails even when its magnitude is zero."
msgstr "虚构限定示例：禁用的虚构报告若携带候选激活 Quantity，则被拒绝，即使量值为零。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionActivationSnapshotRecordLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "fusion activation snapshot record law"
msgstr "融合激活快照记录定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionActivationSnapshotRecordLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Each typed vault snapshot record has one account owner, coherent conditional snapshot fields and correctly sized unspaced either-case identity literals."
msgstr "每个类型化库快照记录具有一个所属报告、一致的条件快照字段，以及宽度正确、无空格且大小写均可的身份字面量。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionActivationSnapshotRecordLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to preserve actual present snapshots or qualified live-at-capture first-snapshot absence."
msgstr "用于保留实际存在快照，或捕获时存活服务具备限定依据的首次快照缺失。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionActivationSnapshotRecordLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid deriving qualified false from wire None, retirement, budget-skipped reads or unavailable capture evidence, or claiming XSD-canonical hex normalization."
msgstr "避免从传输 None、退役、因预算跳过的读取或不可用捕获证据推导具备限定依据的 false，或声称进行了 XSD 规范十六进制规范化。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionActivationSnapshotRecordLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Require owner existence and uniqueness; true requires identity and held count, false forbids both; apply result-free termRegex to the bound vault and any supplied snapshot identity."
msgstr "要求所属者存在且唯一；true 要求身份及保有计数，false 禁止两者；对绑定库身份及任何所提供快照身份应用不绑定结果的 termRegex。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionActivationSnapshotRecordLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Vault literals use thirty-two hex digits and snapshots sixty-four. Missing capture-liveness and absence-reason evidence fails import. Existing regex lowering retains target-dialect residue and supplies no authentication certificate."
msgstr "库字面量使用 32 个十六进制数字，快照使用 64 个。捕获存活及缺失原因证据缺失使导入失败。现有正则表达式转译保留目标方言残差，不提供认证证书。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionActivationSnapshotRecordLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped example: A fictional record with true but no held-count Quantity fails; a raw absent wire field without capture evidence cannot select the qualified false state."
msgstr "虚构限定示例：具有 true 却没有保有计数 Quantity 的虚构记录被拒绝；没有捕获证据的原始传输缺失字段不能选择具备限定依据的 false 状态。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionActivationAggregateContextLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "fusion activation aggregate context law"
msgstr "融合激活聚合上下文定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionActivationAggregateContextLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Every reported activation Quantity in one account has exactly the same dimension and applicable frame resources as the other aggregate values in that account."
msgstr "同一报告内的每个已报告激活 Quantity，与该报告其他聚合值具有完全相同的量纲及适用参照系资源。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionActivationAggregateContextLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain a coherent declared comparison context for candidate aggregate magnitudes."
msgstr "用于为候选聚合量值保留一致的声明比较上下文。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionActivationAggregateContextLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid equating contexts because values are equal or forcing aggregate context to match held counts or weighted fusion scores."
msgstr "避免因值相等而将上下文视为相同，或强制聚合上下文与保有计数或加权融合分数匹配。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionActivationAggregateContextLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Join both owned candidate records and their actual reported Quantities, bind their dimensions or frames, then compare the resources."
msgstr "连接两个具有所属者的候选记录及其实际报告的 Quantity，绑定量纲或参照系，再比较资源。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionActivationAggregateContextLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Each Quantity requires its own full coordinates locally. The source API supplies no default Dimension or ReferenceFrame; actual source or adapter interpretation must justify them."
msgstr "每个 Quantity 在局部要求自身完整坐标。来源 API 不提供默认 Dimension 或 ReferenceFrame；实际来源或适配器解释必须为其提供依据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionActivationAggregateContextLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped example: Two fictional aggregate values in one account with different stored frames fail even when both magnitudes are zero."
msgstr "虚构限定示例：同一报告内两个虚构聚合值若存储参照系不同，即使两者量值均为零也被拒绝。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionReportedActivationOwnerLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "fusion reported activation owner law"
msgstr "融合已报告激活归属定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionReportedActivationOwnerLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Every typed reported activation Quantity has at least one incoming typed candidate activation record."
msgstr "每个类型化已报告激活 Quantity 至少具有一个入向类型化候选激活记录。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionReportedActivationOwnerLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to keep observed aggregate carriers attached to complete reported accounts."
msgstr "用于将观察到的聚合载体附于完整已报告记录。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionReportedActivationOwnerLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid imposing unique inverse Quantity ownership or accepting an isolated activation magnitude."
msgstr "避免施加逆向唯一 Quantity 归属，或接受孤立激活量值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionReportedActivationOwnerLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Require a typed candidate record with reportedActivationValue pointing to the Quantity."
msgstr "要求具有 reportedActivationValue 指向该 Quantity 的类型化候选记录。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionReportedActivationOwnerLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Candidate ownership and mode coherence require actual enabled context. Compatible records may share the same fully coordinated Quantity without merging source applications."
msgstr "候选归属及模式一致性要求实际启用上下文。相容记录可以共享同一个完整协调的 Quantity，不合并来源应用。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionReportedActivationOwnerLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped example: A fictional activation Quantity shared by compatible enabled records is permitted; an isolated typed magnitude fails."
msgstr "虚构限定示例：相容启用记录共享虚构激活 Quantity 被允许；孤立类型化量值被拒绝。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionSnapshotHeldOwnerLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "fusion snapshot held owner law"
msgstr "融合快照保有计数归属定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionSnapshotHeldOwnerLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Every typed snapshot held-count Quantity has at least one incoming typed vault snapshot record."
msgstr "每个类型化快照保有计数 Quantity 至少具有一个入向类型化库快照记录。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionSnapshotHeldOwnerLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to keep actual held counts associated with their reported snapshot state."
msgstr "用于使实际保有计数与其报告的快照状态关联。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionSnapshotHeldOwnerLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid imposing unique inverse count ownership or inventing a held count for absent or unavailable snapshots."
msgstr "避免施加逆向唯一计数归属，或为缺失或不可用快照虚构保有计数。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionSnapshotHeldOwnerLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Require a typed snapshot record with activationSnapshotHeld pointing to the Quantity."
msgstr "要求具有 activationSnapshotHeld 指向该 Quantity 的类型化快照记录。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionSnapshotHeldOwnerLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Snapshot coherence separately requires actual presence. Compatible sharing is legal; neither aggregate activation nor fusion-score context is imposed on held counts."
msgstr "快照一致性单独要求实际存在。允许相容共享；保有计数不被施加聚合激活或融合分数上下文。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionSnapshotHeldOwnerLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped example: A fictional typed held-count Quantity with no incoming snapshot record fails even when its value is zero."
msgstr "虚构限定示例：没有入向快照记录的虚构类型化保有计数 Quantity 被拒绝，即使其值为零。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionActivationAbsentSnapshotZeroLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "fusion activation absent snapshot zero law"
msgstr "融合激活快照缺失零值定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionActivationAbsentSnapshotZeroLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "An enabled candidate’s reported aggregate is numeric zero when none of its nonempty actual found-vault subset has a present snapshot and every absence is qualified."
msgstr "在激活已启用时，若候选项的非空实际发现库子集中没有存在的快照，且每项缺失均具备限定依据，则其已报告聚合值为数值零。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionActivationAbsentSnapshotZeroLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain the necessary native zero rule for confirmed first-snapshot absence in the actual candidate scope."
msgstr "用于保留实际候选作用域内已确认首次快照缺失所要求的原生零规则。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionActivationAbsentSnapshotZeroLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring snapshot absence from zero, using roster-only snapshots as components or treating ambiguous wire absence as qualified evidence."
msgstr "避免从零推断快照缺失、将仅在清单中的快照用作组件，或将含义不明的传输缺失视为具备限定依据的证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionActivationAbsentSnapshotZeroLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Bind owner, true mode, actual reported Quantity and stored unsigned value; test that no found-vault record is present, then compare the bound value with unsigned-long zero."
msgstr "绑定所属者、true 模式、实际报告 Quantity 及存储无符号值；检查没有发现库记录标示快照存在，再将绑定值与无符号长整数零比较。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionActivationAbsentSnapshotZeroLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Qualified false states require actual live-at-capture absence proof before import. The law checks one necessary source rule, not saturation arithmetic, per-vault reconstruction or native execution parity."
msgstr "具备限定依据的 false 状态要求导入前具有实际捕获时存活及缺失证明。此定律检查单向必要来源规则，不检查饱和算术、逐库重建或原生执行等价。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FusionActivationAbsentSnapshotZeroLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped example: A fictional candidate found only in confirmed no-first-snapshot vault A has aggregate zero even when another roster-only vault B has a present snapshot."
msgstr "虚构限定示例：虚构候选项仅在已确认没有首次快照的库 A 中被发现，因此聚合值为零，即使另一个仅在清单中的库 B 具有存在快照。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAppliedOrderAccount|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Query Applied Order Account"
msgstr "查询已应用排序报告"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAppliedOrderAccount|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A complete reported account of the inspected native weighted order on one existing weighted application and its answer, retaining the actual policy, output occurrences, original coordinates and qualified key evidence."
msgstr "针对一个现有加权应用及其答案的完整已报告记录，描述所检查的原生加权顺序，保留实际策略、输出出现项、原始坐标及具备限定依据的键证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAppliedOrderAccount|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to enrich the same actual weighted application, answer and applied scores with complete reported order evidence."
msgstr "用于为同一实际加权应用、答案及已应用分数补充完整的已报告排序证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAppliedOrderAccount|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inventing another source call or result, labeling requested score-first precedence as inspected native execution or accepting unavailable witnesses as empty."
msgstr "避免虚构另一次来源调用或另一个结果、将请求的分数优先顺序标作所检查的原生执行，或将不可获得的见证当作空集合。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAppliedOrderAccount|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Link from the existing application through appliedOrderAccount; provide the actual policy, same-application activation account, supplied native policy fields and every actual output entry."
msgstr "从现有应用通过 appliedOrderAccount 关联；提供实际策略、属于同一应用的激活报告、所提供的原生策略字段及每个实际输出条目。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAppliedOrderAccount|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The selected native contract is tier, activation, score, then source subject tie. Exact matching completeness, supplied subject association and terminal byte-order proof remain mandatory import evidence; graph checks alone do not certify whole-sort execution."
msgstr "所选原生契约依次采用层级、激活、分数及来源主体并列消解键。精确的匹配完整性、所提供的主体关联及末尾全字节顺序证明仍是必需的导入证据；仅凭图检查不能认证完整排序的执行。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAppliedOrderAccount|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped fragment: ex:call gmeow:appliedOrderAccount ex:order . The actual existing weighted application, answer and complete reported evidence are omitted."
msgstr "虚构限定片段：ex:call gmeow:appliedOrderAccount ex:order . 此处省略实际现有加权应用、答案及完整已报告证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAppliedOrderEntry|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Query Applied Order Entry"
msgstr "查询已应用排序条目"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAppliedOrderEntry|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "One actual output occurrence of a reported native weighted order, selecting an original applied score and retaining its original unsigned input-array coordinate and separate nonnegative output ordinal."
msgstr "已报告原生加权顺序中的一个实际输出出现项，选择一个原始已应用分数，并保留其在原始输入数组中的无符号坐标及独立的非负输出序号。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAppliedOrderEntry|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain every original candidate exactly once through the existing applied-score identity."
msgstr "用于通过现有已应用分数身份，使每个原始候选项恰好保留一次。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAppliedOrderEntry|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid copying candidates into replacement identities, substituting original class ranks for output position or treating unique ordinals alone as authenticated source arrays."
msgstr "避免将候选项复制为替代身份、以原始类别排名替代输出位置，或仅凭序号唯一就将数组视为已经认证的来源数组。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAppliedOrderEntry|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Provide appliedOrderScore, appliedOrderInputPosition, entryOrdinal, appliedOrderTierDeclared and supplied appliedOrderSubjectTie; retain the conditional tier and complete applicable matched witnesses."
msgstr "提供 appliedOrderScore、appliedOrderInputPosition、entryOrdinal、appliedOrderTierDeclared 及所提供的 appliedOrderSubjectTie；保留条件性层级及完整的适用匹配见证。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAppliedOrderEntry|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Both position collections are separately zero-based, gap-free and unique within the owner account. Actual original-slot and output-slot associations still require authentic source evidence. This record is descriptive information, not another native answer."
msgstr "两个位置集合在所属报告内各自从零开始、无间断且唯一。实际原始槽位及输出槽位关联仍要求真实来源证据。此记录是描述性信息，不是另一个原生答案。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryAppliedOrderEntry|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped fragment: ex:entry a gmeow:QueryAppliedOrderEntry ; gmeow:appliedOrderInputPosition \"1\"^^xsd:unsignedInt ; gmeow:entryOrdinal \"0\"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger . Other required fields, owner and source evidence are omitted."
msgstr "虚构限定片段：ex:entry a gmeow:QueryAppliedOrderEntry ; gmeow:appliedOrderInputPosition \"1\"^^xsd:unsignedInt ; gmeow:entryOrdinal \"0\"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger . 此处省略其他必需字段、所属者及来源证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryMatchedLiteralWitness|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Query Matched Literal Witness"
msgstr "查询匹配字面量见证"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryMatchedLiteralWitness|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A descriptive qualified record of an actual matched content-predicate IRI and exact literal lexical string for one candidate in one selected vault during the actual tier computation."
msgstr "在实际层级计算期间，为一个候选项在一个所选库中实际匹配的内容谓词 IRI 及精确字面量词法字符串保留的、具备限定依据的描述性记录。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryMatchedLiteralWitness|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain complete actual matched-pair evidence from all selected services, including unmapped predicates and vaults outside the candidate-found activation subset."
msgstr "用于保留所有所选服务提供的完整实际匹配对证据，包括未映射谓词，以及候选项发现库激活子集之外的库。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryMatchedLiteralWitness|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inventing source claim identity, original literal datatype or language, asserting affirmative support from a match or treating activation snapshots as graph-read content."
msgstr "避免虚构来源断言身份、原始字面量数据类型或语言、从匹配断言肯定支持，或将激活快照视为图读取内容。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryMatchedLiteralWitness|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Provide matchedLiteralVault, matchedLiteralPredicate and exact matchedLiteralLexicalForm, and retain the witness under its one actual output entry."
msgstr "提供 matchedLiteralVault、matchedLiteralPredicate 及精确的 matchedLiteralLexicalForm，并将见证保留在其唯一实际输出条目下。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryMatchedLiteralWitness|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Actual matching follows source short circuits: a nonlexical rank-string match is independently sufficient; applicable remaining lexical branches require successful analysis and match decisions. Preserve supplied repeated occurrences without pair-uniqueness assumptions. Missing applicable evidence fails full import."
msgstr "实际匹配遵循来源短路规则：与非词法排名字符串匹配本身就足够；其余适用的词法分支要求分析及匹配判定成功。保留所提供的重复出现项，不假定匹配对唯一。缺失适用证据使完整导入失败。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryMatchedLiteralWitness|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped fragment: ex:witness a gmeow:QueryMatchedLiteralWitness ; gmeow:matchedLiteralPredicate ex:label ; gmeow:matchedLiteralLexicalForm \"  retained text  \" . The selected vault, owning entry and actual matching evidence are omitted."
msgstr "虚构限定片段：ex:witness a gmeow:QueryMatchedLiteralWitness ; gmeow:matchedLiteralPredicate ex:label ; gmeow:matchedLiteralLexicalForm \"  retained text  \" . 此处省略所选库、所属条目及实际匹配证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedOrderAccount|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "reported applied order account"
msgstr "已报告的应用排序记录"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedOrderAccount|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The at-most-one complete native-qualified reported order account selected on an existing actual weighted application."
msgstr "在现有实际加权应用上选择的、按原生契约限定的完整已报告排序记录，至多一个。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedOrderAccount|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain actual output order beside the same application’s original weighted result."
msgstr "用于在同一应用的原始加权结果旁保留实际输出顺序。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedOrderAccount|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid creating a second execution or answer because score and ordering vocabulary are separate."
msgstr "避免因为分数词汇与排序词汇分开，就创建第二次执行或第二个答案。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedOrderAccount|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Reference a complete QueryAppliedOrderAccount from the actual QueryWeightedFusionApplication."
msgstr "从实际 QueryWeightedFusionApplication 引用完整的 QueryAppliedOrderAccount。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedOrderAccount|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Existing applications need not select this profile. Selecting it makes all declared evidence and import requirements mandatory; partial data cannot become a weaker successful account."
msgstr "现有应用无需选择此配置。一旦选择，所有已声明证据及导入要求均为必需；不完整数据不能变成要求更弱的成功报告。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedOrderAccount|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped fragment: ex:call gmeow:appliedOrderAccount ex:order . Other required account fields and actual source evidence are omitted."
msgstr "虚构限定片段：ex:call gmeow:appliedOrderAccount ex:order . 此处省略其他必需报告字段及实际来源证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedOrderPolicy|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "actual applied order policy"
msgstr "实际已应用排序策略"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedOrderPolicy|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The one existing complete QueryOrderPolicy interpreting the actual selected source order under this native-qualified account."
msgstr "唯一现有且完整的 QueryOrderPolicy，用于在此按原生契约限定的报告中解释实际选择的来源顺序。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedOrderPolicy|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain the actual selected criterion prescription and unique predicate mappings."
msgstr "用于保留实际所选准则规定及谓词不重复的映射。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedOrderPolicy|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid treating a native digest as criterion precedence or claiming the source serialized ontology criterion occurrences."
msgstr "避免将原生摘要视为准则优先顺序，或声称来源已序列化本体准则出现项。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedOrderPolicy|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Reference the actual selected existing policy; require represented tier before activation and score, activation before score and the existing terminal tie."
msgstr "引用实际选择的现有策略；要求所表示的层级先于激活及分数、激活先于分数，并保留现有末尾并列消解准则。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedOrderPolicy|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "An optional empty content criterion is adapter interpretation of the inert native key, not a new source flag or serialized occurrence. Native declared status depends on nonempty actual mappings or selected activation."
msgstr "可选的空内容准则是适配器对不起作用的原生键的解释，不是新的来源标志或已序列化出现项。原生声明状态取决于实际非空映射或所选激活。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedOrderPolicy|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped fragment: ex:order gmeow:appliedOrderPolicy ex:nativePolicy . Other required account fields and actual source evidence are omitted."
msgstr "虚构限定片段：ex:order gmeow:appliedOrderPolicy ex:nativePolicy . 此处省略其他必需报告字段及实际来源证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedOrderActivationAccount|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "applied order activation account"
msgstr "已应用排序激活报告"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedOrderActivationAccount|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The one existing complete activation account associated with the same actual weighted application as a reported order."
msgstr "与已报告顺序属于同一实际加权应用的唯一现有完整激活报告。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedOrderActivationAccount|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to reuse actual mode, snapshot roster, candidate-found scope and coordinated aggregate Quantities."
msgstr "用于复用实际模式、快照清单、候选项发现库作用域及已协调的聚合量值载体。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedOrderActivationAccount|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid duplicating aggregate values, replacing them with held counts or linking another call’s activation account."
msgstr "避免重复聚合值、以已保留激活计数替代聚合值，或关联另一次调用的激活报告。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedOrderActivationAccount|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Reference the QueryFusionActivationAccount retained by the owner application’s fusionActivationAccount edge."
msgstr "引用所属应用通过 fusionActivationAccount 边保留的 QueryFusionActivationAccount。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedOrderActivationAccount|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Activation criterion selection agrees with actual activationEnabled. Qualified snapshot absence and required capture evidence keep their existing meaning; disabled zero is not measured data."
msgstr "激活准则选择与实际 activationEnabled 一致。具备限定依据的快照缺失及必需捕获证据保留其现有含义；禁用状态的零不是实测数据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedOrderActivationAccount|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped fragment: ex:order gmeow:appliedOrderActivationAccount ex:activationAccount . Other required account fields and actual source evidence are omitted."
msgstr "虚构限定片段：ex:order gmeow:appliedOrderActivationAccount ex:activationAccount . 此处省略其他必需报告字段及实际来源证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedOrderNativePolicyDigest|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "applied native policy digest"
msgstr "已应用原生策略摘要"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedOrderNativePolicyDigest|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The actual supplied thirty-two-byte native policy identity retained separately from the ontology policy resource and fusion-profile digest."
msgstr "实际提供的三十二字节原生策略身份，与本体策略资源及融合配置摘要分别保留。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedOrderNativePolicyDigest|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to preserve the source-returned policy bytes under an explicit unspaced either-case representation profile."
msgstr "用于按显式无空格且大小写均可的表示配置，保留来源返回的策略字节。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedOrderNativePolicyDigest|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid computing replacement hashes, authenticating call input from a digest alone or encoding arbitrary criterion precedence into the source identity."
msgstr "避免计算替代哈希、仅凭摘要认证调用输入，或将任意准则优先顺序编码进来源身份。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedOrderNativePolicyDigest|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Supply xsd:hexBinary matching ^[0-9A-Fa-f]{64}$ from the actual result."
msgstr "从实际结果提供符合 ^[0-9A-Fa-f]{64}$ 的 xsd:hexBinary。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedOrderNativePolicyDigest|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Native identity covers mappings and activation selection, not arbitrary precedence. Width checks do not certify hashing or source authenticity; regex dialect residue remains explicit."
msgstr "原生身份涵盖映射及激活选择，不涵盖任意优先顺序。宽度检查不能认证哈希计算或来源真实性；正则表达式方言的残余限制仍显式保留。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedOrderNativePolicyDigest|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped fragment: ex:order gmeow:appliedOrderNativePolicyDigest \"00112233445566778899aabbccddeeff00112233445566778899aabbccddeeff\"^^xsd:hexBinary . These bytes are fictional, not authenticated native identities."
msgstr "虚构限定片段：ex:order gmeow:appliedOrderNativePolicyDigest \"00112233445566778899aabbccddeeff00112233445566778899aabbccddeeff\"^^xsd:hexBinary . 这些字节是虚构值，不是经过认证的原生身份。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedOrderNativePolicyDeclared|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "applied native policy declared"
msgstr "已应用原生策略声明状态"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedOrderNativePolicyDeclared|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The required actual source Boolean indicating a nonempty predicate-tier mapping vector or selected activation."
msgstr "必需的实际来源布尔值，表示谓词层级映射向量非空或已选择激活。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedOrderNativePolicyDeclared|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to preserve native declared status independently of mandatory ontology score and tie criteria."
msgstr "用于保留原生声明状态，使其独立于本体中必需的分数及并列消解准则。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedOrderNativePolicyDeclared|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid treating every nonempty QueryOrderPolicy as native declared or using an inert empty content criterion as a source selection flag."
msgstr "避免将所有非空 QueryOrderPolicy 都视为原生已声明，或将不起作用的空内容准则用作来源选择标志。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedOrderNativePolicyDeclared|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Supply the actual typed Boolean and require true exactly when selected nonempty content mappings or an activation criterion exist."
msgstr "提供实际带类型布尔值，并要求当且仅当存在所选非空内容映射或激活准则时为 true。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedOrderNativePolicyDeclared|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Boolean values compare independently of lexical spelling. Empty mappings skip native tier probing; a score-and-tie policy can legitimately have native declared false."
msgstr "布尔值的比较独立于词法写法。空映射跳过原生层级探查；仅含分数及并列消解的策略，其原生声明状态可以合法地为 false。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedOrderNativePolicyDeclared|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped fragment: ex:order gmeow:appliedOrderNativePolicyDeclared false . Other required account fields and actual source evidence are omitted."
msgstr "虚构限定片段：ex:order gmeow:appliedOrderNativePolicyDeclared false . 此处省略其他必需报告字段及实际来源证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedOrderEntry|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "actual applied order entry"
msgstr "实际已应用排序条目"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedOrderEntry|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A member of the complete actual output-entry collection corresponding exactly to the owner application’s original applied scores."
msgstr "完整实际输出条目集合中的成员，与所属应用的原始已应用分数精确对应。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedOrderEntry|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain every original candidate and actual output occurrence without filtering."
msgstr "用于不经过滤地保留每个原始候选项及实际输出出现项。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedOrderEntry|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid omitting scores, adding unrelated entries or accepting a terminal-error stream prefix as a complete batch result."
msgstr "避免遗漏分数、增加无关条目，或将终止错误之前的流前缀当作完整批次结果。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedOrderEntry|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Reference exactly one entry per original applied score with its actual input coordinate and output ordinal."
msgstr "为每个原始已应用分数恰好引用一个条目，并保留其实际输入坐标及输出序号。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedOrderEntry|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The collection is empty exactly when the original application’s score collection is empty. Existing original union, queries and losses remain preserved by the weighted answer."
msgstr "当且仅当原始应用的分数集合为空时，此集合为空。现有原始并集、查询及损失仍由加权答案保留。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedOrderEntry|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped fragment: ex:order gmeow:appliedOrderEntry ex:first, ex:second . Other required account fields and actual source evidence are omitted."
msgstr "虚构限定片段：ex:order gmeow:appliedOrderEntry ex:first, ex:second . 此处省略其他必需报告字段及实际来源证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedOrderScore|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "applied order original score"
msgstr "已应用排序原始分数"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedOrderScore|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The one existing original applied-score resource selected by an actual output entry."
msgstr "实际输出条目选择的唯一现有原始已应用分数资源。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedOrderScore|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain original candidate identity and exact source score Quantity without recomputation."
msgstr "用于保留原始候选项身份及精确来源分数 Quantity，不重新计算。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedOrderScore|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid substituting a rerank float, unweighted integer score, copied candidate or another application’s score."
msgstr "避免以重排浮点值、未加权整数分数、复制的候选项或另一应用的分数替代。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedOrderScore|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Reference a QueryAppliedFusionScore retained by the account’s actual weighted application."
msgstr "引用该报告的实际加权应用所保留的 QueryAppliedFusionScore。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedOrderScore|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The original candidate follows appliedScoreCandidate. Activation lookup joins the existing activation account through this same score, without adding a parallel numeric value or context."
msgstr "原始候选项沿 appliedScoreCandidate 关联取得。激活查找通过同一个分数连接现有激活报告，不增加平行的数值或上下文。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedOrderScore|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped fragment: ex:entry gmeow:appliedOrderScore ex:score . Other required account fields and actual source evidence are omitted."
msgstr "虚构限定片段：ex:entry gmeow:appliedOrderScore ex:score . 此处省略其他必需报告字段及实际来源证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedOrderInputPosition|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "applied order original input position"
msgstr "已应用排序原始输入位置"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedOrderInputPosition|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The actual zero-based u32 coordinate of the entry’s original candidate in the returned whole union’s candidate array."
msgstr "条目原始候选项在所返回完整并集的候选数组中的实际从零开始 u32 坐标。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedOrderInputPosition|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to preserve original source occurrence position independently of actual output position."
msgstr "用于独立于实际输出位置，保留原始来源出现位置。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedOrderInputPosition|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid assuming host pointer width, reusing a class-local rank or deriving the source coordinate from the output ordinal."
msgstr "避免假定宿主指针宽度、复用类别局部排名，或从输出序号推导来源坐标。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedOrderInputPosition|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Supply one xsd:unsignedInt from the actual source candidate index and retain entryOrdinal separately."
msgstr "从实际来源候选索引提供一个 xsd:unsignedInt，并独立保留 entryOrdinal。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedOrderInputPosition|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Input coordinates are value-unique and gap-free from zero within the account. Those graph checks cannot authenticate the actual candidate-to-slot association; source evidence remains required."
msgstr "输入坐标在报告内按值唯一且从零开始无间断。这些图检查不能认证实际候选项与槽位的关联；来源证据仍是必需的。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedOrderInputPosition|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped fragment: ex:entry gmeow:appliedOrderInputPosition \"1\"^^xsd:unsignedInt ; gmeow:entryOrdinal \"0\"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger . Other required account fields and actual source evidence are omitted."
msgstr "虚构限定片段：ex:entry gmeow:appliedOrderInputPosition \"1\"^^xsd:unsignedInt ; gmeow:entryOrdinal \"0\"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger . 此处省略其他必需报告字段及实际来源证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedOrderTierDeclared|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "applied order tier declared"
msgstr "已应用排序层级声明状态"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedOrderTierDeclared|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The required actual source Boolean distinguishing a declared mapped tier from the undeclared state after every declared u32 label."
msgstr "必需的实际来源布尔值，区分已声明的映射层级与排在所有已声明 u32 标签之后的未声明状态。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedOrderTierDeclared|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain the source Option state without fabricating a numeric missing-tier sentinel."
msgstr "用于保留来源 Option 状态，不虚构表示缺失层级的数值哨兵。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedOrderTierDeclared|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid treating 4294967295 as undeclared or inferring false from unavailable matched evidence."
msgstr "避免将 4294967295 视为未声明，或从不可获得的匹配证据推断 false。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedOrderTierDeclared|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Supply the actual typed Boolean; true requires one appliedOrderTier supported by complete qualified matched bindings and false forbids a tier edge."
msgstr "提供实际带类型布尔值；true 要求一个由完整且具备限定依据的匹配映射所支持的 appliedOrderTier，false 则禁止层级边。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedOrderTierDeclared|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Declared maximum u32 still precedes undeclared. Both stored Boolean values are bound independently for comparisons, so true and 1 or false and 0 remain value-equivalent."
msgstr "已声明的最大 u32 仍先于未声明状态。两个已存储布尔值独立绑定后比较，因此 true 与 1、false 与 0 仍按值等价。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedOrderTierDeclared|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped fragment: ex:entry gmeow:appliedOrderTierDeclared false . Other required account fields and actual source evidence are omitted."
msgstr "虚构限定片段：ex:entry gmeow:appliedOrderTierDeclared false . 此处省略其他必需报告字段及实际来源证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedOrderTier|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "actual declared applied tier"
msgstr "实际已声明应用层级"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedOrderTier|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The conditional actual declared u32 tier label of an output entry, equal to the minimum selected mapping among its complete actual matched predicates."
msgstr "输出条目的条件性实际已声明 u32 层级标签，等于其完整实际匹配谓词集合中所选映射的最小值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedOrderTier|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain a declared control-tier label, including 4294967295."
msgstr "用于保留已声明的控制层级标签，包括 4294967295。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedOrderTier|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid storing an undeclared sentinel, treating tier as a magnitude or choosing an unrelated subject predicate as evidence."
msgstr "避免存储未声明哨兵、将层级视为量值，或选择主体的无关谓词充当证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedOrderTier|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Supply exactly one xsd:unsignedInt when appliedOrderTierDeclared is true and no edge when false."
msgstr "当 appliedOrderTierDeclared 为 true 时恰好提供一个 xsd:unsignedInt，为 false 时不提供该边。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedOrderTier|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The stored label equals some matched selected binding and is no greater than every matched selected label. Equal labels on different predicates and tied minimum witnesses are legal."
msgstr "存储标签等于某个已匹配的所选映射，且不大于每个已匹配的所选标签。不同谓词使用相同标签，以及多个见证并列达到最小值，均合法。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedOrderTier|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped fragment: ex:entry gmeow:appliedOrderTierDeclared true ; gmeow:appliedOrderTier \"4294967295\"^^xsd:unsignedInt . Other required account fields and actual source evidence are omitted."
msgstr "虚构限定片段：ex:entry gmeow:appliedOrderTierDeclared true ; gmeow:appliedOrderTier \"4294967295\"^^xsd:unsignedInt . 此处省略其他必需报告字段及实际来源证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedOrderSubjectTie|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "applied source subject tie"
msgstr "已应用来源主体并列消解键"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedOrderSubjectTie|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The actual separately supplied thirty-two-byte native subject tie identity associated with the original candidate IRI."
msgstr "与原始候选项 IRI 关联的、实际单独提供的三十二字节原生主体并列消解身份。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedOrderSubjectTie|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain the complete source tie bytes under the unspaced either-case profile."
msgstr "用于按无空格且大小写均可的配置保留完整来源并列消解字节。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedOrderSubjectTie|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid hashing or inventing missing bytes, replacing them with IRI lexical order or claiming ordinary hexBinary termLess certifies the native comparator."
msgstr "避免通过哈希或虚构补全缺失字节、用 IRI 词法顺序替代，或声称普通 hexBinary termLess 可以认证原生比较器。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedOrderSubjectTie|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Supply xsd:hexBinary matching ^[0-9A-Fa-f]{64}$ with actual authenticated subject association and source terminal-order evidence."
msgstr "提供符合 ^[0-9A-Fa-f]{64}$ 的 xsd:hexBinary，以及实际经过认证的主体关联和来源末尾顺序证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedOrderSubjectTie|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Public Fused omits these bytes. Missing required tie evidence fails this complete import. Width and decoded-value equality do not certify whole-byte ordering, hash authenticity or candidate identity from a collision assumption."
msgstr "公开 Fused 不提供这些字节。缺失必需的并列消解证据使此完整导入失败。宽度及解码值相等不能认证全字节顺序、哈希真实性，或依据碰撞假设认定的候选项身份。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedOrderSubjectTie|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped fragment: ex:entry gmeow:appliedOrderSubjectTie \"ffeeddccbbaa99887766554433221100ffeeddccbbaa99887766554433221100\"^^xsd:hexBinary . These bytes are fictional, not authenticated native identities."
msgstr "虚构限定片段：ex:entry gmeow:appliedOrderSubjectTie \"ffeeddccbbaa99887766554433221100ffeeddccbbaa99887766554433221100\"^^xsd:hexBinary . 这些字节是虚构值，不是经过认证的原生身份。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedOrderMatchedLiteral|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "applied order matched literal witness"
msgstr "已应用排序匹配字面量见证"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedOrderMatchedLiteral|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A member of the complete qualified actual matched predicate and lexical-string inventory used for this candidate’s tier computation."
msgstr "用于此候选项层级计算的、完整且具备限定依据的实际匹配谓词及词法字符串清单中的成员。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedOrderMatchedLiteral|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain every actual matched occurrence across selected services, including unmapped predicates."
msgstr "用于保留所有所选服务中的每个实际匹配出现项，包括未映射谓词。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedOrderMatchedLiteral|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid substituting all subject predicates, deleting supplied repetitions or treating a missing inventory as empty or undeclared."
msgstr "避免用主体的所有谓词替代、删除所提供的重复项，或将缺失清单视为空清单或未声明状态。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedOrderMatchedLiteral|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Reference each actual QueryMatchedLiteralWitness when nonempty source mappings select tier computation; retain no invented probe inventory when mappings are empty."
msgstr "当非空来源映射选择层级计算时，引用每个实际 QueryMatchedLiteralWitness；映射为空时不保留虚构的探查清单。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedOrderMatchedLiteral|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Vector-string equality independently establishes a pair. Otherwise successful lexical analysis and decision are required only for a true applicable lexical-hit branch. Actual applicable failure rejects full import; unused parsing need not succeed."
msgstr "向量字符串相等本身即可确立一对匹配。否则，只有适用且词法命中条件为真的分支才要求词法分析及判定成功。实际适用失败会拒绝完整导入；未使用的解析无需成功。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/appliedOrderMatchedLiteral|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped fragment: ex:entry gmeow:appliedOrderMatchedLiteral ex:witnessOne, ex:witnessTwo . Other required account fields and actual source evidence are omitted."
msgstr "虚构限定片段：ex:entry gmeow:appliedOrderMatchedLiteral ex:witnessOne, ex:witnessTwo . 此处省略其他必需报告字段及实际来源证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/matchedLiteralVault|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "matched literal selected vault"
msgstr "匹配字面量所选库"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/matchedLiteralVault|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The one actual selected vault identified through an existing roster record for a qualified matched-pair witness."
msgstr "通过现有清单记录标识的唯一实际所选库，用于具备限定依据的匹配对见证。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/matchedLiteralVault|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain all-selected-service matching scope independently of candidate-found activation scope."
msgstr "用于独立于候选项发现库激活作用域，保留所有所选服务的匹配作用域。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/matchedLiteralVault|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid asserting that the witness came from activation snapshot contents or requiring the vault to be in the candidate-found subset."
msgstr "避免断言见证来自激活快照内容，或要求库属于候选项发现库子集。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/matchedLiteralVault|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Reference a record in the same account’s existing activation roster and retain actual same-call graph-read association as import evidence."
msgstr "引用同一报告的现有激活清单中的记录，并保留实际同次调用的图读取关联作为导入证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/matchedLiteralVault|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Activation snapshot and tier graph read are distinct source contexts. A later read or a read-version reconstruction cannot supply missing actual witness association."
msgstr "激活快照与层级图读取属于不同来源上下文。后续读取或根据读取版本重建不能补足缺失的实际见证关联。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/matchedLiteralVault|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped fragment: ex:witness gmeow:matchedLiteralVault ex:rosterOnlyVault . Other required account fields and actual source evidence are omitted."
msgstr "虚构限定片段：ex:witness gmeow:matchedLiteralVault ex:rosterOnlyVault . 此处省略其他必需报告字段及实际来源证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/matchedLiteralPredicate|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "matched literal content predicate"
msgstr "匹配字面量内容谓词"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/matchedLiteralPredicate|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The one actual source content-predicate IRI on a qualified matched literal pair for the original candidate."
msgstr "原始候选项具备限定依据的匹配字面量对上的唯一实际来源内容谓词 IRI。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/matchedLiteralPredicate|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to join actual matching evidence to the selected existing predicate-tier declarations."
msgstr "用于将实际匹配证据连接至所选现有谓词层级声明。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/matchedLiteralPredicate|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid replacing the predicate with text, an unrelated subject predicate or a claim of affirmative support."
msgstr "避免用文本、主体的无关谓词或肯定支持声明替代此谓词。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/matchedLiteralPredicate|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain one actual IRI and compare its resource identity with selected tierBindingPredicate values."
msgstr "保留一个实际 IRI，并将其资源身份与所选 tierBindingPredicate 值比较。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/matchedLiteralPredicate|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Native probes include framed, superseded and denied held claims. Matching does not authenticate a predicate, assert a new schema or prove that the claim is positive support."
msgstr "原生探查包括带框架、已被取代及被否定的已保留断言。匹配不认证谓词、不断言新模式，也不证明该断言构成肯定支持。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/matchedLiteralPredicate|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped fragment: ex:witness gmeow:matchedLiteralPredicate ex:label . Other required account fields and actual source evidence are omitted."
msgstr "虚构限定片段：ex:witness gmeow:matchedLiteralPredicate ex:label . 此处省略其他必需报告字段及实际来源证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/matchedLiteralLexicalForm|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "matched literal exact lexical form"
msgstr "匹配字面量精确词法形式"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/matchedLiteralLexicalForm|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The exact supplied native literal lexical string of a qualified matched pair, retained as an xsd:string carrier rather than a reconstruction of the original RDF literal."
msgstr "具备限定依据的匹配对中实际提供的精确原生字面量词法字符串，作为 xsd:string 载体保留，不重建原始 RDF 字面量。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/matchedLiteralLexicalForm|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to preserve actual text, including significant surrounding whitespace and an actually supplied empty string."
msgstr "用于保留实际文本，包括有意义的首尾空白及实际提供的空字符串。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/matchedLiteralLexicalForm|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid trimming, normalizing, inventing original datatype, language, direction or claim identity, or merging equal-text occurrences."
msgstr "避免去除首尾空白、规范化、虚构原始数据类型、语言、方向或断言身份，或合并文本相同的出现项。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/matchedLiteralLexicalForm|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Supply one exact xsd:string lexical carrier through this specialization of lang:literalValue."
msgstr "通过此 lang:literalValue 特化提供一个精确的 xsd:string 词法载体。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/matchedLiteralLexicalForm|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The internal probe supplies predicate and lexical text only. Distinct actual supplied occurrences can share these fields; retain their separate descriptive records without fabricating native identifiers."
msgstr "内部探查只提供谓词及词法文本。实际提供的不同出现项可以共享这些字段；保留其各自描述性记录，不虚构原生标识符。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/matchedLiteralLexicalForm|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped fragment: ex:witness gmeow:matchedLiteralLexicalForm \"  retained text  \" . Other required account fields and actual source evidence are omitted."
msgstr "虚构限定片段：ex:witness gmeow:matchedLiteralLexicalForm \"  retained text  \" . 此处省略其他必需报告字段及实际来源证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AppliedOrderAccountOwnerLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "applied order account owner law"
msgstr "已应用排序报告所属者定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AppliedOrderAccountOwnerLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Every typed applied-order account has exactly one incoming typed existing weighted application owner."
msgstr "每个带类型的已应用排序报告恰好具有一个带类型的现有加权应用，作为通过传入关联连接的所属者。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AppliedOrderAccountOwnerLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to keep complete reported order evidence on the same actual source occurrence as its weighted answer."
msgstr "用于将完整已报告排序证据保留在与其加权答案相同的实际来源出现项上。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AppliedOrderAccountOwnerLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid accepting orphan accounts, sharing an account across calls or treating inverse ownership as source authentication."
msgstr "避免接纳无所属者的报告、跨调用共享报告，或将反向所属关系视为来源认证。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AppliedOrderAccountOwnerLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Require an incoming typed weighted application and compare any two such owners by resource equality."
msgstr "要求存在通过传入关联连接的带类型加权应用，并按资源相等比较任意两个这样的所属者。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AppliedOrderAccountOwnerLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The application’s at-most-one order account is a separate local maximum. Existing answer, score and activation ownership obligations remain unchanged."
msgstr "应用至多拥有一个排序报告，这是独立的局部上限。现有答案、分数及激活的所属义务保持不变。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AppliedOrderAccountOwnerLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped example: A fictional order account referenced by two distinct weighted applications fails ownership."
msgstr "虚构限定示例：一个被两个不同加权应用引用的虚构排序报告不满足所属约束。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AppliedOrderPolicyContextLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "applied order policy context law"
msgstr "已应用排序策略上下文定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AppliedOrderPolicyContextLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The selected activation account belongs to the same weighted application, actual activation selection and native declared status agree with the selected policy, and criterion positions preserve inspected native precedence."
msgstr "所选激活报告属于同一加权应用，实际激活选择及原生声明状态与所选策略一致，且准则位置保留所检查的原生优先顺序。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AppliedOrderPolicyContextLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain the actual native tier-before-activation-before-score prescription without changing existing policy-definition semantics."
msgstr "用于保留实际原生层级先于激活、激活先于分数的规定，不改变现有策略定义语义。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AppliedOrderPolicyContextLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid labeling requested score-first execution as inspected native order or treating an inert empty content criterion as a serialized source flag."
msgstr "避免将请求的分数优先执行标为所检查的原生顺序，或将不起作用的空内容准则视为已序列化来源标志。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AppliedOrderPolicyContextLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Join the existing application and activation account; compare actual mode by Boolean value; require native declared exactly for nonempty mappings or activation, with tier before score and activation and activation before score."
msgstr "连接现有应用与激活报告；按布尔值比较实际模式；要求当且仅当映射非空或选择激活时原生状态为已声明，并要求层级先于分数及激活、激活先于分数。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AppliedOrderPolicyContextLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "An optional empty content criterion is adapter interpretation of the inert native key. Actual nonempty source mappings select probing; score and terminal tie alone do not make native policy declared true. Missing actual call-input association fails import."
msgstr "可选的空内容准则是适配器对不起作用的原生键的解释。实际非空来源映射选择探查；仅有分数及末尾并列消解准则不会使原生策略声明为真。缺失实际调用输入关联使导入失败。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AppliedOrderPolicyContextLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped example: A fictional activation-before-score result cannot be declared an actual score-before-activation native call merely because its values happen to agree."
msgstr "虚构限定示例：一个激活先于分数的虚构结果，不能仅因其数值碰巧一致，就被声明为分数先于激活的实际原生调用。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AppliedOrderSourceIdentityLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "applied order source identity law"
msgstr "已应用排序来源身份定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AppliedOrderSourceIdentityLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The supplied native policy identity and the owning application’s existing fusion-profile digest use the selected sixty-four-hex-digit unspaced either-case profile."
msgstr "所提供的原生策略身份及所属应用现有融合配置摘要采用所选无空格、大小写均可的六十四位十六进制数字配置。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AppliedOrderSourceIdentityLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain the actual thirty-two-byte identity forms without duplicating the existing fusion-profile field."
msgstr "用于保留实际三十二字节身份形式，不重复现有融合配置字段。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AppliedOrderSourceIdentityLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid synthesizing hashes, treating equal bytes as unique RDF interpretation identity or claiming width authenticates source execution."
msgstr "避免合成哈希、将相等字节视为唯一 RDF 解释身份，或声称宽度能够认证来源执行。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AppliedOrderSourceIdentityLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Positively bind each actual policy or existing profile digest, then apply result-free termRegex with ^[0-9A-Fa-f]{64}$."
msgstr "通过正向关联绑定每个实际策略摘要或现有配置摘要，再应用不产生结果的 termRegex 及 ^[0-9A-Fa-f]{64}$。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AppliedOrderSourceIdentityLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The explicit representation profile is not XSD-canonical normalization and retains regex-dialect residue. Full policy/profile content and actual source association remain import evidence."
msgstr "显式表示配置不是 XSD 规范形式的规范化，且保留正则表达式方言的残余限制。完整策略及配置内容与实际来源关联仍是导入证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AppliedOrderSourceIdentityLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped example: A fictional wrong-width policy digest fails this profile even when its selected policy fields are otherwise coherent."
msgstr "虚构限定示例：一个宽度错误的虚构策略摘要不符合此配置，即使其所选策略字段在其他方面一致。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AppliedOrderEntryInventoryLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "applied order entry inventory law"
msgstr "已应用排序条目清单定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AppliedOrderEntryInventoryLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Each original applied score has exactly one output entry, every entry selects a score from the same application, and original input positions and output ordinals are separately value-unique."
msgstr "每个原始已应用分数恰好有一个输出条目，每个条目选择同一应用的分数，且原始输入位置与输出序号分别按值唯一。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AppliedOrderEntryInventoryLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to preserve the complete candidate collection and both actual occurrence coordinates."
msgstr "用于保留完整候选项集合及两个实际出现坐标。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AppliedOrderEntryInventoryLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid filtering candidates, adding unrelated scores or equating input position with output position."
msgstr "避免过滤候选项、增加无关分数，或将输入位置等同于输出位置。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AppliedOrderEntryInventoryLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Require score-to-entry coverage and reverse application-score membership; compare selected scores and independently bound coordinate values to require entry identity where they coincide."
msgstr "要求条目覆盖所有分数，并反向要求所选分数属于该应用；比较所选分数及独立绑定的坐标值，在其相同时要求条目身份相同。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AppliedOrderEntryInventoryLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "A successful empty original union has no output entries but keeps its actual policy and nonempty activation roster. These checks preserve identities without authenticating external array-slot association."
msgstr "成功的原始空并集没有输出条目，但仍保留实际策略及非空激活清单。这些检查保留身份，不认证外部数组槽位关联。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AppliedOrderEntryInventoryLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped example: A fictional two-score result with only one output entry fails coverage; distinct entries sharing an input or output position fail uniqueness."
msgstr "虚构限定示例：一个具有两个分数却仅有一个输出条目的虚构结果不满足覆盖要求；共享输入或输出位置的不同条目不满足唯一性要求。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AppliedOrderPositionClosureLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "applied order position closure law"
msgstr "已应用排序位置闭包定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AppliedOrderPositionClosureLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The original unsigned input coordinates and nonnegative output ordinals independently enumerate their finite entry collections from zero without gaps."
msgstr "原始无符号输入坐标及非负输出序号，各自从零开始无间断地枚举其有限条目集合。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AppliedOrderPositionClosureLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain whole original and actual output arrays rather than merely distinct arbitrary indices."
msgstr "用于保留完整原始数组及实际输出数组，而不仅是彼此不同的任意索引。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AppliedOrderPositionClosureLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid reusing class ranks, requiring one lexical spelling of numeric zero or rebinding a stored coordinate as an arithmetic result."
msgstr "避免复用类别排名、要求数值零只能采用一种词法写法，或将已存储坐标重新绑定为算术结果。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AppliedOrderPositionClosureLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Require zero members whenever entries exist; each positive stored coordinate has a same-account predecessor whose index plus one is freshly bound by result-first termSum and then compared with that stored coordinate."
msgstr "只要存在条目，就要求存在位置为零的成员；每个正的已存储坐标须有同一报告内的前驱，其索引加一通过结果在首位的 termSum 绑定为新值，再与该已存储坐标比较。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AppliedOrderPositionClosureLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Input positions remain xsd:unsignedInt and output entryOrdinal remains xsd:nonNegativeInteger. The exact score-entry bijection and both predecessor closures avoid a new count property or evaluator; actual slot association still needs source evidence."
msgstr "输入位置仍为 xsd:unsignedInt，输出 entryOrdinal 仍为 xsd:nonNegativeInteger。精确的分数与条目双射及两种前驱闭包避免新增计数属性或求值器；实际槽位关联仍需要来源证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AppliedOrderPositionClosureLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped example: A fictional output at positions zero and two fails because position one is absent, even when the original input positions are complete."
msgstr "虚构限定示例：一个输出位置为零及二的虚构输出因缺少位置一而失败，即使原始输入位置完整。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AppliedOrderEntryOwnerLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "applied order entry owner law"
msgstr "已应用排序条目所属者定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AppliedOrderEntryOwnerLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Every typed actual output entry has exactly one incoming typed applied-order account owner."
msgstr "每个带类型的实际输出条目恰好具有一个带类型的已应用排序报告，作为通过传入关联连接的所属者。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AppliedOrderEntryOwnerLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to keep each descriptive result occurrence in one actual complete account."
msgstr "用于将每个描述性结果出现项保留在一个实际完整报告中。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AppliedOrderEntryOwnerLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid accepting isolated entries or sharing a control occurrence between distinct source calls."
msgstr "避免接纳孤立条目，或在不同来源调用间共享控制出现项。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AppliedOrderEntryOwnerLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Require an incoming typed account and compare any two incoming account owners of the same entry."
msgstr "要求存在通过传入关联连接的带类型报告，并比较同一条目的任意两个传入报告所属者。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AppliedOrderEntryOwnerLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The referenced score, policy and activation carriers retain their existing ownership and compatible-sharing rules. This law creates no new answer or event."
msgstr "所引用的分数、策略及激活载体保留其现有所属规则及兼容共享规则。此定律不创建新答案或新事件。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AppliedOrderEntryOwnerLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped example: A fictional typed output entry without an account owner fails even when its score and positions are present."
msgstr "虚构限定示例：一个没有所属报告的虚构带类型输出条目不满足要求，即使其分数及位置存在。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AppliedOrderEntryIdentityLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "applied order entry identity law"
msgstr "已应用排序条目身份定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AppliedOrderEntryIdentityLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Each output entry’s original candidate is an IRI and its actual supplied subject tie identity has the selected thirty-two-byte unspaced either-case representation."
msgstr "每个输出条目的原始候选项是 IRI，且其实际提供的主体并列消解身份符合所选三十二字节、无空格且大小写均可的表示。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AppliedOrderEntryIdentityLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to preserve inspected native subject admission and complete tie bytes."
msgstr "用于保留所检查的原生主体准入要求及完整并列消解字节。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AppliedOrderEntryIdentityLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid fabricating a subject hash, asserting hash collision impossibility as candidate identity or claiming ordinary hexBinary termLess proves native tie order."
msgstr "避免虚构主体哈希、以哈希碰撞不可能发生来断言候选项身份，或声称普通 hexBinary termLess 能证明原生并列消解顺序。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AppliedOrderEntryIdentityLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Join the existing selected score and appliedScoreCandidate before termIsIri; bind supplied tie bytes before termRegex with ^[0-9A-Fa-f]{64}$."
msgstr "在 termIsIri 之前连接现有所选分数与 appliedScoreCandidate；在 termRegex 及 ^[0-9A-Fa-f]{64}$ 之前绑定所提供的并列消解字节。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AppliedOrderEntryIdentityLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Public Fused omits tie bytes. Actual subject-byte association and terminal whole-byte ordering evidence remain required at import; missing proof fails the complete selected account."
msgstr "公开 Fused 不提供并列消解字节。实际主体与字节关联及末尾全字节排序证据仍是必需的导入条件；缺失证明使完整所选报告失败。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AppliedOrderEntryIdentityLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped example: A fictional entry with missing actual tie bytes cannot import as a complete native order by substituting an IRI string or output index."
msgstr "虚构限定示例：一个缺失实际并列消解字节的虚构条目，不能以 IRI 字符串或输出索引替代这些字节而导入为完整原生顺序。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AppliedOrderTierEvidenceLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "applied order tier evidence law"
msgstr "已应用排序层级证据定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AppliedOrderTierEvidenceLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Declared tier state coheres with a conditional u32 label equal to the minimum selected binding among the complete actual qualified matched predicates; no-probe cases carry no invented matched inventory."
msgstr "已声明层级状态与条件性 u32 标签一致，该标签等于完整实际、具备限定依据的匹配谓词中所选映射的最小值；未探查情形不携带虚构匹配清单。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AppliedOrderTierEvidenceLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to preserve declared and undeclared behavior, including the maximum declared u32 label."
msgstr "用于保留已声明及未声明行为，包括最大已声明 u32 标签。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AppliedOrderTierEvidenceLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid using a missing-label sentinel, importing unavailable matching evidence as empty or choosing unrelated or incompletely qualified subject predicates."
msgstr "避免使用缺失标签哨兵、将不可获得的匹配证据作为空集合导入，或选择无关或限定依据不完整的主体谓词。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AppliedOrderTierEvidenceLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Require a tier for true and forbid it for false; true selects a retained matched binding with equal stored label, false forbids mapped matches, and the stored declared label is no greater than every matched selected label."
msgstr "true 要求层级，false 禁止层级；true 选择一个保留的匹配映射，其标签与存储值相等，false 禁止谓词已映射的匹配，且已存储声明标签不大于每个已匹配的所选标签。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AppliedOrderTierEvidenceLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Every witness requires a content criterion with nonempty mappings, but its particular predicate may be unmapped. Empty mappings skip probing. Actual applicable lexical failures reject full import; nonlexical string equality independently establishes a pair."
msgstr "每个见证都要求内容准则具有非空映射，但其具体谓词可以未映射。空映射跳过探查。实际适用词法失败会拒绝完整导入；非词法字符串相等本身即可确立一对匹配。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AppliedOrderTierEvidenceLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped example: A fictional declared tier 4294967295 still precedes undeclared, and a stored tier above another actually matched mapped label fails the minimum law."
msgstr "虚构限定示例：虚构已声明层级 4294967295 仍先于未声明状态；若存储层级高于另一个实际匹配的映射标签，则违反最小值定律。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AppliedOrderMatchedWitnessLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "applied order matched witness law"
msgstr "已应用排序匹配见证定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AppliedOrderMatchedWitnessLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Each typed qualified matched-pair witness has one actual output-entry owner, an IRI predicate and a vault in that account’s selected activation roster."
msgstr "每个带类型且具备限定依据的匹配对见证，具有一个实际输出条目所属者、一个 IRI 谓词及一个属于该报告所选激活清单的库。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AppliedOrderMatchedWitnessLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to preserve all-selected-service matching scope and original lexical evidence without inventing claim identities."
msgstr "用于保留所有所选服务的匹配作用域及原始词法证据，不虚构断言身份。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AppliedOrderMatchedWitnessLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid requiring candidate-found vault membership, equating tier graph reads with activation snapshot content or merging supplied repeated lexical pairs."
msgstr "避免要求属于候选项发现库集合、将层级图读取等同于激活快照内容，或合并所提供的重复词法对。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AppliedOrderMatchedWitnessLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Require incoming typed entry existence and unique ownership, test the bound predicate with termIsIri and join the actual witness vault to the same account’s selected roster."
msgstr "要求存在通过传入关联连接的带类型条目且所属唯一，用 termIsIri 检验已绑定谓词，并将实际见证库连接至同一报告的所选清单。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AppliedOrderMatchedWitnessLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The vault link identifies source scope only. Actual same-call graph-read association and complete applicable matching evidence are import requirements; original datatype, language, direction and claim identity are not reconstructed."
msgstr "库关联仅标识来源作用域。实际同次调用的图读取关联及完整适用匹配证据是导入要求；不重建原始数据类型、语言、方向或断言身份。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AppliedOrderMatchedWitnessLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped example: A fictional witness from selected vault B may justify a tier even when the candidate was found only in vault A; B’s activation snapshot is not its graph-read evidence."
msgstr "虚构限定示例：来自所选库 B 的虚构见证可以证明某个层级，即使候选项仅在库 A 中被发现；B 的激活快照不是其图读取证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AppliedOrderNumericPrecedenceLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "applied order numeric precedence law"
msgstr "已应用排序数值优先顺序定律"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AppliedOrderNumericPrecedenceLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Actual output ordinals preserve inspected native decisive tier, selected activation and score comparisons under value-equal preceding native keys."
msgstr "当先前原生键按值相等时，实际输出序号保留所检查的原生层级、所选激活及分数的决定性比较顺序。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AppliedOrderNumericPrecedenceLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to check finite numeric decisiveness while retaining the actual source terminal tie evidence separately."
msgstr "用于检查有限的数值决定关系，同时独立保留实际来源末尾并列消解证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AppliedOrderNumericPrecedenceLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid introducing a generic earlier-key interpreter, sharing one RDF literal variable across Boolean or numeric edges, or treating numeric checks as whole-sort certification."
msgstr "避免引入通用先前键解释器、在布尔或数值边之间共用同一个 RDF 字面量变量，或将数值检查视为完整排序认证。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AppliedOrderNumericPrecedenceLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Declared precedes undeclared and lower declared tier precedes higher directly; greater activation follows value-equal tier state, while greater score follows value-equal tier state and equal selected activation values."
msgstr "已声明直接先于未声明，较低已声明层级直接先于较高层级；层级状态按值相等后，较大激活优先；层级状态按值相等且所选激活值相等后，较大分数优先。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AppliedOrderNumericPrecedenceLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Bind both stored Booleans and all compared magnitudes independently before termEqual or termLess. Legal Boolean and numeric lexical aliases remain value-equivalent. Disabled activation creates no zero Quantity; exact byte ordering and source authenticity remain strict import evidence."
msgstr "在 termEqual 或 termLess 之前，独立绑定两个已存储布尔值及所有待比较量值。合法的布尔及数值词法别名仍按值等价。禁用激活不创建零 Quantity；精确字节顺序及来源真实性仍是严格必需的导入证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AppliedOrderNumericPrecedenceLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Fictional scoped example: A fictional same-tier pair with opposed score and activation preferences follows activation first under this native account; the requested score-first definition remains distinct."
msgstr "虚构限定示例：同层级的虚构候选对若分数与激活偏好相反，在此原生报告下优先依据激活；请求的分数优先定义仍与之不同。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/SparqlSelectionCanonicalization|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "SPARQL Selection Canonicalization"
msgstr "SPARQL 选择规范化方案"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/SparqlSelectionCanonicalization|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "An information object specifying an actual versioned recipe for normalizing a parsed SPARQL selection and serializing and encoding its canonical byte preimage."
msgstr "一个信息对象，规定实际的带版本方案，用于规范化已解析的 SPARQL 选择，并序列化和编码其规范字节原像。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/SparqlSelectionCanonicalization|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The recipe must give the same canonical byte preimage to query texts differing only in comments, insignificant whitespace or prefix names when equivalent PREFIX, BASE and relative-IRI resolution yields the same parsed bindings. It preserves significant literal whitespace and content and the actual parsed bindings. It specifies actual parsed-query normalization, canonical serialization and byte encoding, but declares no installed canonicalizer and certifies no execution, verification or general semantic query equivalence."
msgstr "当等价的 PREFIX、BASE 和相对 IRI 解析产生相同的已解析绑定时，对于仅注释、无意义空白或前缀名称不同的查询文本，方案必须给出相同的规范字节原像。方案保留字面量中有意义的空白和内容，以及实际的已解析绑定。方案规定实际的已解析查询规范化、规范序列化和字节编码，但不声明已安装的规范化器，也不认证执行、验证或一般查询语义等价性。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/SparqlSelectionCanonicalization|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A consumer records its actual named normalization recipe and the exact version declared by its source."
msgstr "消费者记录其实际命名的规范化方案及来源声明的确切版本。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/SparqlSelectionCanonicalization|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when the source supplies a real SPARQL selection canonicalization recipe."
msgstr "用于来源提供实际的 SPARQL 选择规范化方案时。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/SparqlSelectionCanonicalization|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inventing a profile instance, version, canonical byte sequence or implementation, or substituting a Unicode surface profile or expression-only procedure."
msgstr "避免编造配置实例、版本、规范字节序列或实现，或替换为 Unicode 表层配置或仅适用于表达式的过程。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/SparqlSelectionCanonicalization|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Keep the actual recipe IRI and exactly one supplied xsd:string or xsd:token version. Retain the recipe’s full normalization and byte-production rules without claiming they ran."
msgstr "保留实际方案 IRI 及恰好一个来源提供的 xsd:string 或 xsd:token 版本。保留完整的规范化和字节生成规则，不声称已执行这些规则。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/selectionCanonicalizationVersion|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "selection canonicalization version"
msgstr "选择规范化版本"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/selectionCanonicalizationVersion|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The exact supplied version of this SparqlSelectionCanonicalization recipe, retained with its original xsd:string or xsd:token datatype and lexical form."
msgstr "此 SparqlSelectionCanonicalization 方案的来源所提供的确切版本，保留其原始 xsd:string 或 xsd:token 数据类型及词法形式。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/selectionCanonicalizationVersion|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Exactly one supplied version is required per recipe. Equal-looking string and token literals are not silently identified or rewritten."
msgstr "每个方案必须恰有一个来源提供的版本。看似相同的字符串和词元字面量不会被静默等同或改写。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/selectionCanonicalizationVersion|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A source’s recipe version remains a token when the source supplies a token, without conversion to a string."
msgstr "来源将方案版本提供为词元时，该版本保持词元，不转换为字符串。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/selectionCanonicalizationVersion|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use for the version actually declared for the named recipe."
msgstr "用于实际为命名方案声明的版本。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/selectionCanonicalizationVersion|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid deriving a version from a digest, date, implementation build or query text when the source did not declare it."
msgstr "避免在来源未声明版本时，从摘要、日期、实现构建或查询文本推导版本。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/selectionCanonicalizationVersion|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain exactly one supplied literal on the recipe, preserving its complete RDF term identity for the comparison key."
msgstr "在方案上保留恰好一个来源提供的字面量，为比较键保留其完整 RDF 项身份。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/selectionCanonicalization|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "selection canonicalization"
msgstr "选择规范化"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/selectionCanonicalization|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The actual named SparqlSelectionCanonicalization recipe selected for this source- and context-specific SparqlSelectionLeaf description."
msgstr "为此特定来源和上下文的 SparqlSelectionLeaf 描述选定的实际命名 SparqlSelectionCanonicalization 方案。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/selectionCanonicalization|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The role is optional and has at most one recipe per leaf description. Coequal recipes require distinct actually sourced descriptions; this flat shape cannot pair several recipes and digests on the same leaf."
msgstr "此关系可选，每个叶描述至多关联一个方案。同等地位的多个方案需要不同且实际有来源的描述；此扁平结构无法在同一叶上配对多个方案及摘要。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/selectionCanonicalization|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Two sources supply distinct leaf descriptions using different real recipes; neither recipe is made globally preferred."
msgstr "两个来源提供使用不同实际方案的不同叶描述；任何方案都不被设为全局首选。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/selectionCanonicalization|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when the source declares the canonicalization recipe for this exact leaf description."
msgstr "用于来源声明此确切叶描述的规范化方案时。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/selectionCanonicalization|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid multiple recipes on one leaf, fabricated copies or aliases of a leaf, and automatic preferred-recipe selection."
msgstr "避免在同一叶上使用多个方案、编造叶副本或别名，以及自动选择首选方案。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/selectionCanonicalization|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Link at most one actual recipe IRI, retain its supplied version and preserve the original selectionText, selectionLanguage, dataset and context."
msgstr "至多连接一个实际方案 IRI，保留其来源提供的版本，以及原始 selectionText、selectionLanguage、数据集和上下文。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/selectionCanonicalDigest|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "selection canonical digest"
msgstr "选择规范摘要"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/selectionCanonicalDigest|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A supplied algorithm-typed digest of the canonical byte preimage defined by this leaf description’s actual named and versioned selection canonicalization recipe."
msgstr "来源提供的带算法类型摘要，其规范字节原像由此叶描述实际命名且带版本的选择规范化方案规定。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/selectionCanonicalDigest|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "This optional, nonfunctional role admits BLAKE3-256, SHA-256 and MD5 literals under the same selected recipe. It is not contentDigest of the verbatim query text and certifies neither hash computation nor collision-free identity."
msgstr "此可选且非函数式的关系接受同一选定方案下的 BLAKE3-256、SHA-256 和 MD5 字面量。它不是原始查询文本的 contentDigest，也不认证哈希计算或无碰撞身份。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/selectionCanonicalDigest|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A consumer retains supplied BLAKE3-256 and SHA-256 digests of the same recipe-defined byte preimage without merging their algorithm identities."
msgstr "消费者保留来源提供、针对同一方案所规定字节原像的 BLAKE3-256 和 SHA-256 摘要，不合并算法身份。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/selectionCanonicalDigest|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when the source supplies a digest together with its actual named recipe and supplied version."
msgstr "用于来源同时提供摘要、实际命名方案及所提供版本时。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/selectionCanonicalDigest|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid bare generic hexBinary, inferred algorithms, raw-text hashes, unpaired recipe claims or treating a digest match as semantic or execution identity."
msgstr "避免使用无算法类型的通用 hexBinary、推断算法、原始文本哈希、未配对的方案声明，或将摘要匹配视为语义或执行身份。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/selectionCanonicalDigest|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Keep the supplied algorithm datatype and lowercase hexadecimal literal unchanged: 64 digits for blake3_256Digest or sha256Digest, 32 for md5Digest. Compare the recipe IRI, exact supplied version and complete typed digest together."
msgstr "原样保留来源提供的算法数据类型及小写十六进制字面量：blake3_256Digest 或 sha256Digest 为 64 位十六进制字符，md5Digest 为 32 位。比较时将方案 IRI、确切提供的版本和完整带类型摘要共同作为键。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/SelectionCanonicalDigestValueConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Selection canonical digest value constraint"
msgstr "选择规范摘要值约束"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/SelectionCanonicalDigestValueConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Every supplied selectionCanonicalDigest retains an admitted algorithm datatype and bare lowercase hexadecimal digits of its exact width: 64 for BLAKE3-256 or SHA-256, 32 for MD5."
msgstr "每个来源提供的 selectionCanonicalDigest 必须保留允许的算法数据类型及确切长度的无前缀小写十六进制字符：BLAKE3-256 或 SHA-256 为 64 位，MD5 为 32 位。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/SelectionCanonicalDigestValueConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "This is exact supplied-value admission, separate from recipe presence and version requirements. It computes no digest and proves no preimage agreement."
msgstr "此约束对提供值进行确切准入校验，与方案存在性和版本要求分开。它不计算摘要，也不证明原像一致。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/SelectionCanonicalDigestValueConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "The same hexadecimal spelling under BLAKE3-256 and SHA-256 remains two distinct algorithm-typed digest terms."
msgstr "相同十六进制拼写在 BLAKE3-256 和 SHA-256 类型下仍是两个不同的带算法类型摘要项。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/SelectionCanonicalDigestValueConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to admit each supplied canonical selection digest without changing its literal identity."
msgstr "用于在不改变字面量身份的前提下校验每个来源提供的选择规范摘要。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/SelectionCanonicalDigestValueConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid accepting a generic datatype or normalizing uppercase, prefixed or wrong-width input."
msgstr "避免接受通用数据类型，或规范化大写、带前缀或长度错误的输入。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/SelectionCanonicalDigestValueConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Apply the positive selectionCanonicalDigest guard and the exact datatype-component and hexadecimal-pattern alternatives; reject invalid values without rewriting them."
msgstr "应用正向 selectionCanonicalDigest 守卫，以及确切的数据类型分量和十六进制模式备选条件；拒绝无效值，不改写它们。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/SelectionCanonicalDigestValueConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/message"
msgid "Every supplied selectionCanonicalDigest retains an admitted algorithm datatype and bare lowercase hexadecimal digits of its exact width: 64 for BLAKE3-256 or SHA-256, 32 for MD5."
msgstr "每个来源提供的 selectionCanonicalDigest 必须保留允许的算法数据类型及确切长度的无前缀小写十六进制字符：BLAKE3-256 或 SHA-256 为 64 位，MD5 为 32 位。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/SelectionCanonicalizationBindingConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Selection canonicalization binding constraint"
msgstr "选择规范化绑定约束"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/SelectionCanonicalizationBindingConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Every supplied selectionCanonicalDigest has an actual selectionCanonicalization companion, and every supplied companion is a named recipe IRI."
msgstr "每个来源提供的 selectionCanonicalDigest 必须有实际的 selectionCanonicalization 配套关系，且每个提供的配套方案必须是命名方案 IRI。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/SelectionCanonicalizationBindingConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Recipe class, exact supplied version and leaf-local at-most-one obligations are validated separately. This constraint invents no recipe and selects no default."
msgstr "方案类型、确切提供的版本及每叶至多一个方案的义务另行校验。此约束不编造方案，也不选择默认值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/SelectionCanonicalizationBindingConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A digest without its actual named recipe is rejected rather than paired with a guessed canonicalization scheme."
msgstr "摘要若缺少其实际命名方案，会被拒绝，不会与猜测的规范化方案配对。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/SelectionCanonicalizationBindingConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to require the real recipe companion of a supplied canonical selection digest."
msgstr "用于要求所提供选择规范摘要具有实际配套方案。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/SelectionCanonicalizationBindingConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid filling missing companions with synthetic profiles, blank-node identities, source aliases or a globally preferred recipe."
msgstr "避免使用合成配置、空白节点身份、来源别名或全局首选方案填补缺失的配套方案。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/SelectionCanonicalizationBindingConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Use the outer leaf-type guard and independent positive digest and companion guards; retain the actual named recipe and its source-declared version."
msgstr "使用外层叶类型守卫，以及独立的正向摘要和配套方案守卫；保留实际命名方案及其来源声明的版本。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/SelectionCanonicalizationBindingConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/message"
msgid "Every supplied selectionCanonicalDigest has an actual selectionCanonicalization companion, and every supplied companion is a named recipe IRI."
msgstr "每个来源提供的 selectionCanonicalDigest 必须有实际的 selectionCanonicalization 配套关系，且每个提供的配套方案必须是命名方案 IRI。"
